ays Robert Cyran of Reuters Breakingviews. But the intervention may intensify antitrust objections to Sprint’s rival offer.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/08/01/iliads-flaky-offer-for-t-mobile-us/', 'snippet': 'The French upstart’s bid premium relies on improbable synergies, says Robert Cyran of Reuters Breakingviews. But the intervention may intensify antitrust objections to Sprint’s rival offer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Iliad has delivered what could be a Trojan horse for Sprint’s plans to buy T-Mobile US. In a rival approach, the $16 billion French telcommunications company has offered $33 a share, or $15 billion, for 57 percent of the No. 4 U.S. mobile operator. It’s a flaky offer on several levels. But the intervention may intensify antitrust objections to Sprint’s wish to merge.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-tmobile-iliad/dbpix-tmobile-iliad-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1003, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-tmobile-iliad/dbpix-tmobile-iliad-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1003}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-tmobile-iliad/dbpix-tmobile-iliad-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 613, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-tmobile-iliad/dbpix-tmobile-iliad-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1226, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-tmobile-iliad/dbpix-tmobile-iliad-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'widt