Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-01T13:00:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bakalar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4d3598c-0e58-5dd9-97ee-14ab0fc21e84', 'word_count': 518, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4d3598c-0e58-5dd9-97ee-14ab0fc21e84'}, {'abstract': 'The Paris-based designer and his studio director and partner Sarah-Linh Tran walk T through the unique process of creating their fall carryalls.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/01/christophe-lemaire-leather-bags-sarah-linh-tran/', 'snippet': 'The Paris-based designer and his studio director and partner Sarah-Linh Tran walk T through the unique process of creating their fall carryalls.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even two-plus decades into his distinguished and varied fashion career, the Paris-based designer Christophe Lemaire\xa0is still very much a man of the moment. He recently stepped down from his post as the artistic director at Hermès to focus on his own namesake line, which embodies fashion’s tilt toward discretion while maintaining its own specifically French brand of chic. As it has grown in renown, Sarah-Linh Tran, Lemaire’s studio director, muse and partner, has also become more prominent, reliably appearing on tastemakers’ Pinterest and Tumblr feeds. The two met eight years ago, when Tran was still a student and Lemaire was just restarting his business. “Very naturally, very quickly, we discovered that we had a certain sensitivity and complicity about aesthetics and style and art and movies,” Lemaire says. “And very naturally, we ended up doing what everybody said we shouldn’t do: work together.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/31/t-magazine/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/07/31/t-magazine/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/31/t-magazine/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/31/t-magazine/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 854, 'width': 1281, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/31/t-magazine/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/07/31/t-magazine/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/31/t-magazine/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4/01lemaire-hartman-slide-YYE4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Making Of | Christophe Lemaire’s Striking, Sculptural Leather Bags', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 's