{'abstract': 'The offer price of $83.30 in cash a share represents a 38 percent premium to Bally’s closing stock price on Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/08/01/scientific-games-to-buy-slot-machine-maker-bally-for-3-3-billion/', 'snippet': 'The offer price of $83.30 in cash a share represents a 38 percent premium to Bally’s closing stock price on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Scientific Games said Friday that it would buy the slot-machine maker Bally Technologies for $3.3 billion in cash.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-bally-2/dbpix-bally-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-bally-2/dbpix-bally-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-bally-2/dbpix-bally-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-bally-2/dbpix-bally-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-bally-2/dbpix-bally-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-bally-2/dbpix-bally-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/business/dbpix-bally-2/dbpix-