o think of everything, I had failed to pack my own necessities. Two hours into one of the most important days of my life, I suffered an excruciating case of the munchies.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/30/us/motherlode-delivery-room/motherlode-delivery-room-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/07/30/us/motherlode-delivery-room/motherlode-delivery-room-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/30/us/motherlode-delivery-room/motherlode-delivery-room-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 837, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/30/us/motherlode-delivery-room/motherlode-delivery-room-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 837, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/30/us/motherlode-delivery-room/motherlode-delivery-room-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/07/30/us/motherlode-delivery-room/motherlode-delivery-room-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/30/us/motherlode-delivery-room/motherlode-delivery-room-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Expect When You Shouldn’t Expect Lunch: A Dad’s Guide to Delivery Day', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-01T13:10:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Methven', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Methven', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31c276dd-0513-56fb-93d7-9b809bcabed4', 'word_count': 712, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31c276dd-0513-56fb-93d7-9b809bcabed4'}, {'abstract': 'Cambridge University has digitized 4,100 handwritten pages of notes by the British wartime poet Siegfried Sassoon and has made them available free online.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/02/books/siegfried-sassoons-world-war-i-diaries-become-available-online.html', 'snippet': 'Cambridge University has digitized 4,100 handwritten pages of notes by the British wartime poet Siegfried Sassoon and has made them available free online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — He yearned for “a genuine taste of the horrors.” He never thought he would become a great poet, and if it were “not for mother and friends” he would pray for a “speedy death.” In a place of war, he wrote, “I never thought to find such peace.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/01/arts/design/POETRY2/POETRY2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 948, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/01/arts/design/POETRY2/POETRY2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewi