d of migrant children coming across the border.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — House Republicans emerged from a closed-door emergency meeting Friday morning largely unified over how to handle the flood of tens of thousands of young migrant children from Central America pouring over the nation’s southern border.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'House Republicans Agree on Border Measures', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-01T16:11:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/42294905-cf60-5b3d-8973-abe061c6b3c6', 'word_count': 608, 'uri': 'nyt://article/42294905-cf60-5b3d-8973-abe061c6b3c6'}, {'abstract': 'The company is facing investor pressure to pare its product lineup and trim costs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/02/business/procter-gamble-to-drop-up-to-100-brands.html', 'snippet': 'The company is facing investor pressure to pare its product lineup and trim costs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After years of expansion into areas like pet food and beauty products, Procter & Gamble announced on Friday that it would cut as many as 100 brands from its arsenal to focus on ot