aragraph': 'After dinner one late spring Wednesday, the regulars assembled at the HiFi Bar. A gathering of musician-bartender types and their much taller girlfriends, all in the classic East Village uniform of worn leather jackets and slim, dark pants, leaned against the far corner of the bar, sipping cocktails. At a series of low, round tables, holdovers from the post-work happy-hour crowd, in button-downs and good shoes, laughed loudly, faces flushed, while they finished up their final pints. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The HiFi Bar in the East Village Has Rock Credentials', 'kicker': 'Neighborhood Joint', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Last Indie Dive Standing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goodman, Lizzy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HiFi Bar (Manhattan, NY, Bar)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Village (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-01T20:45:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lizzy Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lizzy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9251339c-164c-5f8c-934e-bdc5273fa703', 'word_count': 646, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9251339c-164c-5f8c-934e-bdc5273fa703'}, {'abstract': 'Now that’s talent.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/01/friday-night-music-sarah-jarosz-over-the-edge/', 'snippet': 'Now that’s talent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Haven’t posted anything by this group for a while; but 