: 'Impeachment Julep', 'kicker': 'Upshot With a Twist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Impeachment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocktails', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-01T21:02:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Irwin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Irwin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f73a0b1-4f7d-5075-9706-551ec8755a3c', 'word_count': 333, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f73a0b1-4f7d-5075-9706-551ec8755a3c'}, {'abstract': 'How Dale Jamieson, who runs the Animal Studies Initiative at New York University, spends his Sundays.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/03/nyregion/the-best-of-west-and-east.html', 'snippet': 'How Dale Jamieson, who runs the Animal Studies Initiative at New York University, spends his Sundays.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dale Jamieson, who runs the Animal Studies Initiative at New York University, has a very silly laugh, and it can be welcome sonic accompaniment when he talks about the destruction of the planet. His most recent book, “Reason in a Dark Time: Why the Struggle to Stop Climate Change Failed — and What It Means For Our Future,” is a stormy read for hurricane season. Mr. Jamieson, 66, is also a professor of environmental studies, philosophy and law. You could say that bummer is his business. “The whole presupposition is that we failed to solve this problem,” he said. ”Now how are we going to suck it up and go on despite the failure?” Cue the silly laugh. Mr. Jamieson lives in I. M. Pei-designed faculty housing with Chun-Mei Li when she is in the United States; based in Shanghai, she runs women’s and children’s health programs in Asia and Africa for Johnson & Johnson.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/nyregion/03ROUTINE1/03ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/03/nyregion/03ROUTINE1/03ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/nyregion/03ROUTINE1/03ROUTINE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/nyregion/03ROUTINE1/03ROUTINE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/nyregion/03ROUTINE1/03ROUTINE1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/03/nyregion/03ROUTINE1/03ROUTINE1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/nyregion/03ROUTINE1/03ROUTINE1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Best of West and East', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Best of West and East', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jamieson, Dale', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York University', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name