ce': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/arts/outlander/outlander-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 453, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/02/arts/outlander/outlander-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 453}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/arts/outlander/outlander-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 773, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/arts/outlander/outlander-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1195, 'width': 1584, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/arts/outlander/outlander-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/02/arts/outlander/outlander-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/arts/outlander/outlander-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Highland Fling Would Not Be Unexpected Here', 'kicker': 'Television Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Highland Fling Would Not Be Unexpected Here', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Starz', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Balfe, Caitriona', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Outlander (Book)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gabaldon, Diana', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Outlander (TV Program)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-01T21:36:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b099038-cd9f-5204-b857-cb1171b0bb72', 'word_count': 399, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b099038-cd9f-5204-b857-cb1171b0bb72'}, {'abstract': 'With curving arms, tilting balances and crisp footwork, the Dance Theater of Harlem’s members took to the stage on Thursday at the Prospect Park Bandshell.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/02/arts/dance/dance-theater-of-harlem-comes-to-celebrate-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'With curving arms, tilting balances and crisp footwork, the Dance Theater of Harlem’s members took to the stage on Thursday at the Prospect Park Bandshell.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alvin Ailey’s 1972 work “The Lark Ascending,” set to romantic music by Ralph Vaughan Williams, begins not with the image of a light, fluttering bird, but with a male dancer poised on his knees with outstretched arms. His face wears a look of reverie; could he be dreaming of his lark? Other dancers cross his path: Four men move in lunging unison walks, while a couple breeze past in jumps and lifts that impart jubilance. Finally, the lark appears. Springing through the air in grand jetés, she soars. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/arts/02BYRDREEF/02BYRDREEF-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420,