'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/01/business/jobs-0802-1406934931822/jobs-0802-1406934931822-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Labor Picture in July', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-02T01:21:50+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Business Day', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/10fedf1b-6d49-506d-a233-f3ee100b8050', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/10fedf1b-6d49-506d-a233-f3ee100b8050'}, {'abstract': 'Not every ballplayer is Derek Jeter. When you stay in one city for most of your career but then elect to leave, that is seen as a kind of treason.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/02/opinion/head-for-home.html', 'snippet': 'Not every ballplayer is Derek Jeter. When you stay in one city for most of your career but then elect to leave, that is seen as a kind of treason.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is one of the fundamental rules of baseball. To score, a runner must step on home. When a hitter leaves the batter’s box after making contact, he knows exactly where he is going. He runs with certainty, guided by the white lines and the white bases, circling in the hope that he will arrive safely at the same place from where he departed. Runners operate on instinct: They must get home. And the efficiency with which they round those bases, often with the help of others, is a matter of winning or losing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/Glanville-contributor/Glanville-contributor-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 242, 'width': 203, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/Glanville-contributor/Glanville-contributor-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 242, 'width': 203, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/Glanville-contributor/Glanville-contributor-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/Glanville-contributor/Glanville-contributor-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/Glanville-contributor/Glanville-contributor-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Head for Home', 'kicker': 'Contributing Op-Ed Writer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rollins, Jimmy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maddux, Greg', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-02T01:23:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Doug Glanville', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Doug', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glanville', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_materi