93c2-539a-94db-219e5364c6e3'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Halmi had already had a career as a photographer for Life magazine when he became a producer of TV mini-series like “Lonesome Dove,” “In Cold Blood” and “Don Quixote.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/02/arts/television/robert-halmi-90-producer-of-tv-films-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Halmi had already had a career as a photographer for Life magazine when he became a producer of TV mini-series like “Lonesome Dove,” “In Cold Blood” and “Don Quixote.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert Halmi Sr., a Hungarian-born, adventure-loving photographer for Life and other magazines who in a second career after age 50 became one of television’s most prolific producers of movies and mini-series, often adapted from literature, died on Wednesday in Manhattan. He was 90.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/arts/dog-Halmi-obit/dog-Halmi-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/03/arts/dog-Halmi-obit/dog-Halmi-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/arts/dog-Halmi-obit/dog-Halmi-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/arts/dog-Halmi-obit/dog-Halmi-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1164, 'width': 1733, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/arts/dog-Halmi-obit/dog-Halmi-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't