1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/694d8f87-de5f-5a7e-8ea1-8eddfad4a597', 'word_count': 1011, 'uri': 'nyt://article/694d8f87-de5f-5a7e-8ea1-8eddfad4a597'}, {'abstract': 'Celebrities dot New York State’s list of those who have never claimed money totaling billions from forgotten savings accounts, security deposits and the like.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/02/nyregion/a-mound-of-forgotten-money-and-even-you-may-have-a-claim.html', 'snippet': 'Celebrities dot New York State’s list of those who have never claimed money totaling billions from forgotten savings accounts, security deposits and the like.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For years, Jerry Seinfeld and Joan Rivers, and as many as 6,914 other customers, have never claimed refunds due them from Bergdorf’s. General Motors has been in hock to Rupert Murdoch for nearly a decade. Russia’s mission to the United Nations is still hoarding unredeemed gift certificates from BJ’s Wholesale Club.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/nyregion/02UNCLAIMED_COMBO/02UNCLAIMED_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 222, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/02/nyregion/02UNCLAIMED_COMBO/02UNCLAIMED_COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 222}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/nyregion/02UNCLAIMED_COMBO/02UNCLAIMED_COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/02/nyregion/02UNCLAIMED_COMBO/02UNCLAIMED_COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 759, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo',