ame': 'glocations', 'value': 'Crested Butte (Colo)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gunnison (Colo)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-02T16:48:20+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Opinion', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'Elaine McMillion Sheldon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elaine', 'middlename': 'Mcmillion', 'lastname': 'Sheldon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/49d603ce-c271-59f4-9ace-ae41d6f08e5e', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/49d603ce-c271-59f4-9ace-ae41d6f08e5e'}, {'abstract': 'In Colorado, one town might embrace cannabis stores while another posts a keep-out sign. But on one thing they agree: leave your stoner humor at home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/03/opinion/sunday/high-time-in-the-rockies-a-chill-marijuana-debate.html', 'snippet': 'In Colorado, one town might embrace cannabis stores while another posts a keep-out sign. But on one thing they agree: leave your stoner humor at home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GUNNISON, Colo. — Getting a feel for Gunnison, Colo., a town in the Rockies about four and a half hours southwest of Denver, takes a bicycle and a few minutes. On Main Street and nearby blocks you will pass a Wal-Mart, a pizza place called Pie-Zans, a bike-repair-and-espresso shop, the offices of The Gunnison Country Times, the campus of Western State Colorado University and Traders Rendezvous, which claims to have the state’s largest collection of antlers and mounted animal trophies. Ride long enough and you will find seven churches and five liquor stores, six if you count the Safeway.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'High in the Rockies, a Chill Marijuana Debate \u200b', 'kicker': 'Editorial Observer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'High in the Rockies, a Chill Debate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Downes, Lawrence', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Crested Butte (Colo)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gunnison (Colo)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-02T16:52:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lawrence Downes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lawrence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Downes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/913cfd70-3405-51c9-99a5-eef5c5e4c2aa', 'word_count': 889, 'uri': 'nyt://article/913cfd70-3405-51c9-99a5-eef5c5e4c2aa'}, {'abstract': 'The state is showing that legalization can work, though there are still kinks to be figured out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/03/opinion/sunday/high-time-the-great-colorado-weed-experiment.html', 'snippet': 'The state is showing that legalization can work, though there are still kinks to be figured out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In January, Colorado defied the federal government and stepped with both feet into the world of legal recreational marijuana, where no state had gone before.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/opinion/sunday/marijuana-colorado/marijuana-colorado-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/03/opinion/sunday/marijuana-colorado/marijuana-colorado-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/opinion/sunday/marijuana-colorado/marijuana-colorado-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/opinion/sunday/marijuana-colorado/marijuana-colorado-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1170, 'width': 1170, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/opinion/sunday/marijuana-colorado/marijuana-colorado-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/03/opinion/sunday/marijuana-colorado/marijuana-colorado-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/03/opinion/sunday/marijuana-colorado/marijuana-colorado-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Great Colorado Weed Experiment', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Great Colorado Weed Experiment', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Downes, Lawrence', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank'