 of people reported missing on Sunday night, the death toll was expected to rise.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Earthquake Kills Hundreds in Southwest China', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Strong Quake Strikes China in Southwest; Hundreds Die', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jacobs, Andrew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Earthquakes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yunnan Province (China)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-03T17:23:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Jacobs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jacobs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8d6d219-9d1b-5c95-b8fb-222a5dd5a705', 'word_count': 579, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8d6d219-9d1b-5c95-b8fb-222a5dd5a705'}, {'abstract': 'The film took in an estimated $94 million at North American movie theaters for the third-highest opening of the year.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/03/guardians-of-the-galaxy-leads-weekend-box-office/', 'snippet': 'The film took in an estimated $94 million at North American movie theaters for the third-highest opening of the year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the seventh time in 19 weeks, a Marvel movie was a huge No. 1 at the North American box office. “Guardians of the Galaxy,” about the galactic adventures of a quirky group of obscure comics characters, including a machine-gun-toting raccoon and a grunting plant-person named Groot, took in an estimated $94 million, the third-highest movie opening of the year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/arts/guardians/guardians-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/04/arts/guardians/guardians-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/arts/guardians/guardians-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 639, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/arts/guardians/guardians-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1031, 'width': 1652, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/arts/guardians/guardians-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/04/arts/guardians/guardians-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/arts/guardians/guardians-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Guardians of the Galaxy’ Leads Weekend Box Office', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rentrak Corp', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walt Disn