trade-talks-suffer-another-setback.html', 'snippet': 'India’s veto of a W.T.O. agreement on customs rules will erode confidence in the global trading system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The collapse last week of a global trade agreement on simplifying customs rules will make it much harder for the World Trade Organization to finish its much-delayed Doha round of negotiations, which has a much broader agenda to lower tariffs and reduce barriers to trade. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Global Trade Talks Suffer Another Setback', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Global Trade Talks Suffer Another Setback', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Trade Organization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crop Controls and Subsidies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-04T00:53:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/c7beac0d-f088-5675-a0f7-3a96b77e6444', 'word_count': 549, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c7beac0d-f088-5675-a0f7-3a96b77e6444'}, {'abstract': 'These days, a candidate is committing political malpractice without a super PAC raking in unlimited donations (often from mom and dad). Is this bribery run amok?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/04/opinion/the-custom-made-super-pac-.html', 'snippet': 'These days, a candidate is committing political malpractice without a super PAC raking in unlimited donations (often from mom and dad). Is this bribery run amok?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Attention, parents of political candidates. There is now a way to spend an unlimited amount on your child’s campaign for Congress, completely ignoring that annoying $2,600 legal limit on what you can give. All you do is set up a “super PAC” for your kid and start writing checks. It’s not much harder than that 529 account you used for the same kid’s college education.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Custom-Made ‘Super PAC’', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Custom-Made ‘Super PAC’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2014)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, State Legislature', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Action Committees', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-04T00:57:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/cdb2985a-2b7f-5a4a-b5bb-0