obry in a documentary drama about living as a Jew during the Holocaust.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/04/theater/the-good-and-the-true-recounts-the-holocaust.html', 'snippet': 'Daniel Hrbek intertwines the stories of the actress Hana Pravda and the athlete Milos Dobry in a documentary drama about living as a Jew during the Holocaust.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Milos Dobry and Hana Pravda have apparently never met. Possibly Milos saw one of Hana’s early films, like “Marijka the Unfaithful.” Maybe she strolled past a Prague soccer field where Milos made save after save at goal. Or maybe, a few years later — now wretched, terrified, half-starved — they might have crossed paths at Auschwitz. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/theater/04good/04good-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 847, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/04/theater/04good/04good-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 847}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/theater/04good/04good-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 725, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/theater/04good/04good-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1450, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/theater/04good/04good-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/04/theater/04good/04good-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'r