, as a tribute to his teacher, Hideo Saito, will be renamed in honor of Mr. Ozawa, The Japan Times reported. At a news conference in Tokyo on Monday, the festival announced that starting in 2015, the annual summer series will be called the Seiji Ozawa Matsumoto Festival. Its principal ensemble, however, will continue as the Saito Kinen Orchestra.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/arts/04artsbeat-ozawa/04artsbeat-ozawa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/05/arts/04artsbeat-ozawa/04artsbeat-ozawa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 778}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/arts/04artsbeat-ozawa/04artsbeat-ozawa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 791, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/arts/04artsbeat-ozawa/04artsbeat-ozawa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1581, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/arts/04artsbeat-ozawa/04artsbeat-ozawa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/05/arts/04artsbeat-ozawa/04artsbeat-ozawa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/arts/04artsbeat-ozawa/04artsbeat-ozawa-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': 