mobiles/monday-motorsports-earnhardt-sweeps-pocono.html', 'snippet': 'Dale Earnhardt Jr. picked up his third season win, making it two at Pocono; Scott Dixon raced from a 22nd-place start to win the IndyCar race in Ohio.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dale Earnhardt Jr., enjoying his most productive season in a decade, won the 400-mile Nascar Sprint Cup race Sunday at Pocono Raceway in Pennsylvania. Earnhardt, in scoring his third victory this season, got the best of the runner-up Kevin Harvick on a restart, with three laps to go in the 160-lap contest. Harvick had battled back from a midrace stop-and-go penalty for speeding on the pit road that placed him near the rear of the field.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/automobiles/05MOTORSPORTS-image/05MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 356, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/05/automobiles/05MOTORSPORTS-image/05MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 356}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/automobiles/05MOTORSPORTS-image/05MOTORSPORTS-image-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 760, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/automobiles/05MOTORSPORTS-image/05MOTORSPORTS-image-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 760, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/automobiles/05MOTORSPORTS-image/05MOTORSPORTS-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08