elevision highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '8 P.M. (ABC) CMA MUSIC FESTIVAL: COUNTRY’S NIGHT TO ROCK Little Big Town hosts this concert special of highlights from the four-day festival held in Nashville in June. The lineup includes Jason Aldean, Dierks Bentley, Hunter Hayes, Faith Hill, Tim McGraw, Miranda Lambert, Brad Paisley (above), Darius Rucker, Carrie Underwood, Keith Urban, Florida Georgia Line, Rascal Flatts, the Band Perry and the Zac Brown Band.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Tuesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Tuesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-08-05T05:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/25bfc4e7-c3d6-5d37-8ee6-1ad628f552e0', 'word_count': 702, 'uri': 'nyt://article/25bfc4e7-c3d6-5d37-8ee6-1ad628f552e0'}, {'abstract': 'As a 72-hour truce mediated by Egypt took hold, Israel said it had withdrawn its forces from Gaza and Hamas said it would engage in talks on a lasting peace arrangement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/06/world/middleeast/israel-gaza-strip-conflict.html', 'snippet': 'As a 72-hour truce mediated by Egypt took hold, Israel said it had withdrawn its forces from Gaza and Hamas said it would engage in talks on a lasting peace arrangement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — As a 72-hour cease-fire mediated by Egypt took hold on Tuesday, Gazans emerged to view a shattered landscape with Hamas still in power, while Israel began to debate the politics, costs and accomplishments 