one}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56df57bf-f53d-53b1-aa46-504b0d8e7cb9', 'word_count': 593, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56df57bf-f53d-53b1-aa46-504b0d8e7cb9'}, {'abstract': 'Since the 1940s, Democratic presidents have presided over healthier economies than Republican presidents. Whether that actually means anything is another story.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/06/upshot/luck-and-a-little-mystery-the-economy-grows-faster-under-democratic-presidents.html', 'snippet': 'Since the 1940s, Democratic presidents have presided over healthier economies than Republican presidents. Whether that actually means anything is another story.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Though I typically resist, my wife often tries to get me to put down the laptop and enjoy the Zen of gardening with her. So you can imagine her surprise when she returned from a trip to find a beautiful clump of nonwild flowers planted in her garden. She loved the welcome-home gift and was ready to bestow upon me many valuable (and increasingly elusive) good-husband points.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/upshot/06up-president3/06up-president3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/06/upshot/06up-president3/06up-president3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/upshot/06up-president3/06up-president3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/upshot/06up-president3/06up-president3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1324, 'width': 1992, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'l