tingent on a “no” vote.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/06/world/europe/british-parties-try-to-entice-scots.html', 'snippet': 'With about six weeks to go before a referendum on independence, new powers were pledged for the Scottish Parliament, contingent on a “no” vote.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — With little more than six weeks to go before a referendum on independence for Scotland, the main British political parties promised on Tuesday to grant new devolved powers to Scots if they decide to keep their union with the rest of Britain.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British Parties Try to Entice Scots', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain: Parties Try to Entice Scots', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Scotland', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Castle, Stephen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Referendums', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salmond, Alex', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Darling, Alistair', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cameron, David', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-05T10:50:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Castle', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Castle', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/19cbae70-0138-5493-9f41-4483eee8f036', 'word_count': 413, 'uri': 'nyt://article/19cbae70-0138-5493-9f41-4483eee8f036'}, {'abstract': 'A Times science reporter suggests books with “fascinatingly scary information” on the virus that is causing widespread fear and disruption in West Africa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2014/08/05/recommended-reading-on-ebola/', 'snippet': 'A Times science reporter suggests books with “fascinatingly scary information” on the virus that is causing widespread fear and disruption in West Africa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since spring, several countries in West Africa have been affected by the largest Ebola outbreak ever recorded. Denise Grady, a science reporter, has been covering the outbreak for The Times. We asked Denise to suggest reading for those interested in learning more about the disease.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/blogs/ebola/ebola-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/04/blogs/ebola/ebola-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/blogs/ebola/ebola-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/blogs/ebola/ebola-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/04/blogs/ebola/ebola-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/04/blogs/ebola/ebola-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarg