ant hotel alternative and Instagram-ready wedding venue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2006, the developer Jacques Massachi purchased a crumbling Hollywood Victorian near the 101, intending to tear it down. But after he got his demolition permits, preservation groups approached him with several good reasons to save it. The 1904 mansion was one of only two estates remaining of the many that used to line Hollywood Boulevard and had most recently been owned and expanded by Philip and Sylvia Lombardi, who came to L.A. as vocal coaches and composers for vaudeville singers in the 1940s.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/t-magazine/05lombardi-walker-1/05lombardi-walker-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/05/t-magazine/05lombardi-walker-1/05lombardi-walker-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/t-magazine/05lombardi-walker-1/05lombardi-walker-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/t-magazine/05lombardi-walker-1/05lombardi-walker-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/05/t-magazine/05lombardi-walker-1/05lombardi-walker-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/05/t-magazine/05lombardi-walker-1/05lombardi-walker-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 