o open in September at the Rubin Museum of Art.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/05/rubin-museum-show-to-trace-francesco-clementes-indian-inspirations/', 'snippet': '“Francesco Clemente: Inspired by India,” is scheduled to open in September at the Rubin Museum of Art.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Italian artist Francesco Clemente’s works over the past 45 years have morphed through seemingly opposing styles (conceptional and representational, for example) and have touched on the utopian, the erotic and at times the idiosyncratically grotesque. But one current that runs through much of his painting and sculpture has been the influence of Indian culture, mythology, symbolism and art.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-clemente/05artsbeat-clemente-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 839, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-clemente/05artsbeat-clemente-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 839}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-clemente/05artsbeat-clemente-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 733, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-clemente/05artsbeat-clemente-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1210, 'width': 865, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-clemente/05artsbeat-clemente-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbna