e-9c18-737d9c0c4794', 'word_count': 409, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c17f4dd-a8da-516e-9c18-737d9c0c4794'}, {'abstract': 'Ford has been the leading seller of commercial vans in America for more than 30 years. Now, it is offering a new approach to cargo hauling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/06/automobiles/fords-european-van-gets-a-makeover-for-america.html', 'snippet': 'Ford has been the leading seller of commercial vans in America for more than 30 years. Now, it is offering a new approach to cargo hauling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s no secret that the classic American van is on its way out. Since the late 1960s, most full-size van models have been trucklike vehicles with stubby noses, long bodies and relatively low-profile front windshields. The General Motors G-Series and Dodge Ram vans are already gone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/automobiles/06TRANSIT-image1/06TRANSIT-image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/06/automobiles/06TRANSIT-image1/06TRANSIT-image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/automobiles/06TRANSIT-image1/06TRANSIT-image1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 580, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/automobiles/06TRANSIT-image1/06TRANSIT-image1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 1280, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/automobiles/06TRANSIT-image1/06TRANSIT-image1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, '