Boyish Girl Interrupted” show is one of the highlights of the 2014 edition of the New York Comedy Festival, the festival announced on Tuesday. The 2014 edition of the festival, which is presented in association with Comedy Central, will run five days, Nov. 5-9, with competing shows at halls all around Manhattan, leaving comedy fans to make some serious choices.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-tig/05artsbeat-tig-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 810, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-tig/05artsbeat-tig-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 810}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-tig/05artsbeat-tig-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 759, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-tig/05artsbeat-tig-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1910, 'width': 1415, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-tig/05artsbeat-tig-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-tig/05artsbeat-tig-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/arts/05artsbeat-tig/05artsbeat-tig-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headli