h the Supreme Court in coming months.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/06/us/utah-officials-ask-justices-to-hear-appeal-of-ruling-on-gay-marriage-ban.html', 'snippet': 'The appeal is the first of several in same-sex marriage cases likely to reach the Supreme Court in coming months.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Utah officials on Tuesday asked the Supreme Court to hear their appeal of a ruling striking down their state’s ban on same-sex marriage, which voters adopted in 2004. The appeal is the first of several in same-sex marriage cases likely to reach the Supreme Court in coming months, and the justices may agree to hear one or more of them this fall, with a decision by next June. The choice for the Supreme Court, the officials’ petition said, “comes down to this: thousands of couples are unconstitutionally being denied the right to marry, or millions of voters are being disenfranchised of their vote to define marriage.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Utah Officials Ask Justices to Hear Appeal of Ruling on Gay Marriage Ban', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Washington', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Utah Officials Ask Justices to Hear Appeal of Ruling on Gay Marriage Ban', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Utah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-06T00:02:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Liptak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liptak'