-guide-dining-bars-hotels/', 'snippet': 'The Belgian city is poised to host its largest fashion festival to date, which takes place next month. Here, a look at where to eat, shop and stay there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With its experimental architecture, bijou furniture markets and numerous concept galleries and fusion eateries, Antwerp has long been known as Belgium’s capital of cool. The trendy little city, a buzzing hive of creativity, attracts an increasing number of artists, designers and other globetrotters with its thriving avant-garde style scene. This year’s fashion festival, which happens next month, will be the biggest it’s ever been. Here, a sampling of where to hang out in Antwerp this summer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06antwerp-rigg-1/06antwerp-rigg-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06antwerp-rigg-1/06antwerp-rigg-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06antwerp-rigg-1/06antwerp-rigg-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06antwerp-rigg-1/06antwerp-rigg-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06antwerp-rigg-1/06antwerp-rigg-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06