n the wake of two botched executions, the debate surrounding capital punishment is focused on its economic dimensions more than its moral ones.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/06/the-case-against-the-death-penalty-from-the-right/', 'snippet': 'In the wake of two botched executions, the debate surrounding capital punishment is focused on its economic dimensions more than its moral ones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After two botched executions in the United States, the debate over capital punishment has been rekindled — but now with a focus on the cost and effectiveness of the method used to carry it out rather than on its moral legitimacy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/opinion/nyto-budget/nyto-budget-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/06/opinion/nyto-budget/nyto-budget-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/opinion/nyto-budget/nyto-budget-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1013, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/opinion/nyto-budget/nyto-budget-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1486, 'width': 1502, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/opinion/nyto-budget/nyto-budget-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/06/opinion/nyto-budget/nyto-budget-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thu