l all sorts of needs created by the patchwork legalization of marijuana for medical and recreational use across the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/business/smallbusiness/start-ups-seize-marijuana-opportunities-as-big-companies-hold-back.html', 'snippet': 'Small local companies are rushing to fill all sorts of needs created by the patchwork legalization of marijuana for medical and recreational use across the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Garett Fortune’s brother was found to have cancer in early 2013, it was so advanced that all he could do was to try to live out the remainder of his life in as little pain and discomfort as possible. That meant taking about 30 pills a day, Mr. Fortune said — until his brother tried marijuana.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/business/07sbiz-pic1/07sbiz-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 861, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/business/07sbiz-pic1/07sbiz-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 861}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/business/07sbiz-pic1/07sbiz-pic1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 714, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/business/07sbiz-pic1/07sbiz-pic1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1427, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/business/07sbiz-pic1/07sbiz-pic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnai