'snippet': 'Renovations of the Teatro Valle will put an end to a three-year occupation and experiment in self-management by actors, technicians and playwrights.', 'lead_paragraph': ' ROME — The curtain will come down on Sunday on the three-year occupation of the Teatro Valle, putting an end to a self-management experiment that turned the storied theater here into a lively cultural hub.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Occupation of Theater in Rome to End', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Teatro Valle', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rome (Italy)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-06T16:26:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b4b41f7-55e4-5a73-a4ce-935c18fc7f69', 'word_count': 314, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b4b41f7-55e4-5a73-a4ce-935c18fc7f69'}, {'abstract': 'With Italy sinking into a triple-dip recession, it’s worth acknowledging that United States policy makers have gotten it less wrong than many others.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/08/upshot/italys-lost-decade.html', 'snippet': 'With Italy sinking into a triple-dip recession, it’s worth acknowledging that United States policy makers have gotten it less wrong than many others.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s not often that we’re moved to write about the Italian economy. But this morning’s news that it has shrunk for two quarters in a row — meeting a widely used threshold for the declaration of a recession — is worth noting. Italy has sunk into a triple-dip recession.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': "Italy's Lost Decade", 'kicker': 'Another Economic Low', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-06T16:27:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Justin Wolfers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Justin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wolfers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/41c5b2a8-6a72-553f-8578-8e33382ee729', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/41c5b2a8-6a72-553f-8578-8e33382ee729'}, {'abstract': 'Charts resulting from a statistical algorithm find natural tiers and clusters within fantasy football player ranking data.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2014/sports/football/2014-fantasy-football-tier-charts-RB.html', 'snippet': 'Charts resulting from a statistical algorithm find natural tiers and clusters within fantasy football player ranking data.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Charts resulting from a statistical algorithm find natural tiers and clusters within fantasy football player ranking data.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/11/sports/11fantasycharts1/11fantasycharts1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 463, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/10/11/sports/11fantasycharts1/11fantasycharts1-articleLarge.png', 'xlar