yt://slideshow/c30e8e1d-8f38-5272-83df-f154abd4628b'}, {'abstract': 'By applying an algorithm to aggregated player ranking data, and identifying natural tiers within the data, this system can improve your draft strategy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/sports/football/drafting-a-fantasy-football-team-with-help-from-advanced-statistics.html', 'snippet': 'By applying an algorithm to aggregated player ranking data, and identifying natural tiers within the data, this system can improve your draft strategy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year, I developed a statistical model for fantasy football that determines how to rank and tier players for every position based on consensus expert rankings. The algorithm found natural tiers and clusters within the rankings data. To help visualize this, I created charts for each week of the season, which could be used to help you decide your starting fantasy lineup.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drafting a Fantasy Football Team, With Help From Advanced Statistics', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fantasy Sports', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statistics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-06T17:45:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Boris Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Boris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d17039a-3de0-5b0d-8cec-83b69661a35b', 'word_count': 315, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d17039a-3de0-5b0d-8cec-83b69661a35b'}, {'abstract': 'James Cameron’s National Geographic documentary about his ocean adventure had its premiere at the American Museum of Natural History.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/fashion/james-camerons-deepsea-challenge-3d-premiere.html', 'snippet': 'James Cameron’s National Geographic documentary about his ocean adventure had its premiere at the American Museum of Natural History.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is the time of year to face fears of riptides, jellyfish and sharks. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Swimming With Bold-Faced Creatures', 'kicker': 'Scene City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Swimming With Bold-Faced Creatures', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cameron, James', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN MUSEUM OF NATURAL HISTORY', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-06T17:52:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bob Morris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef092b88-10f0-5434-9098-46fe8f7dc2ce', 'word_count': 520, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef092b88-10f0-5434-9098-46fe8f7dc2ce'}, {'abstract': 'The state has spent $500 million since 2005 to beef up its border security, drawing criticism from scores of detractors who say the threat posed by illegal immigrants and the extent of crime have been exaggerated.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/us/texas-is-accused-of-overreaching-and-overspending-to-police-border.html', 'snippet': 'The state has spent $500 million since 2005 to beef up its border security, drawing criticism from scores of detractors who say the threat posed by illegal immigrants and the extent of crime have been exaggerated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MISSION, Tex. — Along the Rio Grande here, the suspected smugglers trying to slip into the United States have certainly noticed their adversaries on the water: burly commandos in black-and-white boats mounted with .30-caliber machine guns and bulletproof shields. The patches on the officers’ camouflage fatigues identify them not as federal Border Patrol agents but as another breed of law enforcement entirely.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/us/TEXAS1/TEXAS1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/us/TEXAS1/TEXAS1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/us/TEXAS1/TEXAS1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/us/TEXAS1/TEXAS1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1350, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/us/TEXAS1/TEXAS1-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/07/us/TEXAS1/TEXAS1-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'c