ps://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/06/odessa-song-folk-singer-edward-sharpe-jacquire-king/', 'snippet': 'The young singer abandoned a career as a backup violinist for bands like Edward Sharpe and the Magnetic Zeroes to venture out on her own.', 'lead_paragraph': "Two years ago, the singer and multi-instrumentalist who goes only by Odessa had a nearly fatal bike accident. Afterward, she promised herself she would follow her muse. So she left a stable career playing backing violin for established bands like Edward Sharpe and the Magnetic Zeroes to work on her own. The experience “inspired me to fully commit to only what I wanted to do,” she says. “After that it was like, ‘Okay. I have no choice. This is why I’m on earth.'”", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06odessa-ashlock/06odessa-ashlock-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06odessa-ashlock/06odessa-ashlock-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06odessa-ashlock/06odessa-ashlock-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06odessa-ashlock/06odessa-ashlock-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 759, 'width': 1139, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/t-magazine/06odessa-ashlock/06odessa-ashlock-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbn