imes.com/2014/08/06/books/the-misadventures-of-the-family-fletcher-by-dana-alison-levy.html', 'snippet': 'In her first novel, “The Misadventures of the Family Fletcher,” Dana Alison Levy updates the traditional family-story structure by introducing same-sex parents and multiracial children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Fletchers are an unusual family. You might consider them unusual because they are all male — the family consists of four adopted boys and two fathers — but what really makes them stand out is how inclusive, loving and fun they are. In her first novel, “The Misadventures of the Family Fletcher,” Dana Alison Levy conjures up an enlightening tale for middle-grade readers, taking the traditional family-story structure and bringing it up to date by introducing same-sex parents and multiracial children.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/books/06childrens/06childrens-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 856, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/06/books/06childrens/06childrens-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 856}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/books/06childrens/06childrens-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 719, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/books/06childrens/06childrens-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1437, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/06/books/06childrens/06childrens-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 