er prize.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — As if to mark the moment, the setting sun had turned the hills and the palm trees in Chavez Ravine a golden hue as Mike Trout stepped into the batter’s box for the first time Tuesday night. He shrugged off the boos from the sellout crowd, wished the umpire Chris Segal and catcher A. J. Ellis good luck, and dug in against Clayton Kershaw.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07dodgers/07dodgers-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 476, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07dodgers/07dodgers-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 476}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07dodgers/07dodgers-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 812, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07dodgers/07dodgers-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1623, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07dodgers/07dodgers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07dodgers/07dodgers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07dodgers/07dodgers-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Freeway Series May Be Key on the Road to the Title', 'kicker'