emporary ballet and acrobatics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/arts/dance/jacob-jonas-the-company-at-ailey-citigroup-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Jacob Jonas the Company presented “In a Room on Broad St.,” a dance for nine, at the Ailey Citigroup Theater, with a cast specializing in hip-hop, contemporary ballet and acrobatics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jacob Jonas the Company, born in Los Angeles, is a relatively new venture led by a skateboarder turned street performer. Mr. Jonas discovered dance at 13 at a performance by the Calypso Tumblers on the Venice Beach boardwalk; eventually, he became a member. Now, as the artistic director of his own group, he strives to create a supportive environment with a mission statement that highlights producing “emotionally charged work with the intention to encourage and not compete.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/JACOB/JACOB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/JACOB/JACOB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 352}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/JACOB/JACOB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/JACOB/JACOB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1202, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/JACOB/JACOB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail'