25, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0cd535d9-1367-5f65-90c2-cb3b4411b527'}, {'abstract': 'Putting the Professional Knife Sharpener from Brod & Taylor through its paces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/garden/itll-be-the-onion-that-does-the-crying.html', 'snippet': 'Putting the Professional Knife Sharpener from Brod & Taylor through its paces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Knife sharpeners have always scared me, with all those detailed, anxiety-provoking instructions about how you have to hold the blade at exactly the right angle or who knows what disaster will befall you and your blade. But the new Professional Knife Sharpener from Brod & Taylor, is the first aesthetically pleasing one I’ve ever seen. So as a pushover for good design, I decided to put aside my fears and give it a try.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/garden/07ROADTEST/0807CURRENTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/garden/07ROADTEST/0807CURRENTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/garden/07ROADTEST/0807CURRENTS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/garden/07ROADTEST/0807CURRENTS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1267, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/garden/07ROADTEST/07ROADTEST-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard',