rijuana Legalization to Be on Ballot', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huetteman, Emmarie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Referendums', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, Andrew P', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-06T23:35:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0283b37-d766-54b2-adc9-d41e7beb394d', 'word_count': 88, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0283b37-d766-54b2-adc9-d41e7beb394d'}, {'abstract': 'In voting to approve autonomy, the N.C.A.A. Division I board of directors will also vote to authorize the new Big 5 governance body to make rules within 11 explicitly articulated “areas of autonomy.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2014/08/06/sports/ncaa-autonomy-translation.html', 'snippet': 'In voting to approve autonomy, the N.C.A.A. Division I board of directors will also vote to authorize the new Big 5 governance body to make rules within 11 explicitly articulated “areas of autonomy.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'In voting to approve autonomy, the N.C.A.A. Division I board of directors will also vote to authorize the new Big 5 governance body to make rules within 11 explicitly articulated “areas of autonomy.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit'