cle/779b263a-788f-5dc2-b887-a236dd96657e'}, {'abstract': 'With second-place finishes at the United States and British Opens, Rickie Fowler seems poised to become the next young golfer to break through.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/sports/golf/in-majors-fowler-has-substance-with-style.html', 'snippet': 'With second-place finishes at the United States and British Opens, Rickie Fowler seems poised to become the next young golfer to break through.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOUISVILLE, Ky. — Rickie Fowler played 18 holes at Valhalla Golf Club on Monday and Tuesday to prepare for the 96th P.G.A. Championship on a course he had not seen before. Before a little more practice Wednesday, his mood was of a relaxed man confident about his craft. Given Fowler’s form in the first three major championships, there was no need to cram on the eve of the fourth.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07Fowler-01/07Fowler-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07Fowler-01/07Fowler-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07Fowler-01/07Fowler-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07Fowler-01/07Fowler-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1455, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/sports/07Fowler-01/07Fowler-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height