rd J. Snowden, the American intelligence contractor who divulged a raft of secret documents and then fled to Russia, has been granted a three-year residence permit here, his lawyer announced Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Snowden Said to Be Allowed 3 More Years in Russia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russia: Snowden Granted an Extension', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-07T10:55:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil MacFarquhar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacFarquhar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7230baaa-9930-5bd2-b066-3673969dc258', 'word_count': 600, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7230baaa-9930-5bd2-b066-3673969dc258'}, {'abstract': 'Book buyers in Manhattan, West Los Angeles and the San Francisco Bay area will be able to get same-day deliveries from local Barnes & Noble stores through Google Shopping Express.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/daily-report-to-compete-against-amazon-google-and-barnes-noble-team-up/', 'snippet': 'Book buyers in Manhattan, West Los Angeles and the San Francisco Bay area will be able to get same-day deliveries from local Barnes & Noble stores through Google Shopping Express.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Google and Barnes & Noble are joining forces to tackle the