, but floated again on the return tide. In the meantime she had sprung a leak; she managed, however, with the help of a tug and under trysail, to return to harbor, when she sank in shallow water. Later she was floated into dry dock. M. George Hugo imagined it was necessary to wire to his friends that the Gilda had sunk and no lives lost. — The New York Herald, European Edition, August 8, 1889', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1889: Hereditary Imagination', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hugo, Victor', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-07T14:16:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe8ec0e9-c037-5098-b8cc-711a487f3186', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe8ec0e9-c037-5098-b8cc-711a487f3186'}, {'abstract': 'Nicholas Koumjian, a prosecutor, and Victor Koppe, a defense lawyer for two former Khmer Rouge leaders, discussed the sentences delivered in a Cambodian court room.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/asia/100000003043960/lawyers-on-khmer-rouge-sentencing.html', 'snippet': 'Nicholas Koumjian, a prosecutor, and Victor Koppe, a defense lawyer for two former Khmer Rouge leaders, discussed the sentences delivered in a Cambodian court room.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nicholas Koumjian, a prosecutor, and Victor Koppe, a defense lawyer for two former Khmer Rouge leaders, dis