of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5190281-59d2-5337-b7ca-920ae8653de3', 'word_count': 1131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5190281-59d2-5337-b7ca-920ae8653de3'}, {'abstract': 'Starting tonight, the iconic techno-fueled party venue is exhibiting works by a number of artists, many of whom are current or former staffers, in a massive space behind the dance floor.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/berghain-panorama-bar-berlin-legendary-nightclub-10th-anniversary-art-show/', 'snippet': 'Starting tonight, the iconic techno-fueled party venue is exhibiting works by a number of artists, many of whom are current or former staffers, in a massive space behind the dance floor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With its 10th anniversary approaching in December, the Berghain — Berlin’s most famous electronic music institution — is kicking things off tonight with a fine art prelude to a series of upcoming house- and techno-fueled celebrations. Titled simply “10,” the show takes place at the Halle, a vast section of the converted neoclassical power plant just beyond the dance floor that is open only on special occasions. Each work in “10” interprets the trinity of music, clubbing and debauchery in relation to Berghain’s potent architecture.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/t-magazine/07berghain-perlson-1/07berghain-perlson-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/t-magazine/07berghain-perlson-1/07berghain-perlson-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/t-magazine/07berghain-perlson-1/07berghain-perlson-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/t-magazine/07berghain-perlson-1/07berghain-perlson-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/t-magazine/07berghain-perlson-1/07berghain-perlson-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/07/t-magazine/07berghain-perlson-1/07berghain-perlson-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/t-magazine/07berghain-perlson-1/07berghain-perlson-1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Berghain, Berlin’s Legendary Nightclub, Celebrates Its 10th Anniversary With an Art Show', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Berghain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Berlin (Germany)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-07T17:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hili Perlson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hili', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Perlson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/35249fd2-c683-5b2f-9b21-1f8e99d65dc9', 'word_count': 477, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35249fd2-c683-5b2f-9b21-1f8e99d65dc9'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The Albanian royal family in exile took up residence in Versailles in 1939.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/07/1939-albanian-royals-at-versailles/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The Albanian royal family in exile took up residence in Versailles in 1939.', 'lead_paragraph': 'King Zog, exiled monarch of Albania, now an Italian principality, and Queen Geraldine were expected to take up residence in Versailles today, coming from Antwerp, where they arrived yesterday from Oslo aboard the steamer Brabant. With them were the infant Prince Alexander, Princesses Myzein, Ruheje and Maxhide, sisters of King Zog, and a royal entourage of a score who will take up residence with the King and Queen.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, August 8, 1939', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/blogs/iht07-retrospective08/iht07-retrospective08-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 434, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/blogs/iht07-retrospective08/iht07-retrospective08-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 434}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/blogs/iht07-retrospective08/iht07-retrospective08-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 604, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/blogs/iht07-retrospective08/iht07-retrospective08-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 604, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/blogs/iht07-retro