hat organizers are calling a “participatory walks” festival. Elastic City an organization that since 2010 has engaged artists in various disciplines to lead walks that are less about sightseeing than about finding fresh ways to think about a city’s history, architecture and traditions, is presenting its first Elastic City Walks Festival, from Sept. 26 to Oct. 7.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Combining Culture and Exercise: The First Elastic City Walks Festival', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Culture and Exercise: Elastic City Walks Festival', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Walking', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Finley, Karen', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goicolea, Anthony', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Elastic City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Columbus Circle (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-07T17:13:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4841e963-b926-507f-842e-d1428b5ded2d', 'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4841e963-b926-507f-842e-d1428b5ded2d'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Ellsworth, a prominent dealer, helped shape the holdings of prominent collectors and museums.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/08/arts/design/robert-h-ellsworth-whose-life-was-devoted-to-chinese-art-dies-at-85.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Ellsworth, a prominent dealer, helped shape the holdings of prominent collectors and museums.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert H. Ellsworth, a prominent dealer of modern Chinese painting, Ming dynasty furniture, archaic jade and other examples of Asian art who helped amplify many of the major Asian collections in the United States, died on Sunday in Manhattan. He was 85.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/ELLSWORTH-1-obit/ELLSWORTH-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/ELLSWORTH-1-obit/ELLSWORTH-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/ELLSWORTH-1-obit/ELLSWORTH-1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/ELLSWORTH-1-obit/ELLSWORTH-1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/ELLSWORTH-1-obit/ELLSWORTH-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/ELLSWORTH-1-obit/ELLSWORTH-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/arts/ELLSWORTH-1-obit/ELLSWORTH-1-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Robert H. Ellsworth Is Dead at 85 After a Life Devoted to Chinese Art ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Robert H. Ellsworth Is Dead at 85 After a Life Devoted to Chinese Art', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ellsworth, Robert Hatfield (1929-2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weber, Bruce', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-07T17:21:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d89a7f4-1036-5477-b675-512df31b59eb', 'word_count': 1067, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d89a7f4-1036-5477-b675-512df31b59eb'}, {'abstract': 'Local beers and deli specialties are found in and near the Bronx Beer Hall in the heart of the borough’s storied Italian-American neighborhood.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/13/dining/the-pain-and-pleasure-of-falling-in-love.html', 'snippet': 'Local beers and deli specialties are found in and near the Bronx Beer Hall in the heart of the borough’s storied Italian-American neighborhood.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The chicken wing was juicy and laced with an invisible layer of tempestuous spices, and the moment I bit into it, I turned into Nicolas Cage in “Moonstruck.” Words welled up inside. I needed to tell that chicken wing how I felt: “I’m in love with you.” At that instant, the spices reared back and smacked me across the lips. Delicious agony began to spread to the rest of my mouth. Sips of cold beer did nothing to diminish the impact. Hours later, I could still feel the sting. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Pain and Pleasure of Falling in Love', 'kicker': 'Hungry City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Pain and Pleasure of Falling in Love', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bronx Beer Hall (Bronx, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belmont (Bronx, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-07T17:26:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Gordinier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gordinier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e09639b-9977-5205-a5a2-1bfdc14477d0', 'word_count': 787, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e09639b-9977-5205-a5a2-1bfdc14477d0'}, {'abstract': 'Rudy Kurniawan sold wealthy clients bottles of purportedly rare and sought-after wines that were actually old bottles of blended wine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/08/nyregion/wine-dealer-sentenced-to-10-years-for-defrauding-clients.html', 'snippet': 'Rudy Kurniawan sold wealthy clients bottles of purportedly rare and sought-after wines that were actually old bottles of blended wine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A well-known wine dealer was sentenced on Thursday to 10 years in prison for defrauding wealthy clients out of millions of dollars by selling bottles of purportedly rare wines that were actually old bo