f/pga-championship-2014-tiger-woods-lee-westwood-kevin-chappell.html', 'snippet': 'Lee Westwood was atop the P.G.A. Championship leader board after the first round, tied with the Americans Ryan Palmer and Kevin Chappell.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOUISVILLE, Ky. — Lee Westwood was having an unlucky day at the 96th P.G.A. Championship. Three times Thursday, his golf ball rolled into a fairway divot or the pitch mark of another player’s ball, a rare trifecta of star-crossed doom given the green, unblemished expanse of Valhalla Golf Club.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/08/sports/08golf-001/08golf-001-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 438, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/08/sports/08golf-001/08golf-001-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 438}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/08/sports/08golf-001/08golf-001-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/08/sports/08golf-001/08golf-001-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1494, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/08/sports/08golf-001/08golf-001-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/08/sports/08golf-001/08golf-001-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/08/sports/08golf-001/0