uctures on 18th- and 19th-century estates, in Madison Square Park.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/08/arts/design/rachel-feinsteins-folly-in-madison-square-park.html', 'snippet': 'Rachel Feinstein has set up “Folly,” a set of three sculptures that evoke the whimsical garden structures on 18th- and 19th-century estates, in Madison Square Park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rachel Feinstein’s “Folly,” a set of three sculptures in Madison Square Park, evokes the whimsical garden structures on vast 18th- and 19th-century estates. Each sculpture is a sort of frothy confection, whipped up from thin sheets of aluminum that have been coated in white powder and printed with gray lines to look like enlarged sketches. One looks like a house on a cliff; another is a rococo hut. Most intriguing, if least accessible, is the ship moored high overhead in a tree.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/08/arts/design/20140808-OUTDOORS-slide-W86K/20140808-OUTDOORS-slide-W86K-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/08/arts/design/20140808-OUTDOORS-slide-W86K/20140808-OUTDOORS-slide-W86K-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/08/arts/design/20140808-OUTDOORS-slide-W86K/20140808-OUTDOORS-slide-W86K-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/08/arts/design/20140808-OUTDOORS-slide-W86K/20140808-OUTDOORS-slide-W86K-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype'