act': 'The loss of our friends was a silent stowaway, riding atop our shoulders for a year; but then in writing a book about them, it opened up love, buoyant and uplifting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/10/fashion/Modern-love-In-a-Balm-of-Space-and-Time-Healing.html', 'snippet': 'The loss of our friends was a silent stowaway, riding atop our shoulders for a year; but then in writing a book about them, it opened up love, buoyant and uplifting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Twelve years ago, my husband, Nick, and I were halfway through a yearlong round-the-world trip when we arrived in Jaisalmer, India, on a furnace-hot July afternoon. As we made our way from the train station up the winding streets to the cheapest hotel we could find, our rickshaw became snarled in traffic in an alley alongside other rickshaws, a donkey cart and cows noshing on garbage.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/fashion/10MODERNLOVE/10MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 789, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/10/fashion/10MODERNLOVE/10MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 789}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/fashion/10MODERNLOVE/10MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 779, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/fashion/10MODERNLOVE/10MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1558, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/fashion/10MODERNLOVE/10MODERNLOVE-thumbStanda