interest, and when he had finished felt that their knowledge of electricity had been greatly increased. — The New York Herald, European Edition, August 9, 1889', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/blogs/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 803, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/09/blogs/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 803}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/blogs/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 766, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/blogs/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1165, 'width': 871, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/blogs/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/09/blogs/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/blogs/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison/09iht-retrospective-thomas-edison-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name'