ine': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/b74bf4c7-092b-5960-aa95-debde8fc2fe9', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/b74bf4c7-092b-5960-aa95-debde8fc2fe9'}, {'abstract': 'It may cost as much as two Mazda Miatas, but BMW’s 4 Series convertible offers BMW precision to the open-air crowd.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/09/automobiles/video-the-bmw-435i-is-a-ray-of-sunshine-for-a-price.html', 'snippet': 'It may cost as much as two Mazda Miatas, but BMW’s 4 Series convertible offers BMW precision to the open-air crowd.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During photography of the 2015 BMW 435i convertible, I shot beautiful video of flowers, clouds, horses and scenic vistas along rural roads. Almost none of it is used in the piece. This is, after all, a car review, not a CBS Sunday Morning sound and picture piece. But, as a convertible owner myself, I’m compelled to communicate what I see and smell when the top is down. It’s not only about getting a deeper tan (something doctors will frown upon anyway).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/automobiles/09DRIVEN-image/09DRIVEN-image-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/09/automobiles/09DRIVEN-image/09DRIVEN-image-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 302}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/automobiles/09DRIVEN-image/09DRIVEN-image-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 516, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/automobiles/09DRIVEN-image/09DRIVEN-image-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1233, 's