aponack, on Long Island.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/nyregion/100000003044587/sunday-routine-khajak-keledjian.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Keledjian, the co-founder and C.E.O. of Intermix, meditates at his home in Sagaponack, on Long Island.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mr. Keledjian, the co-founder and C.E.O. of Intermix, meditates at his home in Sagaponack, on Long Island.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/multimedia/sunday-keledjian/sunday-keledjian-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/07/multimedia/sunday-keledjian/sunday-keledjian-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/multimedia/sunday-keledjian/sunday-keledjian-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/multimedia/sunday-keledjian/sunday-keledjian-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/multimedia/sunday-keledjian/sunday-keledjian-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/07/multimedia/sunday-keledjian/sunday-keledjian-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/07/multimedia/sunday-keledjian/sunday-keledjian-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarg