ales, is expecting their first child. In the summer, the couple spend most weekends at their 4,000-square-foot home in Sagaponack, on Long Island.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Khajak Keledjian: Zero to 60, and Back Again', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Zero to 60, and Back Again', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Intermix', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boncompagni, Tatiana', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keledjian, Khajak', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sagaponack (NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-08T22:43:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tatiana Boncompagni', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tatiana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Boncompagni', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab7fb58a-cfc1-54a2-86a4-ed0242e8ae35', 'word_count': 846, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab7fb58a-cfc1-54a2-86a4-ed0242e8ae35'}, {'abstract': 'A federal judge in New York told Argentina to cease making “false and misleading” statements that it did not default on July 30.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/08/08/judge-griesa-threatens-argentina-with-contempt-over-its-statements/', 'snippet': 'A federal judge in New York told Argentina to cease making “false and misleading” statements that it did not default on July 30.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At times the battle between a group of New York hedge funds and the country of Argentina feels more like a game of legal Ping-Pong than a case involving billions of dollars at stake. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/business/dbpix-argent1/dbpix-argent1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/09/business/dbpix-argent1/dbpix-argent1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 432}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/business/dbpix-argent1/dbpix-argent1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 738, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/business/dbpix-argent1/dbpix-argent1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1476, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/business/dbpix-argent1/dbpix-argent1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/09/business/dbpix-argent1/dbpix-argent1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/business/dbpix-argent1/dbpix-argent1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Threatens Argentina With Contempt Over Its Statements', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Griesa, T