ly is all too common. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When a Car Loan Means Bankruptcy', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When a Car Loan Means Bankruptcy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Financing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Financial Protection Bureau', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Trade Commission', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-09T02:18:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/01743de8-c582-58e5-b077-73f7cccb4f6e', 'word_count': 594, 'uri': 'nyt://article/01743de8-c582-58e5-b077-73f7cccb4f6e'}, {'abstract': 'Oak Haven Table & Bar, in New Haven, uses a local-and-seasonal approach to its menu.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/10/nyregion/a-review-of-oak-haven-table-bar-in-new-haven.html', 'snippet': 'Oak Haven Table & Bar, in New Haven, uses a local-and-seasonal approach to its menu.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an ideal world, a restaurant should function not just as a place to eat, but as a hub for kinship and connection. By that logic, an eatery that enlivens and elevates a community deserves spe