rd_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aefd14aa-c852-59c6-86f5-51dc5ad9ffb6'}, {'abstract': 'The retailer suggests that writers who do not support it are holding back the future. But mistakenly accusing one of the 20th century’s most famous authors of collusion will probably not help its cause.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/09/orwell-is-amazons-latest-target-in-battle-against-hachette/', 'snippet': 'The retailer suggests that writers who do not support it are holding back the future. But mistakenly accusing one of the 20th century’s most famous authors of collusion will probably not help its cause.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Maybe Amazon really is rattled by the whole\xa0Authors United phenomenon organized by Douglas Preston. The writers are encouraging their readers to email Jeff Bezos, the Amazon chief executive, and tell him to stop holding books hostage as\xa0the company\xa0negotiates with Hachette Book Group.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/business/10BITS/10BITS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 483, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/09/business/10BITS/10BITS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 483}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/business/10BITS/10BITS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 825, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/business/10BITS/10BITS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1608, 'width': 1997, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/09/business/10BITS/10BITS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'w