e on Saturday, President Obama called the crisis in Iraq a “long-term project,” but reiterated that the United States would not send ground forces to the region. Earlier this week, Mr. Obama said the stranded Yazidis, a religious minority, were in danger of “genocide” at the hands of militants with the Islamic State in Iraq and Syria. Mr. Obama authorized targeted airstrikes against ISIS on Thursday, drawing bipartisan support from Congress.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunday Breakfast Menu, Aug. 10', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-08-09T19:17:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elena Schneider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schneider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/088a2f40-67e0-554f-bbd9-a59db4340a7d', 'word_count': 548, 'uri': 'nyt://article/088a2f40-67e0-554f-bbd9-a59db4340a7d'}, {'abstract': 'Becky Hammon made news last week when the Spurs hired her as the N.B.A.’s first full-time female assistant coach, but in swimming, it is common for male athletes to be coached by women.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/10/sports/men-often-mentored-by-women-at-the-pool.html', 'snippet': 'Becky Hammon made news last week when the Spurs hired her as the N.B.A.’s first full-time female assistant coach, but in swimming, it is common for male athletes to be coached by women.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IRVINE, Calif. — The San Antonio Spurs’ hiring of Becky Hammon on Tuesday as the N.B.A.’s first full-time female assistant coach caught the eye of Dorsey Tierney-Walker, who was thrilled to welcome another woman into a club that she never viewed 