s plays Bryce Westbrook, a Heisman Trophy-winning wide receiver and first-round draft pick for the fictional San Diego Sabers football team. The role has made Mr. Ellis a favorite among the show’s female fan base and sparked numerous magazine articles that promise to reveal this 32-year-old actor’s “sexy secrets.” ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1162, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1162}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 529, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1058, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/arts/10SNAPSHOT/10SNAPSHOT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'I’m Not a Doctor, but I Play One ...', 'kicker': 'Snapshot', 'content_kicker': None, 