 being shut out in consecutive games for the first time in 15 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/11/sports/baseball/kuroda-and-yankees-looking-ahead-to-orioles-fall-to-indians.html', 'snippet': 'A day before the start of an important series, the Yankees barely avoided the ignominy of being shut out in consecutive games for the first time in 15 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Yankees rode the Amtrak Acela train down to Baltimore on Sunday evening, but to say they were rolling into town, for perhaps their biggest series of the year, would not be quite accurate.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/sports/11yankees/11yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/11/sports/11yankees/11yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/sports/11yankees/11yankees-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 626, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/sports/11yankees/11yankees-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1252, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/sports/11yankees/11yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/11/sports/11yankees/11yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/sports/11yankees/11yankees-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking Ahead, Yankees Fall Behind for Their Second Straight Loss ', 'kicker': 'Indians 4, Yankees 1', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Looking Ahead, Yankees Fall Behind for Their Second Straight Loss', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waldstein, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Orioles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kuroda, Hiroki', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Indians', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-10T21:42:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b48d527-78d2-5308-bf4a-d75824a6f8a0', 'word_count': 832, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b48d527-78d2-5308-bf4a-d75824a6f8a0'}, {'abstract': 'The choreographer Malini Srinivasan brings sensuality to the dance suite “Tejas Luminous.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/11/arts/dance/tejas-luminous-featuring-malini-srinivasan.html', 'snippet': 'The choreographer Malini Srinivasan brings sensuality to the dance suite “Tejas Luminous.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the program note for her dance suite “Tejas Luminous,” Malini Srinivasan, a dancer and choreographer of the classical Indian style Bharata Natyam, writes of spiritual questions. Explaining how growi