f the war have been less common in the capital.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/11/world/asia/taliban-take-responsibility-for-bombing-in-kabul.html', 'snippet': 'While they have repeatedly fired rockets at the airport and carried out a broad campaign of violence across the country, the suicide attacks that have been a hallmark of the war have been less common in the capital.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — A suicide attack on a coalition convoy passing through Kabul on Sunday killed four civilians and wounded 35, a potent reminder of the Taliban’s capacity to strike the capital.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Taliban Take Responsibility for Bombing in Kabul', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taliban Take Responsibility for Bombing in Kabul', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ahmed, Azam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kabul (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-11T00:13:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Azam Ahmed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Azam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ahmed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0b1e75d-64cd-5128-88f4-2c99fcb70c83', 'word_count': 283, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0b1e75d-64cd-5128-88f4-2c99fcb70c83'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Krauser, who won national titles in her teens and in her 70s, helped to organize the adult racing program U.S. Masters Swimming', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/11/sports/june-krauser-dies-at-88-set-154-records-in-the-pool.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Krauser, who won national titles in her teens and in her 70s, helped to organize the adult racing program U.S. Masters Swimming', 'lead_paragraph': 'June Krauser, who broke scores of world records while in her 40s, 50s, 60s and 70s in a sport she helped found — she was known as “the mother of masters swimming”— died on Aug. 2 in Pompano Beach, Fla. She was 88.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/sports/dog-krauser-obit/dog-krauser-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/10/sports/dog-krauser-obit/dog-krauser-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/sports/dog-krauser-obit/dog-krauser-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/sports/dog-krauser-obit/dog-krauser-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 978, 'width': 1452, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/sports/dog-krauser-obit/dog-krauser-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/10/sports/dog-krauser-obit/dog-krauser-obit-thumbStandard-