e its premiere until 2016 but a workshop performance has been scheduled for New York in November.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David T. Little’s opera “JFK,” which looks at the 12 hours leading up to John F. Kennedy’s assassination in Dallas, is scheduled to have its world premiere at the Fort Worth Opera on April 23, 2016. But New Yorkers will be able to get an advance look in November. The American Lyric Theater, which is developing the score in a partnership with the Fort Worth company, will present a workshop performance of the opera-in-progress at Merkin Concert Hall on Nov. 25.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Early Look at ‘JFK’ Opera', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Early Look at ‘JFK’ Opera This Fall in New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kennedy, John Fitzgerald', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Little, David T', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mack, Daniela', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Okulitch, Daniel', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Onassis, Jacqueline Kennedy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vavrek, Royce', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Worth, Matthew', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Lyric Theater', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fort Worth Opera', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fort Worth (Tex)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-11T09:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None,