s but of her rejections, too.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/11/stand-out-with-an-anti-resume-for-your-next-job-application/', 'snippet': 'One writer has created a detailed list not just of her accomplishments but of her rejections, too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The writer Monica Byrne has created an Excel spreadsheet of everything she’s ever failed at. Well, not everything — there are almost certainly some childhood spelling bees or soccer games, or both, left off. But her spreadsheet, which she calls her “anti-résumé,” does include all the rejections she’s received for her creative work over the past six years — over 500 of them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/opinion/NYTO-resume/NYTO-resume-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/10/opinion/NYTO-resume/NYTO-resume-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/opinion/NYTO-resume/NYTO-resume-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1014, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/opinion/NYTO-resume/NYTO-resume-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 1400, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/10/opinion/NYTO-resume/NYTO-resume-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/10/opinion/NYTO-resume/NYTO-resume-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbL