nto the nearby Museum of Bad Art?', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m a big fan of sports that I’m not a big fan of. Earlier this summer, for example, I learned the rules of cricket watching a match on a wide screen at a bar in Guyana. Last fall I went to an equestrian event in upstate New York. I enjoyed both immensely — though I could do without ever seeing either again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/travel/11-frugal-derby/11-frugal-derby-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 323, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/11/travel/11-frugal-derby/11-frugal-derby-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 323}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/travel/11-frugal-derby/11-frugal-derby-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 551, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/travel/11-frugal-derby/11-frugal-derby-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1103, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/travel/11-frugal-derby/11-frugal-derby-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/11/travel/11-frugal-derby/11-frugal-derby-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/11/travel/11-frugal-derby/11-frugal-derby-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Low-Brow Day in Harvard’s Backyard', 'kicker': 'Frugal Traveler', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budget Travel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cambridge (Mass)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Somerville (Mass)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Roller Derby', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-11T18:20:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Seth Kugel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kugel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6bff50d3-47ae-583b-8f69-354f23bce1f5', 'word_count': 1469, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6bff50d3-47ae-583b-8f69-354f23bce1f5'}, {'abstract': 'The Red Bulls lost, 1-0, at the Chicago Fire in a deflating performance Sunday night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/12/sports/soccer/red-bulls-rewind-chicago-blues.html', 'snippet': 'The Red Bulls lost, 1-0, at the Chicago Fire in a deflating performance Sunday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chicago is well known for its funky blues music. And some of the titles speak directly to the fate of the Red Bulls/MetroStars over the past decade in and around that city:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/sports/soccer/12rbny1/12rbny1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1026, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/12/sports/soccer/12rbny1/12rbny1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1026}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': '