8-5174-ae99-5e1a7aba8ea2'}, {'abstract': 'Unicef and the World Health Organization said they would seek to vaccinate four million children, but it was unclear whether Islamist militants would agree.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/amid-iraqs-chaos-a-new-polio-vaccination-campaign.html', 'snippet': 'Unicef and the World Health Organization said they would seek to vaccinate four million children, but it was unclear whether Islamist militants would agree.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Increasingly worried about the possible spread of polio amid Iraq’s escalating chaos, Unicef and the World Health Organization said Monday that they had begun a mass vaccination in what amounts to a test case of whether Islamist extremists will allow such an effort in areas they control.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amid Iraq’s Political Chaos, a New Polio Vaccination Campaign Faces Challenges', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amid Iraq’s Political Chaos, a New Polio Vaccination Campaign Faces Challenges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poliomyelitis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "United Nations Children's Fund", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-11T18:26:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'ti