Paumier-Moscardini’s height brings her much attention during a consulting trip to Asia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/12/business/fluendos-ceo-on-making-business-travel-work-for-her.html', 'snippet': 'Muriel Paumier-Moscardini’s height brings her much attention during a consulting trip to Asia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve been flying for business for about 20 years. I used to travel mostly to Asia and Mexico, and then started traveling mainly to Asia. If I’ve learned one thing about flying so much it’s that it sure isn’t making me younger. Right now as C.E.O. of the digital multimedia solutions company Fluendo I travel quite a bit, and basically I’m somewhere other than home about two weeks out of the month. It can be difficult, but that’s what I have to do.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/business/12flier-pic1/12flier-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 952, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/12/business/12flier-pic1/12flier-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 952}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/business/12flier-pic1/12flier-pic1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 646, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/business/12flier-pic1/12flier-pic1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1238, 'width': 780, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/business/12flier-pic1/12flier-pic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/