to power in part with American help, but U.S. leaders found him an often unconstructive ally who caused as many headaches as he solved.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/for-2-us-presidents-iraqi-leader-proved-a-source-of-frustration.html', 'snippet': 'Nuri Kamal al-Maliki rose from obscurity to power in part with American help, but U.S. leaders found him an often unconstructive ally who caused as many headaches as he solved.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — One day in the fall of 2007, President George W. Bush joined Prime Minister Nuri Kamal al-Maliki in a video conference to sign a “declaration of principles” on the future of the Iraqi-American relations. As Mr. Bush scrawled his name, Mr. Maliki in Baghdad just passed his pen over his copy, pretending to sign.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/12MALIKI1/12MALIKI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/12MALIKI1/12MALIKI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/12MALIKI1/12MALIKI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/12MALIKI1/12MALIKI1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1453, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/12MALIKI1/12MALIKI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/12MALIKI1/12MALIKI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/12MALIKI1/12MALIKI1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For 2 U.S. Presidents, Iraqi Leader Proved a Source of Frustration', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For 2 U.S. Presidents, Iraqi Premier Proved a Source of Frustration', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baker, Peter', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maliki, Nuri Kamal al-', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, George W', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Baghdad (Iraq)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-12T00:54:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'mi