 Or rather, at least a dozen voices, punctuating the offshore explosions with jokes, non sequiturs and off-the-wall pop-cultural, sexual and political references.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Robin Williams, an Improvisational Genius, Forever Present in the Moment', 'kicker': 'An Appraisal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Improvisational Genius, Forever Present in the Moment', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Robin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-12T02:59:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'An Appraisal', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ae181f4-0902-507c-a36b-b8595c44f024', 'word_count': 865, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ae181f4-0902-507c-a36b-b8595c44f024'}, {'abstract': 'Chris Davis and Nelson Cruz each blasted a two-run home run and Jonathan Schoop added a three-run shot in the eighth to bury the Yankees, and stretch Baltimore’s lead in the A.L. East to seven games.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/12/sports/baseball/yankees-with-chance-to-gain-ground-fall-hard-to-orioles.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Davis and Nelson Cruz each blasted a two-run home run and Jonathan Schoop added a three-run shot in the eighth to bury the Yankees, and stretch Baltimore’s lead in the A.L. East to seven games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — Buck Showalter was asked Monday afternoon about all the new players the Yankees have fielded since the last time he and the Baltimore Orioles encou