itarian crisis in Iraq.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/persecuted-yazidis-again-caught-in-larger-struggle.html', 'snippet': 'A religious minority of about 500,000 people, neither Muslim nor Christian, is at the center of a growing humanitarian crisis in Iraq.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Yazidis are a religious minority of about 500,000 people whose ancient monotheistic faith has roots in Zoroastrianism and beliefs involving a 12th-century mystic and a peacock angel. Those characteristics make adherents, who are neither Muslim nor Christian, apostates in the eyes of Islamist fighters who are sweeping through villages across northern Iraq.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Persecuted Yazidis Again Caught in Larger Struggle', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Yazidi (Religious Sect)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kurds', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sinjar (Iraq)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-12T03:39:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f806635a-89b5-5d05-b227-fd77bcff1931', 'word_count': 522, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f806635a-89b5-5d05-b227-fd77bcff1931'}, {'abstract': 'The West Village favorite has added a rustic-chic 2,000-square-foot space in the Catskills.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/12/t-magazine/woodstock-spa-yoga-savor-spa-catskills.html', 'snippet': 'The West Village favorite has added a rustic-chic 2,000-square-foot space in the Catskills.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since opening in the West Village in 2012, Savor Spa has drawn a loyal following among fashion industry types for its decadent-yet-affordable holistic facials and massages. Equally popular is the spa’s organic in-house skincare line, Om Aroma and Co., crafted from herbs grown in the Northeast and manufactured in the Catskills region near where the owner Angela Jia Kim and her family rent a weekend country house. So naturally, the next step for Kim’s business was to spin off a second location upstate. The newly opened 2,000-square-foot space, housed on the upper level of a barn house just east of downtown Woodstock — convenient to the Hudson Valley as well as the mountains to the west — offers yoga classes that incorporate aromatherapy and enough room to stretch out and stay all day. It is, Kim says, “a place for people to come and breathe.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12spa-bobb/12spa-bobb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12spa-bobb/12spa-bobb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12spa-bobb/12spa-bobb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12spa-bobb/12spa-bobb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', '