99a-52e0-b79b-789668c8c175'}, {'abstract': 'Secretary of State John Kerry and Defense Secretary Chuck Hagel said the U.S. would consider adding military and political support if Haider al-Abadi assumes the duties of prime minister.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/13/world/middleeast/us-outlines-conditions-for-expanded-military-and-political-support-in-iraq.html', 'snippet': 'Secretary of State John Kerry and Defense Secretary Chuck Hagel said the U.S. would consider adding military and political support if Haider al-Abadi assumes the duties of prime minister.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SYDNEY, Australia — The United States would consider expanding military and political support for Iraq if Haider al-Abadi assumes the duties of prime minister and leads a multisectarian government, Secretary of State John Kerry and Defense Secretary Chuck Hagel said on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/13DIPLO/13DIPLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/13DIPLO/13DIPLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/13DIPLO/13DIPLO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/13DIPLO/13DIPLO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1514, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/world/middleeast/13DIPLO/13DIPLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su