lying their expertise to finding jobs. Can professional networking and dating go hand in hand?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Work and romance may seem like a bad combination, but as more work, and more romance, goes online, the two are meeting in interesting ways. LinkedUp is one startup banking on a version of the old saw that you’re likely to meet your mate at work, while eHarmony, a veteran of online dating,\xa0has decided to deploy its expertise to match job seekers with potential employers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Meet-Cute of Professional Networking and Online Dating', 'kicker': 'Op-Talk', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Dating', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Guardian (British Newspaper)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LinkedIn Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'OkCupid', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-12T15:39:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anna Altman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Altman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78709d1f-26dd-5157-bcd6-4c5450f3a393', 'word_count': 1096, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78709d1f-26dd-5157-bcd6-4c5450f3a393'}, {'abstract': 'The Russian-made Mi-17 helicopter had just delivered emergency aid and picked up 20 to 25 Yazidi evacuees trapped on Sinjar Mountain in northern Iraq when it crashed shortly after takeoff.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/13/world/middleeast/times-journalist-iraq.html', 'snippet': 'The Russian-made Mi-17 helicopter had just delivered emergency aid and picked up 20 to 25 Yazidi evacuees trapped on Sinjar Mountain in northern Iraq when it crashed shortly after takeoff.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ERBIL, Iraq — A helicopter carrying aid from Iraq’s Kurdish autonomous government to stranded Yazidis in the Sinjar mountains of northern Iraq crashed on Tuesday, killing the pilot and injuring other passengers, including a Yazidi member of Parliament and a New York Times journalist.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Crash of Rescue Helicopter Kills Pilot; Times Reporter Is Injured', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Crash of Rescue Helicopter Kills Pilot; Times Reporter Is Injured', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nordland, Rod', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Yazidi (Religious Sect)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sinjar (Iraq)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Helicopters', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubin, Alissa Johannsen', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rescues', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferguson, Adam (1978- )', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-12T15:40:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rod Nordland and Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rod', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nordland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': No