le/ce29fce7-7cfb-5e77-8694-dba38cb41b86'}, {'abstract': 'Now is the perfect time of year to sport an updated version of the classic hot-weather cap. Here, three well-priced options.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/12/rihanna-fashion-summer-bucket-hat/', 'snippet': 'Now is the perfect time of year to sport an updated version of the classic hot-weather cap. Here, three well-priced options.', 'lead_paragraph': 'August, for most of the fashion world, is the quietest month — a moment to soak up the sun before fashion week hits again in September. It’s also a great time for both men and women to sport a no-fuss summer staple recently resurrected by Rihanna: the bucket hat. Also spotted at resort 2015 shows from brands such as Max Mara and Acne, the style will add swagger to any ensemble while shielding skin from ultraviolet rays. Whether plans call for yachting in Ibiza, camping in Oregon or a\xa0staycation in the city, these well-priced updates on the classic accessory balance function and fashion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12rihanna-koh/12rihanna-koh-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12rihanna-koh/12rihanna-koh-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12rihanna-koh/12rihanna-koh-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12rihanna-koh/12rihanna-koh-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12rihanna-koh/12rihanna-koh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12rihanna-koh/12rihanna-koh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/12/t-magazine/12rihanna-koh/12rihanna-koh-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rihanna’s Summer Bucket Hat', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rihanna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-12T17:00:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Angela Koh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Angela', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Koh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8482b112-de6d-5d55-b909-303aad3f76d5', 'word_count': 103, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8482b112-de6d-5d55-b909-303aad3f76d5'}, {'abstract': 'Because of privacy and legal concerns, there will be no more “baby walls” of patient and family photos in doctors offices.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/12/baby-pictures-at-the-o-b-s-office-no-more/', 'snippet': 'Because of privacy and legal concerns, there will be no more “baby walls” of patient and family photos in doctors offices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’ve been charmed, annoyed, or brought to your knees with envy over the wall of photos of babies at your doctor’s office, prepare to be met instead by less personal photography or art (Georgia O’Keeffe, perhaps?). Because of legal and privacy concerns, doctors’ offices are moving their bulletin boards of holiday cards into back offices and tucking into locked files the photos parents bring in to share. (Read more: Baby Pictures at the Doctor’s? Cute, Sure, but Illegal.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Baby Pictures at the O.B.’s Office? No More.', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Privacy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-12T17:02:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a76dd17-7526-50a8-bab0-8b789984a855', 'word_count': 262, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a76dd17-7526-50a8-bab0-8b789984a855'}, {'abstract': '“Excellent Sheep,” by William Deresiewicz, takes aim at America’s elite universities and the graduates they produce.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/13/books/excellent-sheep-william-deresiewiczs-manifesto.html', 'snippet': '“Excellent Sheep,” by William Deresiewicz, takes aim at America’s elite universities and the graduates they produce.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Are you a HYPSter? That’s William Deresiewicz’s term, in his new book, for Harvard, Yale, Princeton and Stanford, though it seems more idiomatic to apply that acronym to these schools’ graduates. With HYPSters, and with the recent graduates of the tier of elite American colleges a rung or two below them, he is unimpressed.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/books/13book-1/13book-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/13/books/13book-1/13book-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 819}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/books/13book-1/13book-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 750, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/books/13book-1/13book-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/books/13book-1/13book-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/13/books/13book-1/13book-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/books/13book-1/13book-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Lower Ambitions of Higher Education', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lowered Ambitions in Higher Education', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Dwight', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name