 'The coroner’s office said Robin Williams hanged himself with a belt at his home. A personal assistant found him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/13/arts/williams-found-hanged-to-death-official-says.html', 'snippet': 'The coroner’s office said Robin Williams hanged himself with a belt at his home. A personal assistant found him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN RAFAEL, Calif. — Robin Williams hanged himself with a belt at his home, a coroner’s office official said Tuesday in providing the first details of the actor’s death.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Robin Williams Died by Hanging, Official Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Robin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-12T19:22:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicole Perlroth', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicole', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Perlroth', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/613db2d9-6ef4-5540-9832-10a7cc77f72c', 'word_count': 157, 'uri': 'nyt://article/613db2d9-6ef4-5540-9832-10a7cc77f72c'}, {'abstract': 'Sushi-grade salmon or ahi tuna will work nicely for this easy, delicate dish, and you don’t even have to be a whiz with a knife to make it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/13/health/salmon-or-tuna-carpaccio-with-wasabi-sauce.html', 'snippet': 'Sushi-grade salmon or ahi tuna will work nicely for this easy, delicate dish, and you don’t even have to be a whiz with a knife to make it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Seek out sushi-grade salmon or ahi tuna for this easy, delicate fish carpaccio. I buy mine at a Japanese market, where the pieces sold are exactly the right amount for one serving (about 3 ounces). You don’t have to be a sushi whiz with a knife to get the thin pieces of fish; you just gently pound each piece between lightly oiled layers of plastic. If you don’t use a light hand, you will tear the fish, so take care with your mallet or rolling pin.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/science/13recipehealth/13recipehealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/13/science/13recipehealth/13recipehealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/science/13recipehealth/13recipehealth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/science/13recipehealth/13recipehealth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/science/13recipehealth/13recipehealth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/13/science/13recipehealth/13recipehealth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/science/13recipehealth/13recipehealth-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Salmon or Tuna Carpaccio with Wasabi Sauce', 'kicker': 'Recipes for Health', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headl