eek in a moving speech.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/13/world/middleeast/iraqi-who-made-emotional-plea-to-help-yazidis-is-injured-in-crash-of-relief-flight.html', 'snippet': 'Vian Dakhil, an Iraqi lawmaker from the Yazidi community, drew attention to the persecution of the religious minority last week in a moving speech.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Vian Dakhil, an Iraqi lawmaker who represents the Yazidi religious minority, was reportedly injured in the crash of a relief flight in northern Iraq on Tuesday. She had helped draw global attention to the plight of her community last week with an impassioned speech in Parliament that was shared widely on social networks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/world/middleeast/17open_iraq/17open_iraq-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/17/world/middleeast/17open_iraq/17open_iraq-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/world/middleeast/17open_iraq/17open_iraq-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/world/middleeast/17open_iraq/17open_iraq-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 999, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/world/middleeast/17open_iraq/17open_iraq-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/17/world/middleeast/17open_iraq/17open_iraq-thumbStandard.jpg', 't