ra’s best museums and some high-profile public works. Place Garibaldi, the central square, has been pedestrianized and spruced up, while the formerly lackluster port area is filling up with the city’s coolest restaurants and bars. And thanks to the new Promenade du Paillon, Nice has an alluring public park in its heart. A city for all budgets, Nice now buzzes with an energy and diversity that often surpasses its coastal rivals.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '36 Hours in Nice, France', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '36 Hours: Nice, France', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sherwood, Seth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nice (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-13T04:04:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Seth Sherwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sherwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5edc3b65-1a7e-5c28-8448-c82b79bf3f97', 'word_count': 1511, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5edc3b65-1a7e-5c28-8448-c82b79bf3f97'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Stone produced early Ray Charles and James Brown recordings, and later disco and what came to be called the Miami sound.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/13/business/media/henry-stone-93-dies-produced-the-miami-sound.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Stone produced early Ray Charles and James Brown recordings, and later disco and what came to be called the Miami sound.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Henry Stone, who produced early recordings by Ray Charles and James Brown and whose Hialeah, Fla., company, TK Records, was a fo