cessor would be his trusted deputy, Rob Manfred, but some owners balked, giving rise to two other candidates: Tom Werner and Tim Brosnan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/sports/baseball/rob-manfred-tom-werner-tim-brosnan-baseball-commissioner-bud-selig.html', 'snippet': 'At one time, it appeared that Bud Selig’s successor would be his trusted deputy, Rob Manfred, but some owners balked, giving rise to two other candidates: Tom Werner and Tim Brosnan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Baseball owners are expected to vote Thursday to select Commissioner Bud Selig’s successor, a process that a few months ago lacked much intrigue. Selig had announced last year that he would retire after the 2014 season, and it became clear with Rob Manfred’s promotion to chief operating officer last September that he would be the logical choice as the next commissioner.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/sports/14CANDIDATES2/14CANDIDATES2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/13/sports/14CANDIDATES2/14CANDIDATES2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/sports/14CANDIDATES2/14CANDIDATES2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/sports/14CANDIDATES2/14CANDIDATES2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/13/sports/14CANDIDATES2/14CANDIDATES2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp