8551-9839fc811872'}, {'abstract': 'Programs at the federal, state and local levels typically come with strict requirements, but they can help pay for training employees and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/business/smallbusiness/government-grants-may-help-ease-business-challenges.html', 'snippet': 'Programs at the federal, state and local levels typically come with strict requirements, but they can help pay for training employees and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For more than two decades, from a Willy Wonka-like studio in New York’s garment district, Michelle Feinberg’s company, the New York Embroidery Studio, has helped amateurs and brand-name designers embellish garments with decorative stitching, rhinestones, sequins and other items. So, when a longtime client, Ralph Lauren, approached her in 2010 and asked her to help create uniforms for Team USA at the Sochi Olympics, Ms. Feinberg jumped at the chance.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/business/14sbiz-pic1/14sbiz-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/14/business/14sbiz-pic1/14sbiz-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/business/14sbiz-pic1/14sbiz-pic1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/business/14sbiz-pic1/14sbiz-pic1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1348, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 