iminal element. Police can’t do it all. “It’s no longer a spectator sport,” the sheriff told them last year in a public service announcement. “I need you in the game.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.R.A. Model Sheriff Wins in Milwaukee', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-13T19:46:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Francis X. Clines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Francis', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Clines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4da282b5-afb4-5c5d-b95a-8cc557fc9df6', 'word_count': 335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4da282b5-afb4-5c5d-b95a-8cc557fc9df6'}, {'abstract': 'Bentley to introduce the Continental GT3-R in the United States at Pebble Beach; Truecar stock price soars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/automobiles/wheelies-the-99-continental-gt3-rs-edition.html', 'snippet': 'Bentley to introduce the Continental GT3-R in the United States at Pebble Beach; Truecar stock price soars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A roundup of motoring news from the web: ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/automobiles/14WHEELIES/14WHEELIES-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/14/automobiles/14WHEELIES/14WHEELIES-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank':