: 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f82c3c77-4f07-5591-87cc-9837c36dba46', 'word_count': 276, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f82c3c77-4f07-5591-87cc-9837c36dba46'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama has expanded a program that caps monthly student loan repayments at 10 percent of income and lets any balance after 20 years be forgiven.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/your-money/help-is-on-the-way-for-repaying-student-loans.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama has expanded a program that caps monthly student loan repayments at 10 percent of income and lets any balance after 20 years be forgiven.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you are struggling with student loans that you took out before October 2007, there is a new, more generous option in the works that may help you manage your debt payments.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Help Is on the Way for Repaying Student Loans', 'kicker': 'Your Money Adviser', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Student Loans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Orders and Memorandums', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T01:14:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ea386d8-beac-53b7-8e87-bcc70153944f', 'word_count': 731, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ea386d8-beac-53b7-8e87-bcc70153944f'}, {'abstract': 'College sports will have to adjust to a new way of doing business without exploiting the players and students.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/opinion/the-obannon-ruling-college-athletes-win.html', 'snippet': 'College sports will have to adjust to a new way of doing business without exploiting the players and students.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are two important consequences of a long-awaited ruling last week by a federal judge, Claudia Wilken, in the so-called O’Bannon case. College athletes will almost certainly be better off financially. And the notion that these athletes are pure amateurs — “students first, athletes second” — will be impossible to sustain.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The O’Bannon Ruling: College Athletes Win', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Judge Gives College Athletes Their Due', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Collegiate Athletic Assn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Bannon, Ed", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antitrust Laws and Competition Issues', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilken, Claudia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T01:17:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e31abb9-83b4-5d71-b4d9-d55a784284eb', 'word_count': 444, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e31abb9-83b4-5d71-b4d9-d55a784284eb'}, {'abstract': 'That term dates back to the 1950s and worries over legal claims.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/opinion/the-obannon-ruling-student-athlete-is-history.html', 'snippet': 'That term dates back to the 1950s and worries over legal claims.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The myth of the pure “student-athlete” that Judge Claudia Wilken has now demolished has been around for a long time. The term itself is so widely used in conversation (by fans, the news media and the National Collegiate Athletic Association) that it sounds like a neutral description. In fact, it’s a deceptive term with a peculiar history. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The O’Bannon Ruling: ‘Student-Athlete’ Is History', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Myth of the ‘Student-Athlete’ Is Laid to Rest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Collegiate Athletic Assn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Workers' Compensation Insurance", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Byers, Walter', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T01:17:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/021b1531-5b87-5758-ae0d-b57b0894bb99', 'word_count': 391, 'uri': 'nyt://article/021b1531-5b87-5758-ae0d-b57b0894bb99'}, {'abstract': 'As the fading Yankees finished their series with the Orioles, they would have been wise to consider Baltimore’s more prudent construction of its team.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/sports/baseball/balance-outweighs-the-balance-sheet.html', 'snippet': 'As the fading Yankees finished their series with the Orioles, they would have been wise to consider Baltimore’s more prudent construction of its team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — The Baltimore Orioles put their prized third baseman, Manny Machado, on the disabled list Wednesday. They used Chris Davis, a slugger who entered the day with a sub-.200 average and 139 strikeouts, in the No. 2 hole. They did not reach base against Michael Pineda until the fifth inning and looked helpless against reliever Dellin Betances.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/14/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/sports/Y-KEPNER/Y-KEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/14/sports/Y-KEPNER/