 Opera', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gatti, Daniele', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roschmann, Dorothea', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schade, Michael', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stein, Peter', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Salzburg (Austria)', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Il Trovatore (Opera)', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Fierrabras (Opera)', 'rank': 17, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T10:31:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zachary Woolfe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zachary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Woolfe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f9eaed1-2adc-5d4f-b4ec-0cb04db5d940', 'word_count': 1195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f9eaed1-2adc-5d4f-b4ec-0cb04db5d940'}, {'abstract': 'I found fellow runners on Facebook and felt like I’d found a team. But running with others, I soon learned, can have its downsides.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/the-downside-of-running-with-others/', 'snippet': 'I found fellow runners on Facebook and felt like I’d found a team. But running with others, I soon learned, can have its downsides.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My husband won’t talk to me when we run. Me, I need to carry on a conversation from the minute I start running to the minute I stop. The chitchat helps me forget the misery of the task at hand. But more than that, when I run alone, my mind will bully me into slowing down or stopping. When I run with other people, my mind won’t dare speak up – and I wind up running longer and faster than when I run alone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/science/26well_runningwithfriendsb/26well_runningwithfriendsb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/26/science/26well_runningwithfriendsb/26well_runningwithfriendsb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/science/26well_runningwithfriendsb/26well_runningwithfriendsb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/science/26well_runningwithfriendsb/26well_runningwithfriendsb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/science/26well_runningwithfriendsb/26well_runningwithfriendsb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/26/science/26well_runningwithfriendsb/26well_runningwithfriendsb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/26/science/26well_runningwithfriendsb/26well_runningwithfriendsb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Downside of Running With Others', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Running', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T10:41:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Caren Chesler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Caren', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chesler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac8c3bbe-2601-5db3-bd32-04d2cdcefd7a', 'word_count': 920, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac8c3bbe-2601-5db3-bd32-04d2cdcefd7a'}, {'abstract': 'A passenger on the London Underground in 1889 tells a story of a terrifying journey.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/1889-londons-disgrace-painful-experience-of-a-healthy-man-on-the-underground/', 'snippet': 'A passenger on the London Underground in 1889 tells a story of a terrifying journey.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At half-past three o’clock yesterday a well-dressed man of thirty, with clean face, and a buoyant, healthy, contented expression entered the Charing Cross Station of the Underground Railway. At twenty minutes to five he came out again with a greasy, dirty face, with his eyes red, his ears full of cinders, his collar and cuffs soiled, his face pale, and his whole look weary, dejected, and limp. He scarcely seemed to be the same person as he sadly inquired the way to a bath. And he had simply taken a trip around the inner circle to personally undergo what millions of the traveling public have to suffer daily.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/blogs/14iht-retrospective14-poster/14iht-retrospective14-poster-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 952, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/14/blogs/14iht-retrospective14-poster/14iht-retrospective14-poster-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 952}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/blogs/14iht-retrospective14-poster/14iht-retrospective14-poster-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 646, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/blogs/14iht-retrospective14-poster/14iht-retrospective14-poster-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1291, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/blogs/14iht-retrospective14-poster/14iht-retrospective14-poster-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/14/blogs/14iht-retrospective14-poster/14iht-retrospective14-poster-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/blogs/14iht-retrospective14-poster/14iht-retrospective14-poster-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1889: London’s Disgrace. Painful Experience of a Healthy Man on The Underground', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Commuting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'London Underground', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T10:41:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06a1d0da-d84b-5e66-a24f-338e03093edb', 'word_count': 462, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06a1d0da-d84b-5e66-a24f-338e03093edb'}, {'abstract': 'Carillion said it had discussed what it considered the advantages of a merger, including potential annual savings of at least £175 million by 2016.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/in-pursuit-of-balfour-beatty-carillion-meets-with-shareholders/', 'snippet': 'Carillion said it had discussed what it considered the advantages of a merger, including potential annual savings of at least £175 million by 2016.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON – The British construction and support services company Carillion said on Thursday that it still believed a merger with its rival Balfour Beatty made strategic sense and could result in annual savings of 175 million pounds, or about $293 million.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/26/business/dbpix-balfour-beatty/dbpix-balfour-beatty-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1061, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/07/26/business/dbpix-balfour-beatty/dbpix-balfour-beatty-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1061}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/26/business/dbpix-balfour-beatty/dbpix-balfour-beatty-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 579, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/07/26/business/dbpix-balf