ious moments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/15/sports/baseball/mlb-commissioner-inside-the-ballroom-scenes-from-baseballs-election-battle.html', 'snippet': 'The three candidates seeking to succeed Bud Selig as commissioner stated their cases on Wednesday before the owners, and there were some contentious moments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — The Hyatt Regency, a hulking hotel overlooking the harbor here, has a large ballroom on its second floor that, this week, has served as the epicenter for the 30 owners in Major League Baseball seeking to elect a new commissioner.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/sports/15OWNERS/15OWNERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/15/sports/15OWNERS/15OWNERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/sports/15OWNERS/15OWNERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/sports/15OWNERS/15OWNERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1370, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/sports/15OWNERS/15OWNERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/15/sports/15OWNERS/15OWNERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/sports/15OWNERS/15OWNERS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside the Ballroom: Scenes From Baseball’s Election Battle', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inside the Ballroom: Scenes From Baseball’s Election Battle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reinsdorf, Jerry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manfred, Robert D', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brosnan, Tim', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Werner, Tom', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Selig, Bud', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T15:13:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael S. Schmidt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Schmidt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9971e749-2efd-5a4d-93dc-2549a9359d1a', 'word_count': 1047, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9971e749-2efd-5a4d-93dc-2549a9359d1a'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The U.N. fails to control the crisis in Cyprus in 1964.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/1964-u-n-fails-to-control-nicosia/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The U.N. fails to control the crisis in Cyprus in 1964.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NICOSIA — United Nations Cyprus commander Gen. K.S. Thimayya today [Aug. 14] said the U.N. was unable to gain control of the situation in the tense capital city of Nicosia. Gen. Thimayya said he had received ‘‘assurances from both sides’’ that there would be no firing in the area of Kokkina, the only major port still dominated by the Turkish Cypriots. But, he said, he was ‘‘not happy about the situation in Nicosia, where I have been unable to get control of the situation despite all my efforts.’’ A U.N.- patrolled neutral zone (green line) through the city divides Greek and Turkish Cypriots.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, August 15, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus/15iht-oldaug15-cyprus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'imag