ion USA honors emerging artists in dance, theater and film.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/princess-grace-foundation-hands-out-awards/', 'snippet': 'The Princess Grace Foundation USA honors emerging artists in dance, theater and film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Princess Grace Foundation USA, which was established by Prince Rainier III of Monaco after the princess’s death in 1982, announced the winners of the 2014 Princess Grace Awards for emerging artists in dance, theater and film, as well as scholarships in those fields. The winners are nominated by schools and nonprofit performing companies, receive various amounts of money, depending on their needs, as well as a pin by the jewelry artist Alex Soldier. This year the foundation’s awards total nearly $1 million.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Princess Grace Foundation  Hands Out Awards', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AILEY, ALVIN, AMERICAN DANCE THEATER', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Theater Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ballet Memphis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brown, Trisha, Dance Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dance Theater of Harlem', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T16:45:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d63db36-cbdd-5ade-a232-319089f9f3e0', 'word_count': 185