tages of Parkinson’s disease, “which he was not yet ready to share publicly.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/robin-williams-had-parkinsons-disease-his-widow-says/', 'snippet': 'Susan Schneider said that while he struggled with depression and anxiety, he was facing the early stages of Parkinson’s disease, “which he was not yet ready to share publicly.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Robin Williams was suffering from the early stages of Parkinson’s disease, his widow, Susan Schneider, said in a statement on Thursday. His suicide had provoked widespread speculation about his career, finances and mental condition.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/14artsbeat-robin/14artsbeat-robin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 911, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/14artsbeat-robin/14artsbeat-robin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 911}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/14artsbeat-robin/14artsbeat-robin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 675, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/14artsbeat-robin/14artsbeat-robin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 898, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/14artsbeat-robin/14artsbeat-robin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/14artsbeat-robin/14artsbeat-robin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumb