ind investors for their $8.5 million musical. The producers, Howard and Janet Kagan, said on Thursday that they have created a website where any reader can learn about the show and, if they meet certain financial standards, can make an online investment for as little as $10,000 in return for an equity stake in it. To qualify, potential investors must have annual incomes exceeding $200,000 individually or $300,000 jointly, for instance, or have a net worth that exceeds $1 million.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/20/arts/20ONTOWN-copy/20ONTOWN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/06/20/arts/20ONTOWN-copy/20ONTOWN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/20/arts/20ONTOWN-copy/20ONTOWN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/20/arts/20ONTOWN-copy/20ONTOWN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1337, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/20/arts/20ONTOWN-copy/20ONTOWN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/06/20/arts/20ONTOWN-copy/20ONTOWN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/20/arts/20ONTOWN-copy/20ONTOWN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su