m/2014/08/15/business/media/nbc-chooses-chuck-todd-to-replace-david-gregory-on-meet-the-press.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Gregory will leave the network after a two-decade career. Ratings for “Meet the Press” have declined steadily during his tenure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Confirming one of the longest-running and most tortuous rumors in the television business, NBC News announced on Thursday that David Gregory was being removed from his post as anchor of the network’s Sunday morning discussion program “Meet the Press” and would be replaced by Chuck Todd, NBC’s White House correspondent.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/business/Press/Press-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/15/business/Press/Press-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/business/Press/Press-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/business/Press/Press-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/business/Press/Press-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/15/business/Press/Press-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/business/Press/Press-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'NBC Chooses Chuck Todd to Replace David Gregory on ‘Meet the Press’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'NBC Names New Anchor on ‘Meet the Press’ as Viewers Decline', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBC News', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gregory, David', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Todd, Chuck (1972- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Meet the Press (TV Program)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T20:40:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3fe9e8ef-6597-5539-9254-298621aeb6ec', 'word_count': 790, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3fe9e8ef-6597-5539-9254-298621aeb6ec'}, {'abstract': 'In “Moebius,” the South Korean director Kim Ki-duk tells a silent tale of a maddened mother who slices off her son’s penis in revenge for her husband’s infidelity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/15/movies/moebius-directed-by-kim-ki-duk.html', 'snippet': 'In “Moebius,” the South Korean director Kim Ki-duk tells a silent tale of a maddened mother who slices off her son’s penis in revenge for her husband’s infidelity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Part grotesque comedy, part soft-core fetish curiosity, “Moebius” is, you hope, not seriously intended as much else. The South Korean director Kim Ki-duk throws down the gauntlet (and something else) with his opening setup, in which a maddened mother slices off her son’s penis in revenge for her husband’s infidelity. (That’s after trying her spouse first.) Love does not quite conquer all afterward, though it does eventually lead to an especially altruistic father-son transplant.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15MOEBIUS/15MOEBIUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15MOEBIUS/15MOEBIUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15MOEBIUS/15MOEBIUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15MOEBIUS/15MOEBIUS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15MOEBIUS/15MOEBIUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15MOEBIUS/15MOEBIUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15MOEBIUS/15MOEBIUS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sins of a Father Visited Upon a Son', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 