 reflecting expectations that his influence must go to pave the way for President Xi Jinping’s program of change for China.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/after-tigers-and-flies-now-a-spider-jiang-zemin/', 'snippet': 'Images purporting to show the name of the former leader Jiang Zemin being taken down from public buildings have caused a stir, reflecting expectations that his influence must go to pave the way for President Xi Jinping’s program of change for Chin...', 'lead_paragraph': 'For months, the political conversation among China’s chattering classes has been of “tigers” and “flies,” the big and small officials who are victims of President Xi Jinping’s anticorruption-campaign-cum-political-purge that is taking down hundreds, possibly thousands of people, as he consolidates power.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/world/14sino-spider01/14sino-spider01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/14/world/14sino-spider01/14sino-spider01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/world/14sino-spider01/14sino-spider01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/world/14sino-spider01/14sino-spider01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/world/14sino-spider01/14sino-spider01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/14/world/14sino-spider01/14sino-spider01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/world/14sino-spider01/14sino-spider01-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Tigers and Flies, Now a Spider: Jiang Zemin', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jiang Mianheng', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jiang Zemin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Xi Jinping', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Xu Caihou', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zhou Yongkang', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of China', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Global Times', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shanghai (China)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-14T22:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Didi Kirsten Tatlow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Didi', 'middlename': 'Kirsten', 'lastname': 'Tatlow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/46b93db6-637e-57c2-a2e0-8d16d0bd5520', 'word_count': 935, 'uri': 'nyt://article/46b93db6-637e-57c2-a2e0-8d16d0bd5520'}, {'abstract': 'The Drive East festival of Indian dance and music at La MaMa takes audiences deep into the mystery of acting and identity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/15/arts/dance/indian-dance-and-music-at-the-drive-east-festival.html', 'snippet': 'The Drive East festival of Indian dance and music at La MaMa takes audiences deep into the mystery of acting and identity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the current one-week Drive East festival of Indian dance and music at La MaMa, each artist or group has just one performance. Several of the performers are little known. You just have to go along, take a risk and learn from them all. The quality is high; the styles are varied. Some of the music has been even better than the dance — perhaps because almost all of the dance has been to taped music, whereas the recitals by instrumentalists, bands and singers have filled the act of music-making with delight and immediacy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15SUBFESTIVAL/SUB-FESTIVAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15SUBFESTIVAL/SUB-FESTIVAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15SUBFESTIVAL/SUB-FESTIVAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/arts/15SUBFESTIVAL/SUB-FESTIVAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1300, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '