ams-auctions-a-ferrari-250-gto-for-38-million-at-pebble-beach.html', 'snippet': 'A Ferrari GTO raced in the 1960s set a new record for a car sold at auction, though it fell short of some expectations.', 'lead_paragraph': "CARMEL, Calif. — A Ferrari 250 GTO Berlinetta, one of 36 built in 1961-64, sold for $38.1 million at the Bonhams Quail Lodge Auction here on Thursday evening. The sale is one of many events taking place this week on the Monterey Peninsula of California in conjunction with Sunday’s Pebble Beach Concours d'Élégance.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bonhams Auctions a Ferrari 250 GTO for $38 Million at Pebble Beach', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antique and Classic Cars', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bonhams 1793 Ltd', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ferrari SpA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Carmel (Calif)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Pebble Beach Concours D'Elegance (Car Show)", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-15T01:04:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'subsection_name': 'Collectible Cars', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leo Levine', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Levine', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f5dea41-14f9-5984-9767-30b7997f39d9', 'word_count': 248, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f5dea41-14f9-5984-9767-30b7997f39d9'}, {'abstract': 'With her steel spine, gutsy flirtation, and unmistakable presence, Lauren Bacall created a new film noir feminine ideal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/15/opinion/david-brooks-the-bacall-standard.html', 'snippet': 'With her steel spine, gutsy flirtation, and unmistakable presence, Lauren Bacall created a new film noir feminine ideal.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I believe the really good people would be reasonably successful in any circumstance,” the detective writer Raymond Chandler wrote in his notebook in 1949. If Shakespeare came back today, “he would have refused to die in a corner.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/brooks-circular/brooks-circular-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 588, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/brooks-circular/brooks-circular-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 588}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/brooks-circular/brooks-circular-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1003, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/brooks-circular/brooks-circular-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1852, 'width': 1891, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/brooks-circular/brooks-circular-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/brooks-circular/brooks-circular-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 