3e-42b0811fcf4b'}, {'abstract': 'Some people are arguing that security problems on the web go way beyond whether you put that extra number in your password.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/15/that-in-your-password-for-better-security-useless/', 'snippet': 'Some people are arguing that security problems on the web go way beyond whether you put that extra number in your password.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you rushed to change your password last week on the heels of news that Russian hackers might have gotten their hands on an enormous amount of login information, go ahead and keep on panicking. Robert McMillan at Wired warns that even your weirdest-looking, hardest-to-type passwords may not keep you safe.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/opinion/nyto-password/nyto-password-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/14/opinion/nyto-password/nyto-password-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/opinion/nyto-password/nyto-password-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1014, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/opinion/nyto-password/nyto-password-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2028, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/opinion/nyto-password/nyto-password-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/14/opinion/nyto-password/nyto-password