', 'snippet': 'Ford issued the recall because of a stalling problem on 2-liter turbo-power Escape crossovers and Fiesta ST hatchbacks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ford is recalling about 160,000 Focus ST hatchbacks and Escape crossovers from the 2013-14 model years because the turbocharged, 2-liter 4-cylinder engine may lose power or stall, the automaker said Friday. The action includes about 133,000 vehicles in the United States and 25,000 in Canada.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16RECALL-image/16RECALL-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 311, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16RECALL-image/16RECALL-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 311}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16RECALL-image/16RECALL-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 835, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16RECALL-image/16RECALL-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 835, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16RECALL-image/16RECALL-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16RECALL-image/16RECALL-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16RECALL-image