 edited the book, the show opens this week in three art galleries on three continents. “I’ve always been the type of person who is more interested in what’s underneath the surface,” says Warren, 26. “It’s about a deeper sense of connection.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Portraits of Loved Ones, in Three Galleries on Three Continents', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-15T17:30:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nadja Sayej', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nadja', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sayej', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c73b964-490f-5005-9aa0-80f223422f65', 'word_count': 239, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c73b964-490f-5005-9aa0-80f223422f65'}, {'abstract': 'Four products meant to reinvigorate the skin as they keep it hydrated may help you beat the heat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/14/fashion/four-products-that-may-help-beat-the-heat.html', 'snippet': 'Four products meant to reinvigorate the skin as they keep it hydrated may help you beat the heat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Looking for a fashionable way to cool down this August? These four beauty products may help you beat the heat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/14/fashion/14COOLOFF1/14COOLOFF1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 568, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/14/fashion/14COOLOFF1/14COOLOFF1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 568}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo'