pop culture staple.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/16/automobiles/autoreviews/video-a-new-cadillac-escalade-still-large-and-in-charge.html', 'snippet': 'Although some doubted that the Escalade would ever be much more than a dressed-up Tahoe, it has evolved since 1999 to become a pop culture staple.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cars and S.U.V.s are not solely about transportation. If that were the case, we’d all be driving old Honda Civics and Ford Explorers. People want to drive their personalities, and because of that, the Cadillac Escalade looms large in pop culture. And if merely big isn’t big enough, Cadillac offers the ESV model that I recently tested, with a wheelbase 14 inches longer than the standard model’s.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16DRIVEN/16DRIVEN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16DRIVEN/16DRIVEN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 327}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16DRIVEN/16DRIVEN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16DRIVEN/16DRIVEN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16DRIVEN/16DRIVEN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/16/automobiles/16DRIVEN/16DRIVEN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 't