94fbfe6'}, {'abstract': 'On television, male actors and even the occasional reality star have been putting on an unintentional clinic in how (and sometimes, how not) to look grim.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/17/arts/television/on-tv-a-near-epidemic-of-frowns-and-clenched-jaws.html', 'snippet': 'On television, male actors and even the occasional reality star have been putting on an unintentional clinic in how (and sometimes, how not) to look grim.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s been a grim summer. Especially for men, mostly middle-aged white ones. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17GRIM-COMBO/17GRIM-combo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17GRIM-COMBO/17GRIM-combo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17GRIM-COMBO/17GRIM-combo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17GRIM-COMBO/17GRIM-combo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17GRIM-COMBO/17GRIM-combo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17GRIM-COMBO/17GRIM-combo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', '