/a-review-of-blue-hill-at-stone-barns-in-pocantico-hills.html', 'snippet': 'A meal at Blue Hill at Stone Barns, in Pocantico Hills, with fresh, unexpected ingredients presented in novel ways, is intended to change the way you think about food.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Should we eat this next?” asked my dining companion as he gestured toward the wildflower bouquet on our table at Blue Hill at Stone Barns. It wasn’t a surreal question. We had already had a serving of “weeds” that ranged from pleasantly bitter to intensely sweet, a drink made with nasturtium, a pot of pea shoots brought to the table with scissors and instructions to cut the greens and drag them through an accompanying tarragon pesto.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINEWE3/17DINEWE3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINEWE3/17DINEWE3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINEWE3/17DINEWE3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINEWE3/17DINEWE3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINEWE3/17DINEWE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINEWE3/17DINEWE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnail