 lose their apartment after they marry, say they found that being friends in real life enriched their roles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/17/movies/john-lithgow-and-alfred-molina-play-a-longtime-couple.html', 'snippet': 'John Lithgow and Alfred Molina, who star in “Love Is Strange” as a longtime couple who lose their apartment after they marry, say they found that being friends in real life enriched their roles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a recent afternoon, the actors John Lithgow, 68, and Alfred Molina, 61, were sitting side by side in spread-collar shirts, munching on club sandwiches in a private meeting room at the Loews Regency Hotel on the Upper East Side of Manhattan. Both men live in Los Angeles, but Mr. Lithgow was in New York playing the title role in “King Lear” at Shakespeare in the Park, and Mr. Molina had caught Mr. Lithgow onstage the night before.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17STRANGE1/17STRANGE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17STRANGE1/17STRANGE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17STRANGE1/17STRANGE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17STRANGE1/17STRANGE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1268, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/arts/17STRANGE1/17STRANGE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height