ct': 'The dangers of “normalizing” policy in a world where normal isn’t what it used to be.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/15/all-about-zero/', 'snippet': 'The dangers of “normalizing” policy in a world where normal isn’t what it used to be.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The VoxEU servers were briefly overwhelmed by hits after I linked to their new ebook on secular stagnation, but you should be able to download it now. And I guess I should say a few more words about why it matters so much.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'All About Zero', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-08-15T22:04:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/890571eb-2c4d-5644-bcc2-e3532a67bb0d', 'word_count': 353, 'uri': 'nyt://article/890571eb-2c4d-5644-bcc2-e3532a67bb0d'}, {'abstract': 'Katie Orlinsky traveled throughout northern Mali for almost a month, speaking with women who had lived under Shariah law imposed by Islamic radicals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/08/15/blogs/20140815-lens-orlinksy.html', 'snippet': 'Katie Orlinsky traveled throughout northern Mali for almost a month, speaking with women who had lived under Shariah law imposed by Islamic radicals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Katie Orlinsky traveled throughout northern Mali for almost a month, speaking with women who had lived under Shariah law imposed by Islamic radicals.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/15/blogs/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O/20140815-lens-orlinksy-slide-YT7O-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Women Beyond the Veil in Mali', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-08-15T22:07:48+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Blogs', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'b