es.com/2014/08/17/nyregion/a-review-of-la-isla-in-hoboken.html', 'snippet': 'La Isla, a Cuban restaurant in Hoboken that celebrated its 19th year in June, has achieved a winning formula.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In summer, I think of skirt steaks. My mother, not known for her talent in the kitchen, tossed these on a very hot grill, and when the outside was charred and the inside was just shy of raw, she removed the steaks, sliced them and inserted the pieces into the pillow-soft onion rolls for which our local bakery was famous. At least on summer weekends, we ate well.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINENJ3/17DINENJ3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINENJ3/17DINENJ3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINENJ3/17DINENJ3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINENJ3/17DINENJ3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINENJ3/17DINENJ3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17DINENJ3/17DINENJ3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 