f the Missouri State Highway Patrol has represented law and order along with the fear and anger of Ferguson, Mo., residents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FERGUSON, Mo. — The governor of Missouri was the first person to speak at the news conference on Friday morning. But as has been the case since Capt. Ronald S. Johnson of the State Highway Patrol first entered the drama of race, violence and trust swirling in this St. Louis suburb, the veteran trooper dominated it.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/us/JP-JOHNSON/JP-JOHNSON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/16/us/JP-JOHNSON/JP-JOHNSON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/us/JP-JOHNSON/JP-JOHNSON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/us/JP-JOHNSON/JP-JOHNSON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/us/JP-JOHNSON/JP-JOHNSON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/16/us/JP-JOHNSON/JP-JOHNSON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/16/us/JP-JOHNSON/JP-JOHNSON-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trooper Listens to, and Connects With, a Ferguson Torn by Violent Unrest', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trooper Listens to, and Connects With, a Ferguson Torn by Violent Unrest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Ronald S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blinder, Alan S', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Michael (1996-2014)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ferguson (Mo)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-16T01:58:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Blinder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Blinder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8184472c-1057-5911-a278-44cf98ce358d', 'word_count': 1025, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8184472c-1057-5911-a278-44cf98ce358d'}, {'abstract': 'A virtually perfect Saturday brain twister by Peter Broda.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/15/crack-a-bottle/', 'snippet': 'A virtually perfect Saturday brain twister by Peter Broda.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SATURDAY’S PUZZLE — Peter Broda is a very modest man. He’d probably even say that he doesn’t deserve a compliment like that, being that he’s so modest. I say this because Mr. Broda doesn’t believe that today’s puzzle is very good, but I disagree. I think it’s almost perfect, at least by my own solving standards.', 'sou