arines confronted demonstrators in Ferguson, Mo., a strange convoy headed to Ukraine and the world mourned the loss of a gifted comedian.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/17/opinion/sunday/ferguson-robin-williams-and-the-russian-convoy.html', 'snippet': 'This week police outfitted like Marines confronted demonstrators in Ferguson, Mo., a strange convoy headed to Ukraine and the world mourned the loss of a gifted comedian.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A psychiatrist once told me that people tend to focus more on bad news because human beings are genetically wired to identify dangers they should thereafter avoid. If so, people following the rioting in the small Missouri town of Ferguson most likely came away sensing that the danger to avoid was not the rioters, angered by the police killing of an unarmed 18-year-old African-American, but the police confronting the demonstrators, decked out like Marines preparing to retake Falluja.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/sunday-review/0817SERGE/0817SERGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/17/sunday-review/0817SERGE/0817SERGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/sunday-review/0817SERGE/0817SERGE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/sunday-review/0817SERGE/0817SERGE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1228, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima