prieve from deportation. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fixing Immigration in the Field', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fixing Immigration in the Field', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Immigration and Customs Enforcement (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deportation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-16T18:34:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9651a9be-6246-549a-ba30-25c993cb699f', 'word_count': 766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9651a9be-6246-549a-ba30-25c993cb699f'}, {'abstract': 'How warrior policing found its way to Ferguson, Mo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/17/opinion/sunday/ross-douthat-playing-soldier-in-the-suburbs.html', 'snippet': 'How warrior policing found its way to Ferguson, Mo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TO understand what’s been happening in Ferguson, Mo., where protests and violence following a cop’s shooting of an unarmed teenager summoned up a police response that looked more like a military invasion, it helps to flash back to the heyday of the Symbionese Liberation Army.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capt