uis Pink Houses in the East New York neighborhood on Saturday, evacuating some residents.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/16/bomb-scare-in-brooklyn-causes-false-alarm/', 'snippet': 'The police responded to reports of a possible explosive device at the Louis Pink Houses in the East New York neighborhood on Saturday, evacuating some residents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The police responded to reports of a possible explosive device at the Louis Pink Houses in the East New York neighborhood on Saturday, evacuating some residents. The device, described by the authorities initially as what “appears to be sticks of dynamite wrapped in wires,” was determined by the bomb squad to be wooden sticks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17FLOATERweb/17FLOATERweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17FLOATERweb/17FLOATERweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17FLOATERweb/17FLOATERweb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17FLOATERweb/17FLOATERweb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17FLOATERweb/17FLOATERweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/17/nyregion/17FLOATERweb/17FLOATERweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'th