nytimes.com/2014/08/17/us/traffic-offense-program-is-seen-as-a-trap-for-poor-drivers-but-proves-hard-to-kill.html', 'snippet': 'Critics have called for an end to Texas’ Driver Responsibility Program, which assesses surcharges on certain traffic offenses, arguing that it traps poor citizens in a cycle of missed payments and suspended licenses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AUSTIN — When Charles Farmer was pulled over for turning without signaling on last Thanksgiving morning, he learned that his license had been suspended for failing to pay surcharges on traffic tickets he had already paid. Shocked, Mr. Farmer took out his phone and paid the surcharges from the side of the road. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Traffic Offense Program Is Seen as a Trap for Poor Drivers, but Proves Hard to Kill', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Traffic Offense Program Is Seen as a Trap for Poor Drivers, but Proves Hard to Kill', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic and Parking Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public Safety Department (Tex)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poverty', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-16T22:15:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gilad Edelman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gilad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Edelman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e669deb1-3155-5e09-9a8a-1356c65ae04a', 'word_count': 688, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e669deb1-3155-5e09-9a8a-1356c65ae04a'}, {'abstract': 'Elwood Reid, the executive producer of the FX border drama, said the series wasn’t intended to be torn straight from the headlines, yet the news from Texas has only heightened its relevance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/17/us/the-bridge-isnt-real-it-just-seems-that-way.html', 'snippet': 'Elwood Reid, the executive producer of the FX border drama, said the series wasn’t intended to be torn straight from the headlines, yet the news from Texas has only heightened its relevance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year, the FX program “The Bridge” won a Peabody Award for “raising awareness of border issues,” and many of the plotlines were based on the realities of life in El Paso and its violence-stricken Mexican sister city a bridge away, Ciudad Juárez.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/us/17ttCulture1/17ttCulture1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 518, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/17/us/17ttCulture1/17ttCulture1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 518}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/us/17ttCulture1/17ttCulture1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 885, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/us/17ttCulture1/17ttCulture1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1769, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/17/us/17ttCulture1/17ttCulture1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/17/us/17ttCulture1/17ttCulture1-thumbStandard.jpg', '