es to tamp down the outrage, the most chaotic violence in a week of unrest broke out in Ferguson, Mo., on Sunday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FERGUSON, Mo. — Hours ahead of a second night of a mandatory curfew, the most chaotic violence in a week of unrest broke out here Sunday evening, with law enforcement officers facing off against angry protesters and responding to reports of gunfire and fire bombs.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Violence Flares in Ferguson After Appeals for Harmony', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Violence Flares After Appeals for Harmony', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Michael (1996-2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blinder, Alan S', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vega, Tanzina', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ferguson (Mo)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nixon, Jay', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Curfews', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Darren (1986- )', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-17T07:34:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Blinder and Tanzina Vega', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Blinder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Tanzina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vega', 'qualif