ing-for-africa-force/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The United States considers underwriting troops in the Congo in 1964.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LEOPOLDVILLE — The United States today appeared ready to underwrite an African peace-keeping operation in the Congo. The U.S. position was outlined at a press conference by G. Mennen Williams, U.S. assistant secretary of state for African affairs. Asked if the United States would contribute to the cost of maintaining African troops in the Congo, Mr. Williams said the U.S. government ‘‘would try to do what was helpful in that regard.’’\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, August 19, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/blogs/19iht-oldaug19-congo/19iht-oldaug19-congo-jumbo.png', 'height': 367, 'width': 423, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/blogs/19iht-oldaug19-congo/19iht-oldaug19-congo-superJumbo.png', 'height': 367, 'width': 423, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/blogs/19iht-oldaug19-congo/19iht-oldaug19-congo-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/19/blogs/19iht-oldaug19-congo/19iht-oldaug19-congo-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/blogs/19iht-oldaug19-congo/19iht-oldaug19-congo-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1964: U.S. Financing for Africa Force', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Congo, Democratic Republic of (Congo-Kinshasa)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-18T14:25:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e75379ad-b243-50a4-8312-3d4879b72d09', 'word_count': 80, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e75379ad-b243-50a4-8312-3d4879b72d09'}, {'abstract': 'The Financial Industry Regulatory Authority accused Wedbush of failing to maintain proper controls, allowing customers to “flood” exchanges with trades and create the illusion of demand.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/08/18/finra-says-wedbush-securities-failed-to-detect-manipulative-trades/', 'snippet': 'The Financial Industry Regulatory Authority accused Wedbush of failing to maintain proper controls, allowing customers to “flood” exchanges with trades and create the illusion of demand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Wall Street regulator accused Wedbush Securities on Monday of failing to adequately supervise its customers as it gave them access to the stock market.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/business/dbpix-wedbush/dbpix-wedbush-articleLarge.png', 'height': 504, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/18/business/dbpix-wedbush/dbpix-wedbush-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheigh