cle/f531f6cb-4d08-5191-b8c4-03086b0deb12'}, {'abstract': 'Long angered by allegations of U.S. spying, Germany itself was accused of espionage, including picking up conversations involving Hillary Rodham Clinton and John Kerry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/19/world/europe/turkey-outraged-at-reports-of-german-spying.html', 'snippet': 'Long angered by allegations of U.S. spying, Germany itself was accused of espionage, including picking up conversations involving Hillary Rodham Clinton and John Kerry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — After angrily insisting for months that “friends don’t spy,” the German government struggled Monday to respond to news media reports that its intelligence services routinely spy on Turkey, a NATO ally, and inadvertently captured at least one conversation each involving Hillary Rodham Clinton when she was secretary of state and her successor, John Kerry.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Turkey Expresses Outrage at Reports of Routine Spying by Germany, a NATO Ally', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turkey Expresses Outrage at Reports of Routine Spying by Germany, a NATO Ally', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eddy, Melissa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arsu, Sebnem', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wiretapping and Other Eavesdropping Devices and Methods', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerry, John', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-18T18:17:39+0000', 'document_type': 'articl