{'firstname': 'Hanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozlowska', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a390e8c1-6d81-5e90-b0d2-d1e51c43d047', 'word_count': 823, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a390e8c1-6d81-5e90-b0d2-d1e51c43d047'}, {'abstract': 'The hints suggest a new album, “Syro,” could be coming soon.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/18/aphex-twin-teases-a-new-album-via-blimp-spray-paint-and-the-deep-web/', 'snippet': 'The hints suggest a new album, “Syro,” could be coming soon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The reclusive electronic music producer Richard D. James, who works under the name Aphex Twin, has hinted that he may be preparing to release his first collection of new music since his 2001 album “Drukqs.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/arts/18artsbeat-aphex/18artsbeat-aphex-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 786, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/18/arts/18artsbeat-aphex/18artsbeat-aphex-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 786}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/arts/18artsbeat-aphex/18artsbeat-aphex-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 782, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/arts/18artsbeat-aphex/18artsbeat-aphex-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1564, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/arts/18artsbeat-aphex/18artsbeat-aphex-th