tors are taking a closer look at the inadvertent deployment of side air bags in 2008 Accords. Some owners said the air bags deployed when they slammed the door.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/19/automobiles/nhtsa-deepens-investigation-of-honda-accord-air-bags.html', 'snippet': 'Regulators are taking a closer look at the inadvertent deployment of side air bags in 2008 Accords. Some owners said the air bags deployed when they slammed the door.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Federal regulators have intensified an investigation into the inadvertent deployment of side air bags on 2008 Honda Accords. The action comes as owners of Accords from the 2003-4 and 2008 model years face a deadline next month to file claims in a class-action suit over a similar problem.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/automobiles/19CLASS-image/19CLASS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/19/automobiles/19CLASS-image/19CLASS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/automobiles/19CLASS-image/19CLASS-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/automobiles/19CLASS-image/19CLASS-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/automobiles/19CLASS-image/19CLASS-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail':