ents at Artisan Resource at NY Now, which runs through Tuesday on Pier 94, visitors created a disturbance at the booth of the Sulafa Embroidery Center from Gaza, a nonprofit organization founded in 1950 by a United Nations agency that employs impoverished refugee women to produce items like shawls, decorative pillows and Christmas ornaments. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/garden/18gift_image1/18gift_image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 200, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/18/garden/18gift_image1/18gift_image1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 200}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/garden/18gift_image1/18gift_image1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 225, 'width': 675, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/garden/18gift_image1/18gift_image1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 225, 'width': 675, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/garden/18gift_image1/18gift_image1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/18/garden/18gift_image1/18gift_image1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/18/garden/18gift_image1/18gift_image1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Manhattan Trade Show, an Unexpected Display',