ng Group, the brainchild of Kareemah Batts, of Brooklyn, is helping paraclimbers, some of whom have been training for the world championships in Spain next month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After working a shift at Big Happy’s, a now-defunct indoor skate and BMX bike park in Northeast Ohio, Jon Sedor and some friends were setting off homemade fireworks out back. Sedor cocked his arm back to throw one. He remembers a flash and a loud pop next to his left ear, “then it was over.” The concussion left Sedor in a daze, his ears ringing. “I looked down and my arm was shredded,” he said.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Group Lifts Paraclimbers to Higher Goals', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Group Lifts Paraclimbers to Higher Goals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DiNunzio, Jeff', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Climbing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Adaptive Climbing Group', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disabilities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AMPUTATION', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Batts, Kareemah', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Boulders', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-19T01:01:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff DiNunzio', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'DiNunzio', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd214177-63dd-5131-a78d-d413eca931d1', 'word_count': 1644, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd214177-63dd-51