cle/49d4fab5-2a54-5fd3-88c7-1d69a898b373'}, {'abstract': 'The popular election of Recep Tayyip Erdogan as its next president creates political uncertainties for his country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/19/opinion/will-recep-tayyip-erdogan-extend-the-presidential-powers.html', 'snippet': 'The popular election of Recep Tayyip Erdogan as its next president creates political uncertainties for his country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is no surprise that Recep Tayyip Erdogan won Turkey’s first direct election for president. He has served as prime minister since 2002 and, over the intervening years, has skillfully, and ruthlessly, established control and cowed any serious opposition, which was weak to begin with. The victory was not as big as many predicted. Even so, Mr. Erdogan and his ambitions have created new uncertainties for his country and the United States and other NATO members who depend on Turkey to be the bulwark of the alliance’s eastern front.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Threats to Democracy in Turkey', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Threats to Democracy in Turkey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erdogan, Recep Tayyip', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-19T02:01:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6e285cc-9060-5c46-93ec-88decc949a47', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6e285cc-9060-5c46-93ec-88decc949a47'}, {'abstract': 'Did David Wright’s 2014 decline hinge on a headfirst dive into second that resulted in an injured shoulder on June 12? Executives, coaches and fans are left to wonder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/19/sports/baseball/david-wrights-innocuous-slide-precedes-a-precipitous-tumble.html', 'snippet': 'Did David Wright’s 2014 decline hinge on a headfirst dive into second that resulted in an injured shoulder on June 12? Executives, coaches and fans are left to wonder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a rainy evening June 12 at Citi Field, in the 11th inning of a tie game against the Milwaukee Brewers, David Wright took off from first base on a steal attempt and dived safely into second. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/sports/y-wright/y-wright-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/19/sports/y-wright/y-wright-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/sports/y-wright/y-wright-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/sports/y-wright/y-wright-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1281, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/sports/y-wright/y-wright-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/19/sports/y-wright/y-wright-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0