53', 'word_count': 941, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02736e27-cf89-5e3e-aeb1-781b49ac7553'}, {'abstract': 'A home health aide cannot sue a couple with dementia for an injury sustained while caring for them, the California Supreme Court has ruled.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/19/california-court-limits-caregiver-suits/', 'snippet': 'A home health aide cannot sue a couple with dementia for an injury sustained while caring for them, the California Supreme Court has ruled.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The California Supreme Court has ruled that a home health aide may not sue a client with Alzheimer’s disease for an injury incurred on the job. The case is one of the first in the nation to assess legal remedies available to paid caregivers who work with Alzheimer’s patients at home. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'California Court Limits Caregiver Suits', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "Alzheimer's Disease", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dementia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Home Health Care', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Workers' Compensation Insurance", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-19T09:00:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judith Graham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Graham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7474c991-bc2b-5113-adcc-87b1d38ca4ff', 'word_count': 579, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7474c991-bc2b-5113-adc