er created an installation for the High Line billboard that incorporates an image from Sotheby’s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An interior scene from the world of art will be on very public display in the next High Line billboard, at West 18th Street and 10th Avenue. For the 15th installation in the billboard series, the artist Louise Lawler has created “Triangle (adjusted to fit)” (2008/2009/2011), an image photographed in a room at Sotheby’s auction house in New York, and itself featuring works by artists Donald Judd, Frank Stella and Sol LeWitt.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/arts/design/19HIGHLINE/19HIGHLINE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/19/arts/design/19HIGHLINE/19HIGHLINE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/arts/design/19HIGHLINE/19HIGHLINE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/arts/design/19HIGHLINE/19HIGHLINE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/19/arts/design/19HIGHLINE/19HIGHLINE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/19/arts/design/19HIGHLINE/19HIGHLINE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'