collapse, they have chosen Haider al-Abadi.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Next Leader May Echo Maliki, but Iraqis Hope for New Results', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Next Premier May Echo Maliki, but Iraqis Hope for New Results', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abadi, Haider al-', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arango, Tim', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon, Michael R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maliki, Nuri Kamal al-', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shiite Muslims', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sunni Muslims', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kurds', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic Dawa Party', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hussein, Saddam', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-19T16:34:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Arango and Michael R. Gordon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arango', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Gordon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef8d1de1-3db8-5a78-808c-8ddef5423efb', 'word_count': 1669, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef8d1de1-3db8-5a78-808c-8ddef5423efb'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Hallberg, a principal dancer with American Ballet Theater, has withdrawn from performances this fall because of a foot injury.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/19/david-hallberg-citing-injury-withdraws-from-dance-performances/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Hallberg, a principal dancer with American Ballet Theater, has withdrawn from performances this fall because of a foot injury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Hallberg, a principal dancer with American Ballet Theater, and the first American to join the Bolshoi Ballet as a principal, has withdrawn from his performance commitments through the fall because of an injury, Mr. Hallberg announced through a spokeswoman on Tuesday. Mr. Hallberg had danced with both companies during the summer, but has been advised by his doctors that he needs ankle surgery.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/19artsbeat-hallberg/19artsbeat-hallberg-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/19artsbeat-hallberg/19artsbeat-hallberg-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 801}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/19artsbeat-hallberg/19artsbeat-hallberg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 767, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/19artsbeat-hallberg/19artsbeat-hallberg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1534, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/19artsbeat-hallberg/19artsbeat-hallberg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 7