t the country is a puppet of Washington.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, August 20, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1964: Saigon Moves U.S. Monument', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Monuments and Memorials (Structures)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kennedy, John Fitzgerald', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ho Chi Minh City (Vietnam)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Vietnam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-19T17:02:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/49c5e0e4-6819-5b53-98b7-e5e3adf347c1', 'word_count': 95, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49c5e0e4-6819-5b53-98b7-e5e3adf347c1'}, {'abstract': 'Jabbar Collins spent 16 years in prison for the 1994 killing of an Orthodox rabbi. His case exposed several questionable tactics used by the Brooklyn district attorney’s office.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/20/nyregion/jabbar-collins-wrongfully-convicted-man-reaches-10-million-settlement-with-new-york-city.html', 'snippet': 'Jabbar Collins spent 16 years in prison for the 1994 killing of an Orthodox rabbi. His case exposed several questionable tactics used by the Brooklyn district attorney’s office.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After three years of litigation, Jabbar Collins, a man who spent 16 years in prison for a murder he did not commit, has reached a $10 million settlement with New York City.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 's