eague after having worked a record 2,635 regular-season games and 270 playoff contests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dick Bavetta refereed his first N.B.A. game on Dec. 2, 1975, at Madison Square Garden. That night, Dave Cowens had 25 points and 21 rebounds, before fouling out, to lead the Boston Celtics past the Knicks in front of a crowd announced at 19,694. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1400, 'width': 1998, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/CITY-NBA/CITY-NBA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dick Bavetta, N.B.A. Referee for 39 Years, Is Retiring', 'kick