untry, where swimming is the national pastime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/20/sports/michael-phelps-swimming-in-australia-is-right-at-home.html', 'snippet': 'As Michael Phelps prepares for the Pan Pacific Championships in Australia, he is closely watched by the competition’s host country, where swimming is the national pastime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SOUTHPORT, Australia — This is not Michael Phelps’s first circus, so when he arrived at the Gold Coast Aquatic Centre on Tuesday morning and saw that the 10-lane 50-meter racing pool was quickly filling with competitors in this week’s Pan Pacific Championships, he wove his way through the crowded deck and beneath the corporate boxes to an eight-lane, 50-meter training pool that is also part of the sprawling outdoor complex. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/Y-SWIMMING/Y-SWIMMING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/Y-SWIMMING/Y-SWIMMING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/Y-SWIMMING/Y-SWIMMING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 653, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/Y-SWIMMING/Y-SWIMMING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1307, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/Y-SWIMMING/Y-SWIMMING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy':