o federal contractors.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Right to Cheat and Maim?', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Right to Cheat and Maim?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Contracts and Procurement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Orders and Memorandums', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Government Accountability Office', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Franchise Assn', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Associated Builders and Contractors', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-20T00:59:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/4af78cd1-efdc-5280-aef3-6bbab32ed0ac', 'word_count': 458, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4af78cd1-efdc-5280-aef3-6bbab32ed0ac'}, {'abstract': 'India overreacted in canceling peace talks between the two countries. They should plan to meet and talk at the United Nations in New York next month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/20/opinion/prime-minister-modi-fumbles-on-pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'India overreacted in canceling peace talks between the two countries. They should plan to meet and talk at the United Nations in New York next month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'India’s prime minister, Narendra Modi, fumbled an early test of leadership this week when he canceled a high-level meeting with Pakistan. There are no two countries in the world that need to talk, and talk regularly, more than these nuclear-armed South Asian neighbors whose tensions must be carefully managed.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Prime Minister Modi Fumbles on Pakistan', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prime Minister Modi Fumbles on Pakistan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Modi, Narendra', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharif, Nawaz', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir and Jammu (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-20T01:02:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc9b35ba-373a-5e17-9529-969695a978e9', 'word_count': 576, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc9b35ba-373a-5e17-9529-969695a978e9'}, {'abstract': 'Chancellor Angela Merkel of Germany is emerging more and more as a pivotal leader on the Ukraine conflict as she dances delicately between opposing forces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/20/world/europe/german-leader-emerges-as-key-figure-in-ukraine-talks.html', 'snippet': 'Chancellor Angela Merkel of Germany is emerging more and more as a pivotal leader on the Ukraine conflict as she dances delicate