s and Latin America.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/20/arts/edward-g-leffingwell-curator-dies-at-72.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Leffingwell brought avant-garde artists to the attention of the public in New York, Los Angeles and Latin America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Edward G. Leffingwell, a critic and curator who organized three important exhibitions at MoMA/P.S. 1 in Long Island City, Queens — most notably a survey of the experimental filmmaker Jack Smith — and who as director of the Los Angeles Municipal Art Gallery initiated a citywide biennial of contemporary art, died on Aug. 5 in Flushing, Queens. He was 72.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/LEFFINGWELL-obit/LEFFINGWELL-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/LEFFINGWELL-obit/LEFFINGWELL-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/LEFFINGWELL-obit/LEFFINGWELL-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/LEFFINGWELL-obit/LEFFINGWELL-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/LEFFINGWELL-obit/LEFFINGWELL-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/20/arts/LEFFINGWELL-obit/LEFFINGWELL-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thu