 out in each of his first four at-bats, crushed a tie-breaking three-run homer against closer David Robertson.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Yankees recognize the urgency of their situation as they attempt to keep the Baltimore Orioles from running away with the American League East and try to seal a postseason bid over the final six weeks of the regular season. They also are keenly aware of the opportunity presented by a six-game homestand made up of three games each against the Houston Astros and Chicago White Sox, noncontenders with problems greater than the Yankees’.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1319, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/20/sports/SUB-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 