 new coral, diamond and sapphire ring, which took more than 300 hours to design, is truly a one-of-a-kind jewel.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/20/pomellato-rings-haute-joaillerie-collection/', 'snippet': 'Pomellato’s luxurious new coral, diamond and sapphire ring, which took more than 300 hours to design, is truly a one-of-a-kind jewel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If Pomellato quietly cemented its reputation as the everyday jewelry of chic European women long ago, this new cabochon-cut coral ring is the Milanese house’s most decadent party favor. A one-of-a-kind in the company’s Pom Pom haute joaillerie collection, the titanic stone is set in white and rose gold, and surrounded by 141 white diamonds, orange sapphires and red spinels arranged in a mosaic pattern. Requiring more than 300 hours to design, the ring is inspired by the lush equatorial opulence of the 1930s. The only details left to be desired are a black-tie fete and a stiff cosmopolitan.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '146', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/t-magazine/24womens-qual-thing/24womens-qual-thing-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/24/t-magazine/24womens-qual-thing/24womens-qual-thing-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 720}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/t-magazine/24womens-qual-thing/24womens-qual-thing-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 854, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/t-magazine/24womens-qual-thing/24womens-qual-thing-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1707, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'su