-51a0-baa0-0bf4a5b68bc0'}, {'abstract': 'Online voters chose the baby giant panda from the National Zoo in a competition run by the Smithsonian Institution.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/20/smithsonians-most-iconic-item-bao-bao-the-panda/', 'snippet': 'Online voters chose the baby giant panda from the National Zoo in a competition run by the Smithsonian Institution.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The voting has ended in the Smithsonian Institution’s Summer Showdown, a competition to determine what the institution calls the “most iconic item” in its vast collection, and the winner is … Chinese. Bao Bao, a baby giant panda born last year at the National Zoo, has triumphed over three symbols of Americana: the original Star-Spangled Banner, Gilbert Stuart’s portrait of George Washington and Woody Guthrie’s “This Land Is Your Land.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/arts/20artsbeat-panda/20artsbeat-panda-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/21/arts/20artsbeat-panda/20artsbeat-panda-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/arts/20artsbeat-panda/20artsbeat-panda-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/arts/20artsbeat-panda/20artsbeat-panda-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1196, 'width': 1604, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/arts/20artsbeat-panda/20artsbeat-panda-th