ue': 'Peace, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sands, Peter Alexander', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Department of Financial Services (NYS)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Standard Chartered Bank PLC', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-20T16:41:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By George Hay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'George', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d5ca5bd-6115-52c1-a178-eae41041fdf1', 'word_count': 387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d5ca5bd-6115-52c1-a178-eae41041fdf1'}, {'abstract': 'In “Dead Behind These Eyes,” the theater company Sister Sylvester lends a mike and a soundtrack to a set of characters inspired by John Osborne’s “Look Back in Anger.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/24/theater/sister-sylvesters-riff-on-look-back-in-anger.html', 'snippet': 'In “Dead Behind These Eyes,” the theater company Sister Sylvester lends a mike and a soundtrack to a set of characters inspired by John Osborne’s “Look Back in Anger.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Though it has yet to be classified officially as a dangerous weapon, everybody knows that a microphone in the wrong hands is an instrument of torture. Just check out any nearby karaoke bar. Now the site-specific theater company Sister Sylvester has decided to lend a mike and a soundtrack to a seething, internecine set of characters inspired by “Look Back in Anger,” John Osborne’s 1956 drama of high-volume hostility and social alienation. Directed by Kathryn Hamilton, this multimedia riff opens on Aug. 29 at the East Village bar Sing Sing Karaoke under the promisingly disaffected title “Dead Behind These Eyes.” (Previous pieces from Sister Sylvester, which creates dialogues with other works of art, include “Werner Herzog on Wrestlemania.”) Prepare for a night of off-key confessions, slurred lyrics, documentary video projections of a world in strife and bottomless shot glasses. (Through Sept. 19, 81 Avenue A, between Fifth and Sixth Streets; 212-352-3101, sistersylvester.org.)', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE2/24GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE2/24GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE2/24GUIDE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE2/24GUIDE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1357, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE2/24GUIDE2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE2/24GUIDE2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE2/24GUIDE2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tuneful Rage, With Chaser', 'kicker': 'The Week Ahead', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '