ill-do-something/', 'snippet': 'The Metropolitan Museum of Art said the app will offer “a personalized portal to all the events, exhibitions and artworks at the museum.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Metropolitan Museum of Art is introducing a free mobile app for iPhone, iPad and iPod Touch that the museum obliquely describes as “a personalized portal to all the events, exhibitions, and artworks at the museum.” The app will be available from Apple’s App Store on Sept. 2; the museum said on Wednesday that an Android version is planned for 2015.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New App From the Met Museum Will Do … Something', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Museum of Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-20T17:44:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2370089d-e7d1-5e6f-a448-60389169dff8', 'word_count': 220, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2370089d-e7d1-5e6f-a448-60389169dff8'}, {'abstract': 'The Upshot’s election model gives Republicans a 61 percent chance to control the Senate, forecasting that the Democrat Michelle Nunn has only a 12 percent chance to win in Georgia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/21/upshot/georgia-is-the-reason-the-gop-is-edging-up-in-the-overall-senate-race.html', 'snippet': 'The Upshot’s election model gives Republicans a 61 percent chance to control the Senate, forecasting that the Democrat Michelle Nunn has only a 12 percent chance to win in Georgia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Careful observers will notice that our overall forecast for who will win the Senate this fall ticked slightly higher for the Republicans over the past week. After dropping to 54 percent after the release of second-quarter fund-raising totals, it has climbed to 61 percent, the highest number since mid-June for Leo, our election model.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/upshot/21up-georgia-image/21up-georgia-image-articleLarge.png', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/21/upshot/21up-georgia-image/21up-georgia-image-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/upshot/21up-georgia-image/21up-georgia-image-jumbo.png', 'height': 369, 'width': 641, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/upshot/21up-georgia-image/21up-georgia-image-superJumbo.png', 'height': 369, 'width': 641, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/upshot/21up-georgia-image/21up-georgia-image-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/21/upshot/21up-georgia-image/21up-georgia-image-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/upshot/21up-georgia-image/21up-georgia-image-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy'