useum’s director, funds to start the last phase of an effort he helped hatch nearly three decades ago: transforming an abandoned 19th-century factory complex into a destination arts center that could help revive the struggling economy of North Adams.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24SUBMASSMOCO1/24SUBMASSMOCO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24SUBMASSMOCO1/24SUBMASSMOCO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24SUBMASSMOCO1/24SUBMASSMOCO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24SUBMASSMOCO1/24SUBMASSMOCO1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24SUBMASSMOCO1/24SUBMASSMOCO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24SUBMASSMOCO1/24SUBMASSMOCO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24SUBMASSMOCO1/24SUBMASSMOCO1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Big Dreams at the Art Factory', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Big Dreams at the Art Factory', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dobrzynski, Judith H', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Massachusetts Museum of Contemporary Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Adams (Mass)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-20T19:18:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judith H. Dobrzynski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judith', 'middlename': 'H.', 'lastname': 'Dobrzynski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a74b161-7071-59bc-88d0-88f5acffd59e', 'word_count': 1641, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a74b161-7071-59bc-88d0-88f5acffd59e'}, {'abstract': 'A research firm says the income of middle-class American families is lower now, when adjusted for inflation, than when the recovery began five years ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/21/upshot/why-the-middle-class-isnt-buying-talk-about-economic-good-times.html', 'snippet': 'A research firm says the income of middle-class American families is lower now, when adjusted for inflation, than when the recovery began five years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For five years, the United States economy has been expanding at a steady clip, the stock market soaring, the headlines filled with talk of recovery. Yet public opinion polling shows most Americans still think the economy is pretty miserable.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia