'A flexible schedule and an equally flexible employer help make this military spouse’s sometimes solo parenting easier.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dekiema Pogue is an administrative assistant at Bank of America in Virginia Beach, Va., supporting a team of seven in the United States, the United Kingdom and Singapore. She has three children, Daniel, 10, Elijah, 11, and Josiah, 16. Her husband is a chief petty officer in the United States Navy, currently stationed at the base in Virginia Beach but sometimes deployed for months at a time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/us/Dekiema-backseat/Dekiema-backseat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/20/us/Dekiema-backseat/Dekiema-backseat-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/us/Dekiema-backseat/Dekiema-backseat-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/us/Dekiema-backseat/Dekiema-backseat-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/us/Dekiema-backseat/Dekiema-backseat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/20/us/Dekiema-backseat/Dekiema-backseat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/us/Dekiema-bac