 their own relationships and the art of keeping a secret in an age of oversharing.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/t-magazine/20barna-moss/20barna-moss-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/20/t-magazine/20barna-moss/20barna-moss-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/t-magazine/20barna-moss/20barna-moss-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/t-magazine/20barna-moss/20barna-moss-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/t-magazine/20barna-moss/20barna-moss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/20/t-magazine/20barna-moss/20barna-moss-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/20/t-magazine/20barna-moss/20barna-moss-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Elisabeth Moss, Mark Duplass and Charlie McDowell on ‘The One I Love’', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Conversation: Love, Actually', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANDERSON, WES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duplass, Mark', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaufman, Charlie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-20T20:30:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Barna', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barna', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60e8fd8a-c78e-5c9c-b958-ae4af1572b75', 'word_count': 1163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60e8fd8a-c78e-5c9c-b958-ae4af1572b75'}, {'abstract': 'A popular D.J. on the Fire Island Pines is straight (not that there’s anything wrong with that).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/21/fashion/dj-vito-fun-an-in-demand-dj-on-fire-island-pines.html', 'snippet': 'A popular D.J. on the Fire Island Pines is straight (not that there’s anything wrong with that).', 'lead_paragraph': 'At 9 p.m. on a recent Saturday, around a pool below the Boatel on Fire Island Pines, the D.J. Vito Fun was playing Iggy Azalea’s “Fancy” and Katy Perry’s “Dark Horse” for a rousing crowd of about 200. When Deborah Cox’s “Nobody’s Supposed to Be Here” came on, a reveler threw his head back and said, “How perfect is this song right now?”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/fashion/21SUBDJVITO/21zSUBDJVITO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/21/fashion/21SUBDJVITO/21zSUBDJVITO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/fashion/21SUBDJVITO/21zSU