', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2aa6a46-2769-55ef-9f3a-fd10ae947c96', 'word_count': 618, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2aa6a46-2769-55ef-9f3a-fd10ae947c96'}, {'abstract': 'After more than three years on Broadway, this show retains its peppiness and devotion to the musical comedy spirit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/21/theater/the-book-of-mormon-on-broadway-retains-its-charms.html', 'snippet': 'After more than three years on Broadway, this show retains its peppiness and devotion to the musical comedy spirit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Clean living, it would seem, really does keep a body healthy. Just look at those nonsmoking, nondrinking boys in “The Book of Mormon.” They’ve been hanging around in the insalubrious, soul-sapping environs of Broadway for more than three years. Yet they don’t look a day older than when they arrived.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/arts/jpmormon/jpmormon-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/21/arts/jpmormon/jpmormon-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/arts/jpmormon/jpmormon-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/arts/jpmormon/jpmormon-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cre