 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ferrari SpA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mecum Auctions', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bonhams 1793 Ltd', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gooding & Company', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Russo & Steele', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'RM Auctions', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cole, Rick, Auctions', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-20T22:31:05+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Automobiles', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'subsection_name': 'Collectible Cars', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/1ccf56a1-cebe-59d2-9533-73a1bbc87381', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/1ccf56a1-cebe-59d2-9533-73a1bbc87381'}, {'abstract': 'Salvias like Hot Lips and Lady in Red make everything around them look better.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/21/garden/flattering-the-other-flowers.html', 'snippet': 'Salvias like Hot Lips and Lady in Red make everything around them look better.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometimes when I am weeding in the late afternoon, I hear the vibrating wings of the ruby-throated hummingbird before I see it dipping its beak into the long tubular flowers of the blue anise sage (Salvia guaranitica) called Black and Blue for its cobalt-blue petals and near-black calyxes at the base of the flowers. Hummingbirds are shy, but if I remain perfectly still, it is usually so intent on the nectar inside those deep blue trumpets that I can admire it out of the corner of my eye as it backs out of one flower and moves on to another. Then, in a flash of iridescent green and red, it is gone.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/garden/20140821-GARDEN-1/20140821-GARDEN-slide-R237-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/21/garden/20140821-GARDEN-1/20140821-GARDEN-slide-R237-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/garden/20140821-GARDEN-1/20140821-GARDEN-slide-R237-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/garden/20140821-GARDEN-1/20140821-GARDEN-slide-R237-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1335, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/garden/20140821-GARDEN-1/20140821-GARDEN-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/21/garden/20140821-GARDEN-1/20140821-GARDEN-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/21/garden/20140821-GARDEN-1/20140821-GARDEN-1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Flattering the Other Flowers', 'kicker': 'In the Garden', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Flattering the Other Flowers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Raver, Anne', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salvia (Plant)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flowers and Plants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gardens and Gardening', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lacy, Allen', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Herbs', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Linwood (NJ)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-20T22:35:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Raver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Raver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/869ff502-3181-5edf-94b3-60a6cae323e6', 'word_count': 1692, 'uri': 'nyt://article/869ff502-3181-5edf-94b3-60a6cae323e6'}, {'abstract': 'A study found that the number of people arriving in Switzerland from other countries for help with suicide increased steadily from 2009 to 2012.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/21/world/europe/more-people-going-to-switzerland-for-assisted-suicide-study-finds.html', 'snippet': 'A study found that the number of people arriving in Switzerland from other countries for help with suicide increased steadily from 2009 to 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Switzerland has long had a permissive law on assisted suicide, and a new study has found an increase in the number of people from other countries traveling to Switzerland to end their lives under the auspices of right-to-die organizations. The study, published in The Journal of Medical Ethics, looked at assisted suicides in Zurich, where Dignitas, the most prominent right-to-die organization, is based. The researchers found that 611 people from 31 countries had committed assisted suicide from 2008 to 2012. Since 2009, the number of those arriving from other countries for help with suicide has increased steadily, to 172 in 2012. Nearly half of all cases involved people with neurological disorders, like Parkinson’s disease and multiple sclerosis, diagnoses that are generally not terminal. Nearly 60 percent of the 611 were women. People committing assisted suicide came largely from Germany, Britain and France. Twenty-one arrived from the United States: five in 2010, nine in 2011, and seven in 2012.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More People Going to Switzerland for Assisted Suicide, Study Finds', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Switzerland: More Foreigners Drawn by Assisted Suicide Law, Study Shows', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belluck, Pam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Switzerland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Euthanasia and Assisted Suicide', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Journal of Medical Ethics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dignitas', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-20T22:36:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pam Belluck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belluck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b804d294-8a30-53ff-9a7f-2ad27e945298'