stigma surrounding HPV, a common sexually transmitted infection, and to encourage vaccination.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/21/opinion/melissa-mark-viverito-candidly-discusses-hpv.html', 'snippet': 'Speaker Melissa Mark-Viverito uses her prominence to reduce the stigma surrounding HPV, a common sexually transmitted infection, and to encourage vaccination.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The City Council speaker, Melissa Mark-Viverito, told the world via Twitter on Sunday that she was infected with human papillomavirus, a highly common sexually transmitted infection. She is a reticent person, as public officials go, and, even in an age of oversharing, her candor was startling.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The City Council Speaker’s Honesty', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The City Council Speaker’s Honesty', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Papillomavirus (HPV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mark-Viverito, Melissa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City Council (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexually Transmitted Diseases', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-21T00:30:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5ff116c-dcf0-5435-b632-e8b094c7b9f8', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5ff116c-dcf0-5435-b632-e8b094c7b9f8'}, {'abstract': 'A film services c