'word_count': 703, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35aa334c-43f9-56cc-958d-17a85c598b44'}, {'abstract': 'The choreographer Richard Daniels will soon release a fourth installment of his iPhone app, with dances set to music by Stephen Sondheim.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/21/more-dances-for-an-iphone-inspired-by-sondheim/', 'snippet': 'The choreographer Richard Daniels will soon release a fourth installment of his iPhone app, with dances set to music by Stephen Sondheim.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For dance aficionados, Richard Daniels’s series of iPhone apps have been a source of enlightenment and entertainment ever since Dances for an iPhone – a collection of six short dance films, with choreography by Mr. Daniels, that you watch in the palm of your hand – was released. Since then, Mr. Daniels has created two more installments, and on Sept. 1 he will release Dances for an iPhone, Vol. 4, a collection of dances set to the music of Stephen Sondheim, compiled with Mr. Sondheim’s blessing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/arts/21artsbeat-daniels/21artsbeat-daniels-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 943, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/22/arts/21artsbeat-daniels/21artsbeat-daniels-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 943}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/arts/21artsbeat-daniels/21artsbeat-daniels-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 652, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/arts/21artsbeat-daniels/21artsbeat-daniels-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1304, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype'