ls in New York City and the area.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Full reviews of recent dance performances: nytimes.com/dance. A searchable guide to these and other performances is at nytimes.com/events.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dance Listings for Aug. 22-28', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Listings: Dance', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-21T22:28:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fa8b74c-0ed2-51bd-ad29-6ce01bd140e3', 'word_count': 634, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fa8b74c-0ed2-51bd-ad29-6ce01bd140e3'}, {'abstract': 'Ruven Afanador photographed Eugenie Bouchard in a studio in Montreal earlier this month. He recently spoke about how he caught Bouchard’s youth and beauty in a single, leaping shot.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/21/under-cover-eugenie-bouchards-big-moment/', 'snippet': 'Ruven Afanador photographed Eugenie Bouchard in a studio in Montreal earlier this month. He recently spoke about how he caught Bouchard’s youth and beauty in a single, leaping shot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eugenie Bouchard is “a player on the brink,” as Susan Dominus puts it in this week’s cover story. To capture the 20-year-old Canadian tennis player in pictures at this moment of promise, the magazine turned to Ruven Afanador. The Colombian-born photographer has previously shot a number of women for the magazine, including Twyla Tharp, Tyra Banks, Anna Netrebko and Ruth Bader Ginsburg. Kathy Ryan, the magazine’s director of photography, calls him a “great portraitist who knows how to bring out the elegance of shape in a photograph.” Recently he spoke ab