s://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/22/world/europe/exploring-a-world-war-i-battlefield-100-years-later.html', 'snippet': 'A reporter’s grandfather was among the multitudes of German soldiers who stormed into France and Belgium and left some 27,000 French soldiers dead 100 years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MERCY-LE-HAUT, France — Most of the buildings in this tiny village in northeastern France are hidden behind trees that were not here a century ago. But the bell tower of the 150-year-old church of St. Salvin is still visible from a gentle rise about a half-mile away, where more than 6,000 German soldiers aimed their guns across a wheat field on the morning of Aug. 22, 1914.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/world/FAMILY-1/FAMILY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/22/world/FAMILY-1/FAMILY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/world/FAMILY-1/FAMILY-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/world/FAMILY-1/FAMILY-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1019, 'width': 1591, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/world/FAMILY-1/FAMILY-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/22/world/FAMILY-1/FAMILY-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt