thers over the top — have been nearly as compelling. Here, a history of her runway presentations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A History of Sarah Burton’s Inspired Collections and Stage Sets for Alexander McQueen', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-08-22T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0cc9e101-32f4-50ee-9e00-d36db125bff5', 'word_count': 90, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0cc9e101-32f4-50ee-9e00-d36db125bff5'}, {'abstract': 'Loulou de la Falaise was a French icon and an enduring muse to Yves Saint Laurent. With her unstudied style and indefatigable spirit, she also represented everything that is brilliant about fashion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/22/t-magazine/loulou-de-la-falaise-yves-saint-laurent-muse.html', 'snippet': 'Loulou de la Falaise was a French icon and an enduring muse to Yves Saint Laurent. With her unstudied style and indefatigable spirit, she also represented everything that is brilliant about fashion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Loulou de la Falaise was a French icon and an enduring muse to Yves Saint Laurent. With her unstudied style and indefatigable spirit, she also represented everything that is brilliant about fashion.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '234', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/t-magazine/24womens-well-loulou-1/24womens-well-loulou-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'le