 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/23/world/middleeast/steven-sotloff.html', 'snippet': 'Steven J. Sotloff, an American journalist being held by ISIS since last year, was drawn to the tumult of the Middle East for years. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steven J. Sotloff, a 31-year-old freelance journalist, self-described “stand-up philosopher from Miami,” immersed himself in the tumult of the Middle East for years, repeatedly venturing into some of the most hazardous conflict zones. He reassured friends that he knew the risks as he wrote for publications that included Time magazine, The Christian Science Monitor and World Affairs Journal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/world/SOTLOFF/SOTLOFF-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 528, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/world/SOTLOFF/SOTLOFF-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 528, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/world/SOTLOFF/SOTLOFF-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/22/world/SOTLOFF/SOTLOFF-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/world/SOTLOFF/SOTLOFF-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Steven Sotloff, Journalist Held by ISIS, Was Undeterred by Risks of Job', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sotloff, Steven J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Foley, James (1973-2014)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-22T14:43:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone and Shreeya Sinha', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Shreeya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sinha', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/162cc61f-7f35-5006-a46d-ee79c1313b04', 'word_count': 838, 'uri': 'nyt://article/162cc61f-7f35-5006-a46d-ee79c1313b04'}, {'abstract': 'Complaints of misconduct by officers in the 120th Precinct on the North Shore rival those in the Bronx and Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/23/nyregion/fatal-confrontation-heightens-tensions-in-staten-island-police-precinct.html', 'snippet': 'Complaints of misconduct by officers in the 120th Precinct on the North Shore rival those in the Bronx and Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a corner of Staten Island, on a sidewalk across from a tiny triangular park, a fatal police confrontation last month has drawn focus to an area plagued by disorder, and rife with simmering tensions over policing and poverty.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/nyregion/PRECINCTweb4/PRECINCTweb4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 373, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge',