ct': 'William Deresiewicz argues that Ivy League schools graduate narrow-minded students who are later dissatisfied and purposeless.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/24/books/review/excellent-sheep-by-william-deresiewicz.html', 'snippet': 'William Deresiewicz argues that Ivy League schools graduate narrow-minded students who are later dissatisfied and purposeless.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last October, the New York Academy of Medicine hosted a “wonder cabinet” — a day of talks and films about medicine, the human body and much more. As I took my seat for one of the sessions, I recognized two young men sitting near me. They were former students, whose senior theses I had supervised years before. It was fun to learn how they were doing, one in law and one in medical school, and to see that they still found time to hear about 18th-century anatomical models and books bound in human skin. ', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/books/review/24GRAFTONSUB/0824-bks-GRAFTON-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 468, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/24/books/review/24GRAFTONSUB/0824-bks-GRAFTON-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 468}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/books/review/24GRAFTONSUB/0824-bks-GRAFTON-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 799, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/books/review/24GRAFTONSUB/0824-bks-GRAFTON-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1143, 'width': 1465, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '