der, will preside in person over eclectic programming at the Stone this week starting Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/24/arts/music/hal-willner-comes-to-the-stone.html', 'snippet': 'Hal Willner, a producer, collagist and ringleader, will preside in person over eclectic programming at the Stone this week starting Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Through much of his roughly 35-year career, Hal Willner has been the man behind the curtain: a producer, collagist and ringleader satisfied to hang back and savor the results of his design. But he’ll preside in person over the programming at the Stone this week, from Tuesday on, which runs about as eclectic as you might expect. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE6/24GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE6/24GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE6/24GUIDE6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE6/24GUIDE6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE6/24GUIDE6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/24/arts/24GUIDE6/24GUIDE6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank