'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6640154-2496-569b-9825-f276c7d2b99d', 'word_count': 1039, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6640154-2496-569b-9825-f276c7d2b99d'}, {'abstract': 'A variety of inventive apps are devoted to Greek, Latin and the history of Greco-Roman civilization.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/24/books/review/gateways-to-the-classical-world.html', 'snippet': 'A variety of inventive apps are devoted to Greek, Latin and the history of Greco-Roman civilization.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Modern technology has been kind to ancient history. Scholars with iPads and other mobile gadgets can now leave the heavy books at home, opting for a variety of apps devoted to classical studies — Greek, Latin and the history of Greco-\xadRoman civilization — saving time and money in the process.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/books/review/0824-BKS-Applied1/0824-BKS-Applied1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/24/books/review/0824-BKS-Applied1/0824-BKS-Applied1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/books/review/0824-BKS-Applied1/0824-BKS-Applied1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 770, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/books/review/0824-BKS-Applied1/0824-BKS-Applied1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 959, 'width': 1276, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/books/review/0824-BKS-Applied1/0824-BKS-Applied1-thumbStan