bines songs, incidents and anecdotes to create a complete Guthrie experience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/24/nyregion/a-review-of-woody-sez-the-life-and-music-of-woody-guthrie-in-hartford.html', 'snippet': '“Woody Sez: The Life and Music of Woody Guthrie” in Hartford combines songs, incidents and anecdotes to create a complete Guthrie experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The rapper J. Cole may have been the first to respond musically to the events in Ferguson, Mo., but is there any doubt that he won’t be the last? And is there any doubt that whether or not they realize it, these bards are following the example set in the first half of the 20th century by one Woodrow Wilson Guthrie, whose now-classic songs chronicled the Great Depression, the Dust Bowl, the union movement and World War II? ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/nyregion/24ARTSCT1/24ARTSCT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/24/nyregion/24ARTSCT1/24ARTSCT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/nyregion/24ARTSCT1/24ARTSCT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/nyregion/24ARTSCT1/24ARTSCT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1343, 'width': 1870, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/24/nyregion/24ARTSCT1/24ARTSCT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSt