4/08/25/nyregion/deadly-long-island-crash.html', 'snippet': 'The New York State Police said a car carrying five members of a family returning to Brooklyn veered off the Southern State Parkway, struck a tree and burst into flames.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The coming school year promised big things from each of Myriam Lebrun’s three children: a first high school basketball season for Marcus Jeanty, 14, who towered over classmates; a thickening portfolio of cartoon drawings for his 9-year old brother and loyal follower, Marcel Jeanty; and a next chapter in the fledgling modeling career of the ever-glamorous Kayla Jeanty, 8.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/nyregion/25CRASH2sub/25CRASH2sub-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/25/nyregion/25CRASH2sub/25CRASH2sub-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 681}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/nyregion/25CRASH2sub/25CRASH2sub-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 903, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/nyregion/25CRASH2sub/25CRASH2sub-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1481, 'width': 1305, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/nyregion/25CRASH2sub/25CRASH2sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/25/nyregion/25CRASH2sub/25CRASH2sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'