, was said to be recovering from surgery after he, another man and a woman were shot in West Hollywood, Calif.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/25/arts/music/suge-knight-hip-hop-record-executive-shot-at-club.html', 'snippet': 'Marion Knight, known as Suge, a founder of the label Death Row Records, was said to be recovering from surgery after he, another man and a woman were shot in West Hollywood, Calif.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — A billboard advertising Chris Brown’s next album overlooks the east side of the 1Oak nightclub on Sunset Boulevard here, where a party Mr. Brown helped host on Saturday night went from star-studded revelry to chaos to crime scene in less than 24 hours.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/arts/SUB-SUGE/SUB-SUGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/25/arts/SUB-SUGE/SUB-SUGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 706}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/arts/SUB-SUGE/SUB-SUGE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 870, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/arts/SUB-SUGE/SUB-SUGE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1522, 'width': 1293, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/arts/SUB-SUGE/SUB-SUGE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/25/arts/SUB-SUGE/SUB-SUGE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 7