 la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b108d89a-1f4b-513c-bdfd-c7e0f7564583', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b108d89a-1f4b-513c-bdfd-c7e0f7564583'}, {'abstract': 'Get into the spirit of summer’s music festivals by amping up your wardrobe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/25/fashion/sourcing-the-festival-style-spirit.html', 'snippet': 'Get into the spirit of summer’s music festivals by amping up your wardrobe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s something about the Burning Man festival that can spark creativity, from the free spirits frolicking in the desert to the life-size art installations. Traditionally, attendees of the weeklong event heighten what we know as festival style. Theatrical costumes, often handmade, are common, even expected.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Wear This Week: Aug. 25', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sneakers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Burning Man Festival', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kimonos', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-25T10:58:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simone S. Oliver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simone', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Oliver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66f56b81-d465-50f4-a67e-2216ead65daf', 'word_count': 498, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66f56b81-d465-50f4-a67e-2216ead65daf'}, {'abstract': 'Then there was the time we were giving a job offer to a new engineer who asked about our maternity leave policy. The truth was we didn’t have one.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/25/o-k-so-maybe-we-do-need-some-company-policies/', 'snippet': 'Then there was the time we were giving a job offer to a new engineer who asked about our maternity leave policy. The truth was we didn’t have one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I started RJMetrics with my co-founder, Jake Stein, we set out to build a lean, agile company. This was easy in our early days because leanness and agility were about the only things we could afford. When your whole company is two dudes in an attic, shaping culture isn’t terribly hard.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'O.K., So Maybe We Do Need Some Company Policies', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rethinking Need for a Policy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Workplace Environment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moore, Robert J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'RJMetrics Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-25T11:00:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert J. Moore', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Moore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a3ce16d9-8678-51cd-af06-635aafc96c69', 'word_count': 1035, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a3ce16d9-8678-51cd-af06-635aafc96c69'}, {'abstract': 'Daily Clip Report i