964.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAIGON — Bloody religious rioting erupted today [Aug. 25] in the coastal city of Da Nang and an entire Roman Catholic community was demolished by a Buddhist mob. At least 19 persons were reported killed and about 70 injured. The community of 3,000 is on the outskirts of Da Nang, which also was devastated by the rioters. Before the rioters swept down on the neighboring village, most of the Roman Catholic residents had been evacuated. Many embarked in sampans into the South China Sea.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Aug. 26, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1964: Buddhists Raze Catholic Village', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Buddhism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion and Belief', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vietnam War', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-25T15:40:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ff86cdc4-15c9-54de-b219-d2e005077dc0', 'word_count': 93, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ff86cdc4-15c9-54de-b219-d2e005077dc0'}, {'abstract': 'Butterfly meat before stuffing and tying it, or to give it more surface area for cooking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/dining/100000003073314/cooking-techniques-butterflying-meat.html', 'snippet': 'Butterfly meat before stuffing and tying it, or to give it more surface area for cooking.', 'lead_pa