d43-591c-ba88-f43e4fa00827', 'word_count': 456, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47cb2f7c-6d43-591c-ba88-f43e4fa00827'}, {'abstract': 'Turn ratatouille into a meal with farro at the base of a summer big bowl. Top with a poached egg or with cheese.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/29/health/summer-big-bowl-with-farro-and-ratatouille.html', 'snippet': 'Turn ratatouille into a meal with farro at the base of a summer big bowl. Top with a poached egg or with cheese.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ratatouille tastes best the day after you make it, and in the summer, I like to serve it chilled or at room temperature, with a vinaigrette drizzled over the top. Here I turn it into a meal with farro at the base of a summer big bowl. You can top the ratatouille with a poached egg, or simply with crumbled feta or grated Parmesan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/science/29recipehealth/29recipehealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/26/science/29recipehealth/29recipehealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/science/29recipehealth/29recipehealth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/science/29recipehealth/29recipehealth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/science/29recipehealth/29recipehealth-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 