g America” to announce a Prince solo album and a 3rdeyegirl album coming in September.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prince has been unusually busy lately, touring Europe with his band, 3rdeyegirl, starting his own publishing company and negotiating a contract with Warner Brothers, the label that released his earliest albums, in which he gained control of his early master tapes and agreed to return to Warner after an 18-year absence. He has spent some time in the recording studio as well, and released a teaser, “Breakdown,” in April.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/arts/25artsbeat-prince/25artsbeat-prince-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 849, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/26/arts/25artsbeat-prince/25artsbeat-prince-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 849}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/arts/25artsbeat-prince/25artsbeat-prince-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 724, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/arts/25artsbeat-prince/25artsbeat-prince-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1448, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/arts/25artsbeat-prince/25artsbeat-prince-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/26/arts/25artsbeat-prince/25artsbeat-prince-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': No