', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/26/automobiles/monday-motorsports-flawless-ricciardo-scores-formula-one-win-at-spa.html', 'snippet': 'Daniel Ricciardo is the first Australian since 1960 to win at Spa-Francorchamps; Joey Logano wins Sprint Cup race, capping a Nascar sweep for Penske.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Driving a flawless Formula One race on Sunday, Daniel Ricciardo became the first Australian to win at the Belgian Spa-Francorchamps track since 1960. Sir Jack Brabham was the last to claim that honor. Nico Rosberg, the pole position winner, came in a frustrated second, and Valttieri Bottas, of Williams, was third.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/automobiles/26MOTORSPORTS-image/26MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 298, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/26/automobiles/26MOTORSPORTS-image/26MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 298}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/automobiles/26MOTORSPORTS-image/26MOTORSPORTS-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 509, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/automobiles/26MOTORSPORTS-image/26MOTORSPORTS-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 509, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/automobiles/26MOTORSPORTS-image/26MOTORSPORTS-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/26/automobiles/26MOTORSPORTS-image/26MOTORSPORTS-image-thum