verson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Severson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ee0444d-3482-501d-ba44-c134f5aff026', 'word_count': 613, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ee0444d-3482-501d-ba44-c134f5aff026'}, {'abstract': 'InterMune’s merger with Roche may show there is more money to be made in certain drugs as far as Wall Street is concerned, writes Robert Cyran of Reuters Breakingviews.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/08/25/roches-merger-bet-outsmarts-the-ice-bucket-challenge/', 'snippet': 'InterMune’s merger with Roche may show there is more money to be made in certain drugs as far as Wall Street is concerned, writes Robert Cyran of Reuters Breakingviews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Roche’s latest $8 billion merger bet may outsmart the ice bucket challenge. The challenge has become a social media phenomenon to fund research on amyotrophic lateral sclerosis, also known as Lou Gehrig’s disease, and is a great way to raise charitable cash. But the drug made by InterMune, which is being taken over by Roche, treats an obscure yet equally fatal disease with more sufferers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/business/dbpix-roche-1/dbpix-roche-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 386, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/26/business/dbpix-roche-1/dbpix-roche-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 386}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/business/dbpix-roche-1/dbpix-roche-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't