h for men’s wear.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/26/at-the-emmys-seth-meyers-plays-fashion-superman/', 'snippet': 'A tuxedo change between the red carpet and the stage may prove to be a breakthrough for men’s wear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The thing that struck me most about the fashion show Monday night — sorry, the Emmy Awards — was not any particular gown or sartorial faux pas or even the triumph of a single brand. (If you want a recap, I highly recommend my colleague Alexandra Jacobs’s review.) Instead, it was a single men’s wear moment: the lightning-fast switcheroo by Seth Meyers, who swapped a black-lapeled navy Valentino tuxedo, worn on the red carpet, for a single-buttoned midnight blue Ralph Lauren tux for his onstage duties as host. It seemed to herald the true arrival of the men’s wear red carpet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/fashion/26runway/26runway-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/26/fashion/26runway/26runway-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/fashion/26runway/26runway-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/fashion/26runway/26runway-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1414, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/26/fashion/26runway/26runway-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail':