91b8d'}, {'abstract': 'David Mackenzie’s “Starred Up” follows a father and a son who find themselves in the same prison, where power and loyalties are constantly changing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/28/movies/starred-up-a-father-and-son-prison-drama.html', 'snippet': 'David Mackenzie’s “Starred Up” follows a father and a son who find themselves in the same prison, where power and loyalties are constantly changing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The title of “Starred Up,” David Mackenzie’s brutal and boisterous new prison drama, refers to the status of its main character, Eric. Though he is legally still under age, Eric, played with method actor inwardness and movie star magnetism by Jack O’Connell, has been promoted to adult status in the British penal system. It’s not hard to see why. Brawny and athletic, he looks less like a child than like a young bull, and his capacity for violence unnerves even some of the hardened older criminals in whose midst he finds himself.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/multimedia/starred-up/starred-up-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/25/multimedia/starred-up/starred-up-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/multimedia/starred-up/starred-up-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/25/multimedia/starred-up/starred-up-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capti