el fired Tuesday on an Iranian boat in the Persian Gulf in what the Defense Department said was a defensive maneuver.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/world/middleeast/us-fires-on-an-iranian-boat.html', 'snippet': 'A United States Coast Guard vessel fired Tuesday on an Iranian boat in the Persian Gulf in what the Defense Department said was a defensive maneuver.', 'lead_paragraph': ' A United States Coast Guard vessel fired Tuesday on an Iranian boat in the Persian Gulf in what the Defense Department said was a defensive maneuver. The crew of the Iranian craft, a sailing vessel called a dhow, pointed a machine gun at an inflatable Coast Guard boat as it approached during a routine security procedure. Officials said they did not know whether the single warning shot struck the dhow, which left without communicating with the Coast Guard crew, and no Americans were injured, the Defense Department said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Fires on an Iranian Boat', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Fires on an Iranian Boat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huetteman, Emmarie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boats and Boating', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Coast Guard', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Persian Gulf', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T01:07:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, '