 'A day after announcing a reinvigorated commitment in the country, the World Health Organization said it had removed its Ebola response team after an epidemiologist came down with the virus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/world/africa/who-removes-team-from-sierra-leone-after-a-medical-worker-contracts-ebola.html', 'snippet': 'A day after announcing a reinvigorated commitment in the country, the World Health Organization said it had removed its Ebola response team after an epidemiologist came down with the virus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The World Health Organization announced Tuesday that it had removed its Ebola response teams from a region of Sierra Leone that has been hardest hit by the outbreak after a Senegalese epidemiologist there contracted the virus.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'W.H.O. Moves Team in Sierra Leone After a Medical Worker Contracts Ebola', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sierra Leone: Ebola Teams Moved After Worker Is Infected', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fink, Sheri', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sierra Leone', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Doctors Without Borders', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T02:51:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheri Fink', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheri', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fink', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e79d46bb-b266-5a68-94c6-2ebce1fd5cd5', 'word_count': 594, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e79d46bb-b266-5a68-94c6-2ebce1fd5cd5'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Greaves was a co-host of “Black Journal,” the only national TV program on black issues in the 1960s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/arts/william-greaves-a-documentarian-and-pioneering-journalist-dies-at-87.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Greaves was a co-host of “Black Journal,” the only national TV program on black issues in the 1960s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'William Greaves, a producer and director who helped bring an African-American perspective to mainstream America as a host of the groundbreaking television news program “Black Journal” and as a documentary filmmaker, died on Monday at his home in Manhattan. He was 87.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/arts/GREAVES-obit-credit/GREAVES-obit-credit-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/27/arts/GREAVES-obit-credit/GREAVES-obit-credit-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/arts/GREAVES-obit-credit/GREAVES-obit-credit-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 763, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/arts/GREAVES-obit-credit/GREAVES-obit-credit-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1527, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/arts/GREAVES-obit-