was deported several times for his criticisms of the government.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/world/americas/enrique-zileri-crusading-publisher-in-peru-dies-at-83.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Zileri was the former publisher of the nation’s top newsmagazine, and was deported several times for his criticisms of the government.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Enrique Zileri, the former publisher of Peru’s leading newsmagazine, which he called “a symbol of resistance” against censors and dictators and which brought him international honors and deportations by his own government, died on Monday in Lima. He was 83.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/world/ZILERI-obit/ZILERI-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/27/world/ZILERI-obit/ZILERI-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/world/ZILERI-obit/ZILERI-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/world/ZILERI-obit/ZILERI-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/world/ZILERI-obit/ZILERI-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/27/world/ZILERI-obit/ZILERI-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/world/ZILERI-obit/ZILERI-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Enrique Zileri, Stalwart Publisher in Peru, Dies at 83', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Enrique Zileri, 83, Stalwart Publisher in Peru', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zileri, Enrique (1931-2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Douglas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Caretas (Magazine)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Peru', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T02:58:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/a664b1cc-49b7-5a24-9ffc-71e21763526f', 'word_count': 766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a664b1cc-49b7-5a24-9ffc-71e21763526f'}, {'abstract': 'The baroness moved from a career as an actress into the lead role in her family business, producing some of the world’s most renowned Bordeaux.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/world/philippine-de-rothschild-wine-nobility-dies-at-80.html', 'snippet': 'The baroness moved from a career as an actress into the lead role in her family business, producing some of the world’s most renowned Bordeaux.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Philippine de Rothschild, a scion of the vaunted winemaking family who helped mo