g styles, Ferrer dispatched Dzumhur, 10 years his younger, in four sets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/sports/tennis/david-ferrers-maturity-proves-too-much-for-damir-dzumhur-at-us-open.html', 'snippet': 'In a battle of similar playing styles, Ferrer dispatched Dzumhur, 10 years his younger, in four sets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In many ways, Damir Dzumhur craves to be David Ferrer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'David Ferrer’s Maturity Proves Too Much for Damir Dzumhur at U.S. Open', 'kicker': 'Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferrer, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dzumhur, Damir', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T04:50:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': "By Craig O'Shannessy", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Craig', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Shannessy", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1cd3b154-5bcb-5397-990f-70f7fb6aaac7', 'word_count': 484, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1cd3b154-5bcb-5397-990f-70f7fb6aaac7'}, {'abstract': 'Television highlights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/arts/television/whats-on-tv-wednesday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '9:05 P.M. (HBO) VERONICA MARS (2014) She has left the private eye business behind her and has a New York City law firm on the horizon. But then Veronica (Kristen Bell, above) learns that her ex-boyfriend and former adversary, Logan (Jason Dohring), is a suspect in the murder of his rock star girlfriend. So she can’t resist heading back to the town of Neptune to clear him. “It’s hard to believe that Veronica, having matured into the totally together woman you always knew she would become, would honestly want to return to this pitiful small town other than for a visit with Dad,” Manohla Dargis wrote of this film, financed with Kickstarter and directed by Rob Thomas, who created the television series on which it’s based. “She might want to extend that trip and nostalgically break out the Taser. She might even want to tie up some of the ends that have remained loose for the last seven years. But why would you want to go home again when you could just stream it on Amazon?” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Wednesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Wednesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T05:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/1537d72a-efab-5361-9ffe-6aea0ce476a8', 'word_count': 691, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1537d72a-efab-5361-9ffe-6aea0ce476a8'}, {'abstract': 'The TV series about the late Chinese leader Deng Xiaoping reflects President Xi Jinping’s efforts to embrace Deng as a justification and template for his own rule.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/xi-jinping-the-hidden-star-of-a-tv-series-about-deng-xiaoping/', 'snippet': 'The TV series about the late Chinese leader Deng Xiaoping reflects President Xi Jinping’s efforts to embrace Deng as a justification and template for h