ican soccer organizations, including U.S. Soccer and the American Youth Soccer Organization, charging that they and FIFA have been negligent in monitoring and treating head injuries.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Concussion Lawsuit Seeks to Force Rule Changes in Soccer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Concussion Lawsuit Filed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strauss, Ben', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Concussions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Federation of Association Football (FIFA)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Soccer Federation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T14:11:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Strauss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strauss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d773428-852f-5617-a0ee-64b676ed6639', 'word_count': 735, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d773428-852f-5617-a0ee-64b676ed6639'}, {'abstract': 'I fly a lot. When I fly, I recline. I don’t feel guilty about it. And I’m going to keep doing it, unless you pay me to stop.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/28/upshot/dont-want-me-to-recline-my-airline-seat-you-can-pay-me.html', 'snippet': 'I fly a lot. When I fly, I recline. I don’t feel guilty about it. And I’m going to keep doing it, unless you pay me to stop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I fly a lot. When I fly, I recline. I don’t feel guilty about it. And I’m going to keep doing it, unless you pay me to sto