ondacks/', 'snippet': 'Cycle Adirondacks, a weeklong bike tour in upstate New York organized by the Wildlife Conservation Society, will make its debut in August 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A weeklong bike tour in the Adirondack mountain range in upstate New York — meals and accommodations included — is registering riders for its debut next year, Aug. 23 to 29.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/travel/27adirondacks/27adirondacks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/27/travel/27adirondacks/27adirondacks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/travel/27adirondacks/27adirondacks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/travel/27adirondacks/27adirondacks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/travel/27adirondacks/27adirondacks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/27/travel/27adirondacks/27adirondacks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/travel/27adirondacks/27adirondacks-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Bike Tour in the Adirondacks', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bronx Zoo Wildlife Conservation Park', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wildlife Conservation Society', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ADIRONDACK MOUNTAINS (NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Adirondack Park (NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T17:08:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Diane Daniel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Diane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Daniel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99d24cfe-54a9-5ce9-9250-54ae5b265e1c', 'word_count': 226, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99d24cfe-54a9-5ce9-9250-54ae5b265e1c'}, {'abstract': 'After a girl from New Jersey accidentally killed her instructor at a shooting range in Arizona, her parents’ cellphone video caused a worldwide spectacle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/28/us/arizona-firing-range-instructor-killed-by-girl-9-in-accident.html', 'snippet': 'After a girl from New Jersey accidentally killed her instructor at a shooting range in Arizona, her parents’ cellphone video caused a worldwide spectacle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHITE HILLS, Ariz. — The four-hour tours offered by one of the big gun ranges here are a popular tourist attraction. Starting at $200 a person, a bus will pick up visitors at their hotel in Las Vegas, 25 miles to the north, show them Hoover Dam and bring them to a recreational shooting range called Last Stop, where they can fire the weapons of their dreams: automatic machine guns, sniper rifles, grenade launchers. A hamburger lunch is included; a helicopter tour of the nearby Grand Canyon is optional.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A 9-Year-Old at a Shooting Range, a Spraying Uzi and Outrage', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A 9-Year-Old, a Deadly Uzi and Outrage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGee, Kimberley', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santos, Fernanda', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vacca, Charles (1975-2014)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bullets and Burgers', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Arizona Last Stop', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T17:09:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kimberley McGee and Fernanda Santos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kimberley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Fernanda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Santos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50bfdf5f-ddff-5006-bcee-b3b38c5eef7a', 'word_count': 1326, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50bfdf5f-ddff-5006-bcee-b3b38c5eef7a'}, {'abstract': 'Fourth-seeded Agnieszka Radwanska, 21st-seeded Sloane Stephens and 31st-seeded Kurumi Nara were ousted, but Williams had another impressive showing, overpowering Timea Bacsinszky.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/28/sports/tennis/us-open-agnieszka-radwanska-sloane-stephens-maria-sharapova.html', 'snippet': 'Fourth-seeded Agnieszka Radwanska, 21st-seeded Sloane Stephens and 31st-seeded Kurumi Nara were ousted, but Williams had another impressive showing, overpowering Timea Bacsinszky.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As if the theoretical heat of playing in the last Grand Slam tournament of the year were not enough to keep the United States Open interesting, the actual heat added several more degrees of difficulty on Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Open 2014: Venus Williams Easily Escapes Wave of Upsets Arriving With the Heat', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Upsets Arrive With the Heat, but Venus Williams Easily Avoids One', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zinser, Lynn', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Radwanska, Agnieszka', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharapova, Maria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stephens, Sloane', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Venus', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nara, Kurumi', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T17:11:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1505f6ee-2f76-52da-bc0a-4dcf3ad4ce25', 'wo