', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'British Fashion Council', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T18:30:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Labzda and Bon Duke', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Labzda', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Bon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Duke', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6abe4453-dda1-5ae7-af6c-89a56520fd03', 'word_count': 162, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6abe4453-dda1-5ae7-af6c-89a56520fd03'}, {'abstract': 'You may be surprised at how far $25 can take you during a layover in Chicago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/travel/how-i-spent-4-hours-at-ohare.html', 'snippet': 'You may be surprised at how far $25 can take you during a layover in Chicago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So let me tell you about my great trip to Chicago. I saw some cool public art, was wowed by a towering brachiosaurus from the Field Museum of Natural History, had a locally brewed beer at the famed Billy Goat Tavern, ate a masterful Chicago-style hot dog, ordered takeout from a famed local chef, browsed in a local bookstore and bought a gift for my mom that she raved about.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/travel/27-frugal-dog/27-frugal-dog-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/27/travel/27-frugal-dog/27-frugal-dog-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank