orate the new digs, the Valentino creative directors Maria Grazia Chiuri and Pierpaolo Piccoli are debuting a limited edition pair of Rockrunner sneakers inspired by the “I Love New York” emblem.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/valentino-manhattan-flagship-with-a-new-pair-of-kicks/', 'snippet': 'To commemorate the new digs, the Valentino creative directors Maria Grazia Chiuri and Pierpaolo Piccoli are debuting a limited edition pair of Rockrunner sneakers inspired by the “I Love New York” emblem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year, Valentino made real-estate and fashion headlines when it announced plans to take over the former New York\xa0site of the\xa0high-end Japanese department store Takashimaya, on Fifth Avenue in Manhattan. Earlier this month, the three-story flagship store at last opened its doors. To commemorate the new digs, the Valentino creative directors Maria Grazia Chiuri and Pierpaolo Piccoli are debuting a limited-edition, unisex style of Rockrunner sneakers to be sold exclusively at the new location. They sport subtle matte studs, white-on-white camouflage and big red hearts on the heels — the brand’s nod to the classic “I Love New York”\xa0emblem.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/t-magazine/27valentino-bobb/27valentino-bobb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 214, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/27/t-magazine/27valentino-bobb/27valentino-bobb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 214}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/t-magazine/27valentino-bobb/27valentino-bobb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 365, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': N