ttps://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/27/new-features-on-our-site-and-in-the-ios-app/', 'snippet': 'We’re offering a big addition to our puzzle archives and some appetizer-sized puzzles to whet your appetite for our dailies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SPECIAL POST — The New York Times Crossword is happy to announce the restoration of an additional three years of crosswords to our web archive of nearly 8,000 puzzles (coming soon to iOS). Thanks to Jim Horne of Xword Info, solvers can now solve many more puzzles while waiting for the next daily to come out. The New York Times is grateful to Mr. Horne for hosting the 1993-1996 archives for us before we expanded.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Features on Our Site and in the iOS App', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-27T21:42:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7732af5-7143-5c54-8e56-20a26dff17bc', 'word_count': 149, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7732af5-7143-5c54-8e56-20a26dff17bc'}, {'abstract': 'Vick, the backup to Geno Smith, will start in the Jets’ preseason game Thursday night against the Eagles, the team that was willing to forgive his transgressions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/28/sports/football/michael-vick-back-in-philadelphia-expects-a-warm-greeting-against-eagles.html', 'snippet': 'Vick, the backup to Geno Smith, will start in the Jets’ preseason game Thursday night against the Eagles, the team that was willing to forgive his transgressions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — Philadelphia Eagles fans, notorious for once booing Santa Claus and peltin