e/74576b33-2c54-5cb3-9127-ec4b17468e15'}, {'abstract': 'Bob Adelman has devoted his photographic career to making pictures that make a difference. Now, he will have a photographer in residence role at the Library of Congress.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/28/photographs-that-make-a-difference/', 'snippet': 'Bob Adelman has devoted his photographic career to making pictures that make a difference. Now, he will have a photographer in residence role at the Library of Congress.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a philosopher-turned-photographer, Bob Adelman forged a career committed to both social action and aesthetics. When he was not documenting the civil rights movement in the North, he was hanging out with — and taking pictures of — artists like Andy Warhol and Larry Rivers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/blogs/20140827-lens-bob-slide-BTFW/20140827-lens-bob-slide-BTFW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/27/blogs/20140827-lens-bob-slide-BTFW/20140827-lens-bob-slide-BTFW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/blogs/20140827-lens-bob-slide-BTFW/20140827-lens-bob-slide-BTFW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/blogs/20140827-lens-bob-slide-BTFW/20140827-lens-bob-slide-BTFW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1028, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/27/blogs/20140827-lens-bob-slide-BTFW/2014