bout helping a charity?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The surprise story of the silly season, a.k.a. August, has been the “Ice Bucket Challenge” and the many fabulous people allowing themselves to be doused in freezing water for a good cause — and for the amusement of their many online followers and the public. I won’t list them all because, at this stage, you probably know who most of them are.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/28/fashion/28runway/28runway-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 325, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/28/fashion/28runway/28runway-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 325}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/28/fashion/28runway/28runway-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 325, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/28/fashion/28runway/28runway-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 325, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/28/fashion/28runway/28runway-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/28/fashion/28runway/28runway-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/28/fashion/28runway/28runway-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When the ‘Ice Bucket Challenge’ Becomes a Promotional Moment', 'ki