 make life easier, from the Aug. 28, 1967 New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The much-pampered housewife is faced with a selection of household and personal care aids that will, manufacturers hope, spur her to tone up her facial muscles, serve wines at appropriate temperatures and keep her floors shining and carpets shampooed with a battery of machines designed to make all previous models obsolete,” wrote The Times on Aug. 28, 1967.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Throwback Thursday | Life Made Easier in 1967', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-08-28T13:20:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katherine Schulten', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schulten', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33a5be13-c041-502d-94cf-ec93141d8bdc', 'word_count': 183, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33a5be13-c041-502d-94cf-ec93141d8bdc'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: India sends troops to support the British Army in 1914.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/28/1914-india-to-send-men-to-france/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: India sends troops to support the British Army in 1914.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Lord Kitchener made the following announcement in the House of Lords yesterday [Aug. 28]: In addition to the reinforcements that will shortly proceed from this country, the Government has decided that our army in France shall be increased, besides, by other troops from India. The Marquis of Crewe, as Secretary of State for India, said: “We shall find our army on the Continent reinforced by soldiers of first-rate training, and representing an ancient civilization, and we feel certain that if they are called upon, they will give the best possible account of themselves side by side with British troops in encountering the enemy.” (Cheers.) — The New York Herald, European Edition, Aug. 29, 1914 ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/29/blogs/29iht-oldaug29/29iht-oldaug29-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 438, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/29/blogs/29iht-oldaug29/29iht-oldaug29-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 438}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/29/blogs/29iht-oldaug29/29iht-oldaug29-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 512, 'width': 701, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/29/blogs/29iht-oldaug29/29iht-oldaug29-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 512, 'width': 701, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/29/blogs/29iht-oldaug29/29iht-oldaug29-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/29/blogs/29iht-oldaug29/29iht-oldaug29-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/29/blogs/29iht-oldaug29/29iht-oldaug29-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1914: India to Send Men to France', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'conte