ccd43c0d-1671-5baf-870d-74fbc3ef991c'}, {'abstract': 'Dawn Nguyen purchased weapons for a felon, William Spengler, who then killed two firefighters.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/28/will-a-gun-retailer-get-away-with-negligence/', 'snippet': 'Dawn Nguyen purchased weapons for a felon, William Spengler, who then killed two firefighters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dawn Nguyen was scheduled to be sentenced today in federal court for knowingly acting as a straw purchaser of assault weapons that were used in 2012 to kill two firefighters and wound two others, among other victims, in Webster, N.Y. \xa0But late yesterday, her lawyer argued successfully for a delay to challenge the prosecution’s request for a stiffer sentence than the 18 months to two years called for by federal guidelines.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Will a Gun Retailer Get Away With Negligence?', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spengler, William Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brady Center to Prevent Gun Violence', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Webster (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-28T18:01:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Teresa Tritch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Teresa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tritch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99eea12b-9de6-5245-9094-4496ad74402c', 'word_count': 515, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99eea12b-9de6-5245-9094-4496ad74402c'}, {'abstract': 'People make sacrifices for each other when it comes to health, just as they do with family and careers. When both partners develop cancer, it is no exception.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/28/in-sickness-and-in-health-2/', 'snippet': 'People make sacrifices for each other when it comes to health, just as they do with family and careers. When both partners develop cancer, it is no exception.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He was already sitting on the examination table when I walked into the room, and he looked smaller than I had ever seen him. Perhaps it was the way he held his shoulders, or how he didn’t quite meet my gaze. I took his nonverbal cues and greeted him quietly.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/health/well_love/well_love-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/22/health/well_love/well_love-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/health/well_love/well_love-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/health/well_love/well_love-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1242, 'width': 1863, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/health/well_love/well_love-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/22/health/well_love/well_love-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/22/health/well_love/well_love-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height'