word_count': 954, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fbef3af0-363c-5bff-aad8-4b4b832bef71'}, {'abstract': '“Shadows From My Past” explores the Holocaust with personal testimony and interviews with public figures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/29/movies/shadows-from-my-past-a-holocaust-testimonial.html', 'snippet': '“Shadows From My Past” explores the Holocaust with personal testimony and interviews with public figures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The documentary “Shadows From My Past” grew out of an earlier project in which Gita Weinrauch Kaufman, who directed with her husband, Curt Kaufman (he died in 2011), shared letters from family members, many of whom were killed by the Nazis. As a young girl, Ms. Kaufman escaped Vienna for New York. In “Shadows From My Past,” she returns to Austria to see what has changed.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/29/arts/29SHADDOWS/29SHADDOWS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 581, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/29/arts/29SHADDOWS/29SHADDOWS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 581}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/29/arts/29SHADDOWS/29SHADDOWS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 991, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/29/arts/29SHADDOWS/29SHADDOWS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1982, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/29/arts/29SHADDOWS/29SHADDOWS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard