orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/92f4b0d7-1031-5d4f-ace0-1cdf9803a577', 'word_count': 1487, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92f4b0d7-1031-5d4f-ace0-1cdf9803a577'}, {'abstract': 'Answers to questions about friendships, advice and wedding gifts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/31/fashion/on-flings-and-friends.html', 'snippet': 'Answers to questions about friendships, advice and wedding gifts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An old friend has a perennial problem being faithful to girlfriends. His current mate, whom he met while cheating on his former girlfriend, recently discovered a number of his dalliances. She decided to stay with him, but asked me to stop being friends with one of the women he cheated with. (I was not aware of the affair while it was going on, if that matters.) Trouble is, I am not that close with the girlfriend, but I’ve become quite friendly with the woman I’ve been asked to drop. Thoughts?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 's