 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc1ff5b6-7a20-5d8a-b7a8-f6a6b7aabbe3', 'word_count': 466, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc1ff5b6-7a20-5d8a-b7a8-f6a6b7aabbe3'}, {'abstract': 'A warning from the World Health Organization about how the epidemic is going to get worse before it gets better requires an urgent infusion of aid from around the globe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/29/opinion/an-ominous-ebola-forecast.html', 'snippet': 'A warning from the World Health Organization about how the epidemic is going to get worse before it gets better requires an urgent infusion of aid from around the globe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The World Health Organization warned on Thursday that the Ebola epidemic in West Africa, already the largest outbreak ever recorded, is going to get much worse over the next six months, the shortest window in which it might conceivably be brought under control. By then, the organization said, the virus could infect more than 20,000 people, almost seven times the current number of reported cases. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Ominous Ebola Forecast', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Ominous Ebola Forecast', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-29T01:03:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_ma