a bit too short to be shooting it. That’s the postmortem thinking of the proprietor of the Arizona gun range where the pony-tailed youngster lost control of a war weapon in a burst that killed her instructor\xa0Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Height, Not Age, Restrictions at the Firing Range', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hayes, Chris', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bullets and Burgers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-29T17:41:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Francis X. Clines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Francis', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Clines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7ee165c-5a71-53c8-88e7-94ba3b51829b', 'word_count': 209, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7ee165c-5a71-53c8-88e7-94ba3b51829b'}, {'abstract': 'Wheat berries like farro, spelt and kamut are usually associated with cold weather. But they can be used for summer dishes, too. Farro is softer and good for stuffing vegetables. Spelt works well in salads.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/29/just-add-farro/', 'snippet': 'Wheat berries like farro, spelt and kamut are usually associated with cold weather. But they can be used for summer dishes, too. Farro is softer and good for stuffing vegetables. Spelt works well in salads.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wheat berries like farro, spelt and kamut are hearty, and I usually associate them with cool-weather dishes. But I’m working on a pantry cleanout, as I do every summer, and I found a number of half-filled bags that needed my attention. I cooked up b