ww.nytimes.com/2014/08/31/nyregion/and-a-box-of-tissues.html', 'snippet': 'It took Sebastian Zimmermann, a psychiatrist on the Upper West Side, 13 years to produce “Fifty Shrinks,” a book of portraits depicting “therapists in their natural habitats.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s something you rarely see: New York psychotherapists in their offices in August. It took Sebastian Zimmermann, a psychiatrist on the Upper West Side, 13 years to produce “Fifty Shrinks,” a book of portraits depicting “therapists in their natural habitats.” Dr. Zimmermann, who began studying photography as an outlet to counterbalance all the trauma and drama he was taking in as a therapist, said he was struck by the diversity of spaces in which his colleagues worked.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'And a Box of Tissues', 'kicker': 'Album', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'And a Box of Tissues', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zimmermann, Sebastian', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychiatry and Psychiatrists', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychology and Psychologists', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Fifty Shrinks (Book)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-29T19:50:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Leland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d91b950-6f6f