d_count': 708, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d129aad0-f8e8-550f-b072-0616a1474527'}, {'abstract': 'If my rating goes lower, Uber won’t pick me up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/31/sunday-review/ouch-my-personality-reviewed.html', 'snippet': 'If my rating goes lower, Uber won’t pick me up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE other week I was riding crosstown in an Uber car, chatting with the very nice driver about how much I liked Uber, and the driver said, by way of being helpful, I believe, “You have a 4.5 rating. If it drops to 4.0, no driver will pick you up.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/sunday-review/0831EPHRON/0831EPHRON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 871, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/31/sunday-review/0831EPHRON/0831EPHRON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 871}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/sunday-review/0831EPHRON/0831EPHRON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 706, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/sunday-review/0831EPHRON/0831EPHRON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1412, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/sunday-review/0831EPHRON/0831EPHRON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/31/sunday-review/0831EPHRON/0831EPHRON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cred