of the Lobster Legs', 'kicker': 'Noted', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Invasion of the Lobster Legs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Alex', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-29T23:22:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/704c93db-27a6-5b41-9667-8234512fa1e5', 'word_count': 734, 'uri': 'nyt://article/704c93db-27a6-5b41-9667-8234512fa1e5'}, {'abstract': 'John Severson’s book celebrates an envious lifestyle as it tweaks the noses of the encroaching status-conscious types.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/31/fashion/john-seversons-new-book-on-surf-culture.html', 'snippet': 'John Severson’s book celebrates an envious lifestyle as it tweaks the noses of the encroaching status-conscious types.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s been easy to forget these days — this summer — what it was supposed to be about. How could it not be when we’ve just gotten a glimpse of the world’s first $1.3 million surfboard? Or when the brokerage firm Scottrade runs television ads with a surfer-investor equating stock picks with wave selection? Then there’s this new Brooks Brothers ad that has some stylized Biff in a sweater carrying a board under his woolly arm.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/fashion/31SURFSPAN/31SURFSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/30/fashion/31SURFSPAN/31SURFSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/fashion/31SURFSPAN/31SURFSPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/fashion/31SURFSPAN/31SURFSPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1331, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/fashion/31SURFSPAN/31SURFSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/30/fashion/31SURFSPAN/31SURFSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/fashion/31SURFSPAN/31SURFSPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Memories Come Back in Waves', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Memories Come Back in Waves', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surfing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rutenberg, Jim', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Severson, John (1933- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Surfer (Magazine)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "John Severson's Surf (Book)", 'rank': 6, 'maj