3e29c-0962-51c7-b1ba-97a8eb0d4ccd'}, {'abstract': 'At Luce, a Mediterranean-themed steak-pasta-seafood emporium in Middletown celebrating its 10th anniversary next year, execution, rather than innovation, is the aim.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/31/nyregion/a-review-of-luce-in-middletown.html', 'snippet': 'At Luce, a Mediterranean-themed steak-pasta-seafood emporium in Middletown celebrating its 10th anniversary next year, execution, rather than innovation, is the aim.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When exactly did Middletown become cool? Its spacious Main Street, sunlit and broad like a Midwestern town, seems an unlikely setting for culinary bohemianism. Yet it’s crammed with different kinds of restaurants — Vietnamese, Tibetan, Mexican; a diner; a pizza-and-bourbon joint; a vegetarian place; and on and on. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/nyregion/31DINECT3/31DINECT3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/31/nyregion/31DINECT3/31DINECT3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 522}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/nyregion/31DINECT3/31DINECT3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 891, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/nyregion/31DINECT3/31DINECT3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1781, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/nyregion/31DINECT3/31DINECT3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_na