Preso,” by the salsa group Fruko y Sus Tesos, rang throughout Citi Field. It seemed to be an attempt to welcome Herrera, the Mets’ 20-year-old second baseman, or at least ease his transition in some way.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/sports/30Mets/30Mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/30/sports/30Mets/30Mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/sports/30Mets/30Mets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/sports/30Mets/30Mets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1386, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/sports/30Mets/30Mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/30/sports/30Mets/30Mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/sports/30Mets/30Mets-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rookie’s Bumpy Debut Is Still a Mets Victory', 'kicker': 'Mets 4, Phillies 1', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rookie’s Bumpy Debut Is Still a Mets Victory', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 