es on the sidewalk and chased each other through the street. They darted around families pushing strollers, diners sitting at painted picnic tables and weary commuters trudging home from the Grove Street PATH station a block away.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/nyregion/30JERSEY1/30JERSEY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/30/nyregion/30JERSEY1/30JERSEY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/nyregion/30JERSEY1/30JERSEY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/nyregion/30JERSEY1/30JERSEY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/nyregion/30JERSEY1/30JERSEY1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/30/nyregion/30JERSEY1/30JERSEY1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/nyregion/30JERSEY1/30JERSEY1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Echoing Times Square, Downtown Jersey City Gets a No-Car Zone', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Echoing Times Square, Downtown Jersey City Gets a No-Car Zone', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chaban, Matt V', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jersey City (NJ)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pedestrian Malls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fulop, Steven M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-30T03:11:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt A.V. Chaban', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'V', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/affc9ae9-11ec-547c-b9f1-deee522b50e5', 'word_count': 1011, 'uri': 'nyt://article/affc9ae9-11ec-547c-b9f1-deee522b50e5'}, {'abstract': 'Kraft, who spent 12 seasons as the Wildcats’ head coach, took them to the N.C.A.A. tournament six times.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/30/sports/jack-kraft-villanova-basketball-coach-dies-at-93.html', 'snippet': 'Kraft, who spent 12 seasons as the Wildcats’ head coach, took them to the N.C.A.A. tournament six times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jack Kraft, who brought Villanova University to national basketball prominence in his 12 seasons as the Wildcats’ head coach and took them to the 1971 N.C.A.A. tournament championship game, died on Thursday at an assisted living facility in Cape May Court House, N.J. He was 93.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/30/sports/kraft-obit/kraft-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_