tigation-at-saratoga.html', 'snippet': 'There have been 11 horse deaths so far at the Saratoga meeting that ends Monday, up from eight last year, said Scott E. Palmer, the New York State equine medical director.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There have been 11 horse deaths so far at the Saratoga meeting that ends Monday, up from eight last year, said Scott E. Palmer, the New York State equine medical director. He said in a statement that “a thorough investigation of all of the racing fatalities during the 2014 Saratoga meet is being conducted.” ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Investigation at Saratoga', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Horse Racing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Investigation at Saratoga', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palmer, Scott E', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Saratoga Race Course', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-30T04:14:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/6dedcb5f-3a5c-516e-99ef-ce98ccebf156', 'word_count': 54, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6dedcb5f-3a5c-516e-99ef-ce98ccebf156'}, {'abstract': 'Chris Kermode, who was appointed the ATP’s executive chairman and president last year, said the men’s game was in the healthiest position it had ever been in.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/30/sports/tennis/inheriting-a-successful-tour-new-atp-chief-looks-to-the-future.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Kermode, who was appointed the ATP’s executive chairman and president last year, said the men’s game was in the healthiest position it had ever been in.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After the death of Brad Drewett last year, the ATP appointed\xa0Chris Kermode as its\xa0executive chairman and president. Kermode, 49, was a player on the lower tiers of tennis before serving as the director of two tournaments in his hometown, London.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Inheriting Successful Tour, New ATP Chief Looks to the Future', 'kicker': 'Q. and A.', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Assn of Tennis Professionals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-30T04:39:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c53b6ac-86fc-5f9d-83d6-352fd504f685', 'word_count': 1230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c53b6ac-86fc-5f9d-83d6-352fd504f685'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, August 30, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/08/30/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-saturday-august-30-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, August 30, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“She still has her bedroom. She slept there last night and will sleep there again tonight.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, August 30, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-08-30T04:44:00+0000', 'document_