nist Party of China', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-31T09:08:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Buckley and Michael Forsythe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Forsythe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c792b75-fe82-5e54-8be9-8faaf0650b8f', 'word_count': 1509, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c792b75-fe82-5e54-8be9-8faaf0650b8f'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Britain starts preparing for war in 1939.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/31/1939-britain-on-war-basis-with-reservists-called-navy-fully-mobilized-telephone-connection-cut/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: Britain starts preparing for war in 1939.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Britain, with its Navy completely mobilized and all Army reservists called up, was on a war basis tonight [Aug. 31]. A rigid press censorship was put in force during the day and all telephonic connections with foreign countries were cut. Evacuation of children, sick persons and invalids from London will begin tomorrow. A decree was promulgated tonight making it a violation of the law for a person to purchase more than one week’s supply of food at one time. The decree announcing the new military measures follows: “Following the measures already adopted, it has been decided to complete the naval mobilization and to call up the remainder of the reserves and supplementary reserves of the Regular Army. New effectives of the volunteer reserves of the Army of the Air will also be called up. The officers and men will await further instructions which will be made public immediately by each of the three Ministries concerned.” — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Sept. 1, 1939', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1939: Britain on War Basis With Reservists Called, Navy Fully Mobilized, Telephone Connection Cut', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-08-31T10:08:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b687626-8c70-52a1-bab0-416a2bb66e4e', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b687626-8c70-52a1-bab0-416a2bb66e4e'}, {'abstract': 'The annual event draws more than 50,000 people to the Nevada desert — many of them from the tech industry in San Francisco. And while they’re away, the city’s hard-to-get-into restaurants and bars aren’t so hard to get into.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/31/san-francisco-exhales-during-burning-man-exodus/', 'snippet': 'The annual event draws more than 50,000 people to the Nevada desert — many of them from the tech industry in San Francisco. And while they’re away, the city’s hard-to-get-into restaurants and bars aren’t so hard to get into.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — As the annual Burning Man festival wrapped up over the holiday weekend, thousands of weary festivalgoers were somewhere in Nevada packing up yurts, washing off body paint and dreading their eventual re-entry to the real world. Here, particularly in the city’s rapidly gentrifying Mission District, their neighbors were dreading something else: the moment the “Burners” come home. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/business/31bits-man/31bits-man-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/08/31/business/31bits-man/31bits-man-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/business/31bits-man/31bits-man-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/business/31bits-man/31bits-man-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1106, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/business/31bits-man/31bits-man-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/08/31/business/31bits-man/31bits-man-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/08/31/business/31bits-man/31bits-man-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'San Francisco Exhales During ‘Burning Man Exodu