le/a55b59be-31a9-5f7c-bcff-f6b114f3025c'}, {'abstract': 'The film is projected to take in $21.2 million over the four-day holiday weekend, for a five-week domestic total of $279.5 million.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/08/31/guardians-of-the-galaxy-stays-on-top/', 'snippet': 'The film is projected to take in $21.2 million over the four-day holiday weekend, for a five-week domestic total of $279.5 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The runaway hit “Guardians of the Galaxy” will repeat as the No. 1 movie in North America over a quiet Labor Day weekend, as two new wide-release films arrived with meager results. “Guardians of the Galaxy” (from the Disney-owned Marvel) is projected to take in $21.2 million over the four-day holiday, for a five-week domestic total of $279.5 million, according to studio estimates released on Sunday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/ARTS01/ARTS01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 344, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/ARTS01/ARTS01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 344}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/ARTS01/ARTS01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 587, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/ARTS01/ARTS01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1175, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/ARTS01/ARTS01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/01