act': 'The star shortstop had a chance to tie the game in the ninth inning after a 3-0 Yankees lead evaporated, but a lineout to second base ended it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/01/sports/baseball/blue-jays-rally-past-yankees-with-barrage-of-home-runs.html', 'snippet': 'The star shortstop had a chance to tie the game in the ninth inning after a 3-0 Yankees lead evaporated, but a lineout to second base ended it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — Before Sunday’s game, which was almost certainly the last regular-season engagement here for Derek Jeter, the Toronto Blue Jays presented him with a special gift for his impending retirement: an all-expenses-paid trip to the resort town Banff, Alberta, including a helicopter tour of the Canadian Rockies, cooking lessons from the Jays’ executive chef and either skiing or golf tutorials, depending on the season.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1440, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't