go Opera is engaging in a rescue mission, hoping to prove that opera can still thrive not only in San Diego but across the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/01/arts/music/san-diego-opera-downsizes-to-survive.html', 'snippet': 'After a near collapse, the San Diego Opera is engaging in a rescue mission, hoping to prove that opera can still thrive not only in San Diego but across the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN DIEGO — The offices of the San Diego Opera once filled the penthouse atop the Civic Center Plaza, with 12-foot ceilings and sweeping views of this city and its harbors. No more. These days, opera executives toil away in the decidedly less glamorous former offices of the public defender, with hallways stacked with boxes and unhung pictures lined against the walls.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/SDOPERAjp/SDOPERAjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/SDOPERAjp/SDOPERAjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 553}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/SDOPERAjp/SDOPERAjp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 945, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/SDOPERAjp/SDOPERAjp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1889, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/SDOPERAjp/SDOPERAjp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail':