 of “Red Eye of Love,” by the Tony winners Ted Sperling and John Wulp, is already a victory of sorts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/09/01/theater/for-red-eye-of-love-musical-curtain-will-finally-rise.html', 'snippet': 'The musical revival of “Red Eye of Love,” by the Tony winners Ted Sperling and John Wulp, is already a victory of sorts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The spring he turned 50, John Wulp won a Tony Award as a producer of “Dracula,” a show he shepherded from Nantucket, Mass., to Broadway. That was 1978, the high point, so far, of his career in theater. But Mr. Wulp, who is 86 and has lived since the ’90s on an island in Maine, can be a very persistent man.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/REDEYEjp/REDEYEjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/REDEYEjp/REDEYEjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/REDEYEjp/REDEYEjp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/REDEYEjp/REDEYEjp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1562, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/REDEYEjp/REDEYEjp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/09/01/arts/REDEYEjp/REDEYEjp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 